('c1122c32-fd95-4ead-9843-260fee51614a', 'VNT-ELE-0001', 'Devil Eyes LED Car Window Light', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 14, 12, 16, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1791293006_ded7fa471bb5a77d350e.avif","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1791293006_2fd3ef805fe9a98c73c1.avif","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1791293006_5ba883d88b8d7587f0a9.avif","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1791293006_f7d02ce1ee45e8fdb0d7.avif","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1791293006_100650d070f2882fcc1d.webp"]', 'Devil Eyes LED Car Window Light', '【Bold Animated Devil Eyes Display】Turn your rear or side window into a striking custom accent with this solar Devil Eyes LED car window light. The animated devil eye effect adds a bold, attention-grabbing look that makes your vehicle stand out at night while adding a fun and distinctive visual upgrade for daily driving, car meets, or parked display.\n• 【Solar & USB Rechargeable Power】Designed for convenient daily use, this Devil Eyes car window light supports both solar charging and USB rechargeable power. The built-in solar panel helps charge during the day, while the USB option gives you a reliable backup when needed. No hardwiring, no battery replacement, and no drain on your vehicle battery.\n• 【No Drill Suction Cup Installation】Skip the tools and complicated setup. This devil eye light features a wireless no-drill design with suction cup mounting for quick installation on rear windshields, side windows, or other smooth auto glass surfaces. It attaches securely, removes easily, and helps you customize your vehicle without permanent modification.\n• 【Smart Sensor & Multiple Light Modes】Built with convenient smart control, this animated car window light can automatically activate in low-light conditions and offers multiple lighting modes to match your style. Switch between different flashing and breathing effects with ease to create the look you want for night driving, parking displays, or automotive decoration.\n• 【Universal Fit & Waterproof Build】Made for a wide range of vehicles, this LED car window light is suitable for cars, SUVs, trucks, vans, and RVs. The compact design works well on rear or side windows, while the waterproof housing and energy-efficient LED construction help deliver reliable performance for everyday automotive use in different weather conditions.', 0, 0, 0),
('a54ff6f3-23bc-412a-862c-778474d626f6', 'VNT-ELE-0002', 'K007 Vacuum Suction Phone Mount for Car', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 12, 10, 17, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1790845735_a8d155cdce13f88ff694.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1790845735_dfac6251005c1dac560f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1790845735_acaedccbaec610ad7670.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1790845735_8ec1c34cc4075940f152.jpg"]', 'K007 Vacuum Suction Phone Mount for Car', 'Powerful Magnetic Grip – Built with upgraded magnets to hold your phone securely.\n• Vacuum Suction Cup – Strong suction base provides a stable hold on dashboards, windshields, glass, and other smooth surfaces.\n• Adjustable Rotation – Ball joint design allows easy adjustment for the perfect viewing angle during navigation or calls.\n• Compatibility – Works with all smartphones, including iPhone, Samsung Galaxy, Huawei, Google Pixel, and more (metal ring included).\n• Easy to Install & Remove – One-step lock system for quick setup; leaves no residue when removed. Compact and stylish design fits any car interior.', 0, 0, 0),
('7261f62f-7f48-4e91-950f-b398045b5079', 'VNT-ELE-0003', 'Vlogging Camera, Mini Camcorder, Portable Handheld Video Camera', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 150, NULL, 18, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61j+2UC2QrL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2d7063.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61nLzY5HcZL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2d9898.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71GBneLfraL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2def73.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71Mdthr0ZyL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2e482f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/611IDMO-mBL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2e9f15.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/617PlHfVTAL._AC_SL1500__6ab535f2eef59.jpg"]', 'Vlogging Camera, Mini Camcorder, Portable Handheld Video Camera', '【Mini Camcorder, Pocket Size Design】: Measuring only 5.35 × 1.56 inches, this handheld video camera easily fits in your pocket or bag. Designed for travel, daily recording, and spontaneous moments, it delivers a simple way to capture life anywhere.\n• 【One-Button Recording, Ready Out of the Box】: Start recording instantly with no app download, no QR code, and no complicated setup. Includes a 32GB memory card, making this mini video camera perfect for beginners, travelers, and everyday creators.\n• 【7-Hour Long Battery Life】: Built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery supports up to 7 hours of continuous recording. Ideal as a travel camcorder, handheld video camera, outdoor recorder, or long-form vlogging camera without frequent charging.\n• 【180° Rotating Lens for Vlog & Self Recording】: 180° Rotating Lens for POV & Self-Recording（(manual rotation required）,Capture POV shots, selfies, and hands-free style videos with the flexible rotating lens. A compact alternative to bulky cameras for content creators, travelers, and anyone who enjoys simple everyday recording.\n• 【Designed for Everyday Moments】:While it is not designed to deliver DSLR-level image quality, its charm lies in capturing effortless and fun moments.This compact camera is made for simple and fun everyday recording, travel memories, and creative moments. For users looking for an easy-to-carry camera rather than bulky professional equipment. CGXUED products include an 18-month warranty and lifetime technical support. Have any questions? Just contact customer service!', 0, 0, 0),
('b1a2ef63-3ac8-4f01-8a6a-edfaa919fe1c', 'VNT-ELE-0004', 'Body Camera with 180° Rotating Lens', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 77, 65, 19, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51i4Amz2P5L._SL1500__6ab265c16e809.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61hkzD0Go0L._SX679__6ab265c1732d0.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71ANGx6-y4L._SL1500__6ab265c173e02.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71dQ7HvrLdL._SL1500__6ab265c1790c9.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71v-kyFc5TL._SL1500__6ab265c17de15.jpg"]', 'Body Camera with 180° Rotating Lens', '【1080P HD Hidden Camera with 120°Lens】 The Mini WIFI camera works with 1920*1080P MP4 video recording at 30 fps.With 120° lens,this hidden camera captures high quality images in wide angle.Meanwhile,this mini WIFI hidden camera can be used with 2.4GHz WIFI,which allows you to use it in wireless.\n• 【Upgraded Night Vision】With 6PCs Invisible infrared LEDs,Hidden mini camera supports night vision with the distance up to 16 feets even in the dark.Advanced CMOS sensor in this hidden camera can record motions 16 feets away,you can set sensor sensitivity manually.Sign in the APP, which will notice you if it detects any motions,and automatically starts recording. Once a motion is detected, the mini hidden camera will send alerts with videos to your mobile.\n• 【Motion Detection Alarm】Hidden camera can intelligently detect motion and record data immediately when someone breaks into your home or office, without worrying about losing important evidence. Alert notifications are instantly pushed to your mobile app, so you never miss an important moment.\n• 【Loop recording and Battery Operated】This wireless camera supports 24/7 loop recording all the time.If TF card in this camera is full,this hidden cam starts overwrite the oldest files.With a built-in 240 mAh rechargeable lithium battery, when all functions ON,this mini cam lasts about 4 hours. If on Stand by mode, it works about 12 hours after fully charged.For long time running, this mini camera can be charged all the time by the supplied cable.\n• 【Easy Setup and Operation】This Mini Small Hidden Camera can be easily set up within minutes, with no technical expertise required. Simply connect it to your wireless network and monitoring right away.\n• 【Getting this mini camera for your home】The Mini camera can be mounted at any place that in need .Being preferable to set up for your home security, warehouse,bedroom,lobby and offices etc. Providing you a access to have a look at your pet when you leave it at home. Also it\'s awesome make it as a nanny cam for your children.', 0, 0, 1),
('b6f4250b-d825-44d2-a32c-b1214874d92e', 'VNT-ELE-0005', 'Upgrade USB Electric Water Powered Ear Cleaner', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 108, 90, 20, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71v7qM2m03L._AC_SL1500__6ab25f2d4324e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71zn8tCIRsL._AC_SL1500__6ab25f2d48bb9.jpg"]', 'Upgrade USB Electric Water Powered Ear Cleaner', 'Integrated Dual Tank】：Ear wax removal system has a unique 2in1 tank design, which is an improvement. Traditional ear cleaner only have one clean water tank and require an additional water basin to receive water，The water flow and the dirt are processed separately, the whole process is clean and hygienic, and the water stains are prevented from overflowing, which makes it safer to use.\n• 【4 Cleaning Modes 】: Our Earwax Removal Kit offers four different cleaning modes (Gentle,Powerful,Pulse,Customizable), with water columns shooting out from all four directions to provide comprehensive care for your ears, keeping them comfortable and healthy and dissolve ear wax, effectively protecting the eardrum from damage, and effectively best ear wax removal.\n• 【Ultra Long Battery Life and Waterproof IPX7】: The battery capacity of this Ear Wax Removal Tool is 1200 mAh, which can wash 200 times on a single charge. The high-quality control IC ensures the stability of the circuit board water pump and superior product quality, meeting the IPX7 waterproof standard. The entire Ear Cleaning has waterproof function, making it convenient for you to use in the shower. Please use warm water close to human body temperature (37 ° C ± 2 ° C) to avoid hearing discomfort or dizziness.\n• 【Ultra Quiet Design】: Ear cleaner water jet equipped with advanced silent motors, the working noise is as low as 60 decibels, and it runs almost silently, allowing you to clean your ears without being disturbed by noise and enjoy a more comfortable and quiet experience.\n• 【Fast Operation & Healthy Hygiene】: Electric Ear Wax Removal Kit no need for any complicated operation, just press the switch to start the automatic cleaning process. Ear cleaners built-in intelligent system automatically adjusts the water flow and pressure to ensure that the cleaning process is simple, safe and efficient. The nozzle can be disinfected with 75% alcohol, Avoid cross infection. The 200ml water tank design is easy to disassemble and very easy to clean', 0, 1, 0),
('929de7d7-6c77-40e4-8151-689b41fa42c5', 'VNT-ELE-0006', 'Portable Air Suction Safety Tool for Home & Travel', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 80, NULL, 21, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/p5_6aae84bd28e00.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/p4_6aae84bd2976c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/p3_6aae84bd29fbb.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/p2_6aae84bd2a627.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/p1_6aae84bd2ab92.jpg"]', 'Portable Air Suction Safety Tool for Home & Travel', 'Portable Inhalation Safety Tool: Suitable for different groups from children to adults, with appropriate face shields, can be used in critical situations\n• Easy to Use and User-Friendly Design: One click trigger for self-service operation, early loading, only need to press the button to complete the suction process when needed. In emergency situations, choked individuals can operate on their own without the help of others\n• Safety Kit: Portable, compact, non electric, reusable, battery free, easy to store and maintain. Simple inhalation design, specifically designed to handle unexpected situations at home or when going out.\n• Professional Counterflow Scientific Design: Only suction without air supply, saving the risk of objects being pressed deeper into the airway during operation, further exacerbating the situation\n• Preloading Can be Quickly Implemented: instantaneous completion of airway foreign body suction pressure stable control at around 33KPA *', 0, 0, 0),
('f53642e1-b5f1-4341-a047-3fd9c1e88483', 'VNT-ELE-0007', 'Smart Tasbih Zikr Ring, i Tasbih Salam', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 49, 40, 22, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t1_6aa7668099496.jpg"]', 'Smart Tasbih Zikr Ring, i Tasbih Salam', 'Smart Tasbih Zikr Ring, i Tasbih Salam, Digital Tasbeeh Counter with OLED Display & APP Support with Magnetic Charging Muslim Islamic Ring, Waterproof Finger Counter for Muslims, Prayer\n•  Digital Zikr Counter with OLED Display – Track your tasbeeh counts clearly on a bright, easy-to-read screen.\n•  Smart App Support (iTasbih App) – Connect via Bluetooth to manage zikr history, set prayer times, and receive reminders.\n•  Magnetic Charging – Comes with a compact magnetic charger for hassle-free recharging.\n•  Built-in Prayer Reminder – Set daily reminders for salah and adhkar right from the app.\n•  Waterproof Design (IP67) – Wear your smart tasbeeh ring comfortably in all conditions, including wudu.\n•  Ergonomic & Stylish – Lightweight and comfortable to wear all day with a modern Islamic design.', 1, 0, 0),
('afb97df3-db66-4c44-8595-473269dc2ab7', 'VNT-ELE-0008', 'Cordless Bald Head Shaver for Men 7D', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 55, 45, 23, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w6_6aa5672f72984.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w5_6aa5672f7515d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w4_6aa5672f7a883.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w3_6aa5672f80650.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w2_6aa5672f85914.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/w1_6aa5672f8af53.jpg"]', 'Cordless Bald Head Shaver for Men 7D', '5 in 1 Mens Electric Shaver Set: Our head shavers for bald men contains 5 accessories: Head/Beard Shaver, Nose/Ear Hair Trimmer, Hair Clipper(3/5/7mm), Facial Massage Brush, Facial Cleaning Brush. Accessories can be freely replaced. This head shaver can meet all your hair trimming and facial care needs. It will bring you efficient and comfortable grooming experience.\n• Upgraded 7D Electric Razor: This bald head shaver adopts 7 floating heads and double ring blades. The sharp blades help you clean hair precisely, quickly and smoothly, reducing skin irritation. 7 heads can increases the shaving area. Perfectly fits the skin and contours of your head, face, neck. Easy to use and comfortable.\n• IPX6 Waterproof Wet & Dry Use: Mens head shaver adopts IPX6 waterproof technology, the entire body is washable. You can use it with shaving cream in the shower and give you a refreshing shaving experience. Just open the cutter head and put razors under the tap to clean, very simple and convenient!\n• USB Charging & LED Display: Our electric razor for men supports various USB devices for charging, 1.5 hours of charging and 60 minutes of battery life. You can use it while charging. Shavers for men with LED smart display, can clearly see the battery percentage. Long press for 3 seconds to lock, travel with confidence and avoid accidents.\n• Best Gifts and Service Guarantee: Rechargeable electric shavers designed for men who like to shave heads and beards. You can give it as a gift to friends or family. Enriching their life, save money and time. We promise a 3 year warranty, if there is any problem with the shaver, please feel free to contact us.', 0, 0, 1),
('8f355567-6bd9-4bcd-a1fa-40ca903c6bc2', 'VNT-ELE-0009', 'RAF 3 in 1 Rechargeable Shaver with Floating Magnetic Blade', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 42, NULL, 24, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r6_6aa5667c2f712.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r5_6aa5667c30875.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r4_6aa5667c3143d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r3_6aa5667c3221c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r2_6aa5667c32dfb.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/r1_6aa5667c33ae2.jpg"]', 'RAF 3 in 1 Rechargeable Shaver with Floating Magnetic Blade', 'The 3-in-1 electric shaver is designed to give you a comfortable and precise shaving experience. It uses a floating magnetic blade that adapts to the contours of your face to ensure a smooth, irritation-free shave. With its practical design and rechargeable battery, it\'s suitable for everyday use and travel, offering consistent performance and ease of use.\nFeatures & Specifications\n• 3-in-1 Shaving and Trimming Design\n• Magnetic Blade System for a Perfect Face Fit\n• Magnetic Suction Blades\n• Smooth and Comfortable Shave\n• USB Charging\n• Easy to Use and Clean\n• Suitable for Daily Use\n• Brand: RAF\n• SKU: HESF0132\nWhat\'s in The Box\n• RAF 3 in 1 Rechargeable Shaver with Floating Magnetic Blade', 0, 0, 0),
('b540dd74-e7d4-4cac-8fb1-4798d08a48d4', 'VNT-ELE-0010', '2 Tier Over the Toilet Rack, Stainless Steel', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 63, 50, 25, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q5_6aa02be9db2f8.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q4_6aa02be9dced2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q3_6aa02be9de300.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q2_6aa02be9df861.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q1_6aa02be9e0522.jpg"]', '2 Tier Over the Toilet Rack, Stainless Steel', 'UNIQUE DESIGN: Features a distinctive 2-tier structure with a towel rack and 3 hooks. Provides additional storage space, making your bathroom cleaner and more organized.\n• 2 TIER STORAGE OVER THE TOILET: Offers two levels of valuable storage space for towels, toilet paper, shampoo, and other toiletries, as well as potted plants.\n• STABLE STRUCTURE: Constructed with thick stainless steel tubing, this shelf is rust-free, sturdy, and easy to clean. It includes non-slip feet for added stability and has a load capacity of 20kg.\n• EASY ASSEMBLY: Comes with clear installation instructions, labeled parts, and included tools, allowing you to assemble the over-the-toilet bathroom organizer in just a few minutes.\n• DIMENSIONS: Measures 50.5cm x 24.5cm x 139.5cm.', 0, 1, 0),
('a502ad5e-8f27-47cf-96c2-a3c932d3a0f5', 'VNT-ELE-0011', 'Portable Cordless Hair Straightener Brush', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 33, 26, 26, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_185_469d905b-0598-4540-b998-8894e41599e7_6a9dc99c10033.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_184_223b1ecb-1d4f-4490-9b0e-6055205f8303_6a9dc99c10c78.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_183_f4603737-827b-4838-b3c6-b490cf7c1fab_6a9dc99c11687.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_157_86425899-46ac-46d3-b1fd-4e4a321367c0_6a9dc99c11fbf.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_241_0abfdf64-5f94-43a9-8b7e-b58064df7e16_6a9dc99c12875.jpg"]', 'Portable Cordless Hair Straightener Brush', 'Achieve smooth, salon-quality hair anywhere with this Portable Cordless Hair Straightener Brush. Featuring advanced metal ceramic heating technology, it heats up rapidly and offers three adjustable temperature levels from 160°C to 200°C, suitable for all hair types including fine, normal, thick, and curly. The built-in 2600mAh battery provides extended cordless use, easily rechargeable via USB (DC 5V/1A or 5V/2A), making it perfect for travel, office, and on-the-go styling. It releases millions of negative ions to effectively reduce static and frizz, leaving hair silky, shiny, and smooth while helping to lock in moisture. Its compact size (180×35×42mm) and lightweight design (160g) allow for easy portability, fitting effortlessly into handbags or travel kits for quick touch-ups.\nHighlights\n• Cordless and rechargeable design with a 2600mAh battery for ultimate portability and convenience.\n• Adjustable heat settings from 160°C to 200°C, catering to all hair types for optimal styling.\n• Ionic technology releases negative ions to combat frizz, reduce static, and enhance hair\'s shine and smoothness.\n• Unique 3D comb tooth design ensures smooth gliding, preventing tangles and reducing hair pulling during styling.', 0, 0, 0),
('1d54c73d-db30-44ed-a6aa-2b425af473db', 'VNT-ELE-0012', '8PCS Cat Water Fountain Filter', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 30, NULL, 27, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51kvB8iLUHL._AC_SL1000__6a96d6cfebded.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61AxXfxJMuL._AC_SL1500__6a96d6cfee372.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61Cvgbthi0L._AC_SL1500__6a96d6d001f4b.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61QlYdx4tvL._AC_SL1500__6a96d6d0079ca.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71c4J4CzyEL._AC_SL1500__6a96d6d00cb3e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71fIJ1+8sfL._AC_SL1500__6a96d6d012423.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71K37R3v1lL._AC_SL1500__6a96d6d01f3a3.jpg"]', '8PCS Cat Water Fountain Filter', 'Three layer filtration technology: high-density mesh can capture hair and debris; Activated carbon layer reduces impurities and odors; A clean filtration device promotes healthier hydration; Ensure that the filtration system of your cat\'s water dispenser provides cleaner water\n• Enhanced compatibility: Designed to be suitable for most automatic pet water dispensers; The crescent shape seamlessly aligns with the fountain structure; Including eight long-term filters (recommended to be replaced every three weeks); Make feeding cats\' drinking water no longer difficult\n• Pet Health Focus: Encourage cats to drink more water and drink fresher tasting water; Reduce mineral accumulation in pet fountains; By maintaining optimal water quality to help prevent urinary tract problems, it is a device that is very friendly to pet owners and can take good care of their pets at home\n• Easy to maintain: Pre washed filters can be used immediately; Lightweight design simplifies installation; The color coding layer indicates the status of the filter for timely replacement. I can remind you to replace the cotton filter, it\'s a very good device.\n• Value package advantage: Eight filters can provide up to six months of supply (based on single pet households); Durable non-woven fabric can withstand continuous water flow; Very suitable for multi cat homes or busy pet owners, making their pets more dependent and like you', 0, 0, 1),
('ca601236-4a11-4cda-834a-ac64ef68ef0b', 'VNT-ELE-0013', '4 Layer Multi Corner Bathroom Organizer', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 46, 36, 28, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61NZPpQ1moL._AC_SL1500__6a8610e64130d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71+oDZ30ONL._AC_SL1500__6a8610e646486.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71IUwbgwRLL._AC_SL1500__6a8610e64b2a2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71o3Tp7tYUL._AC_SL1500__6a8610e64fe23.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/81JvriNxWmL._AC_SL1500__6a8610e65494f.jpg"]', '4 Layer Multi Corner Bathroom Organizer', 'STURDY RUSTPROOF CONSTRUCTION: Our shower caddy is constructed by thickened ABS plastic shelves and premium stainless steel rods which can effectively prevent from rusting and durable for years. Suitable for use in humid environments such as bathrooms. Not like other flimsy plastic baskets, our baskets use thickened plastic material, not easy to deform, has a stronger load bearing capacity. Hollow design of baskets can achieve good ventilation and quick drainage, preventing water accumulation and keeping your shower essentials dry and clean.\n• STABLE: The strong powerful tension spring inside the standing shower caddy makes it stay firmly in contact with the ceiling and floor tightly without shaking or falling down. Non-slip rubber end caps provide extra stability. Adjustable knob locks each shelf firmly in place, preventing baskets from sliding down under pressure.\n• HEIGHT ADJUSTABLE: The height of the shower caddy corner can be adjusted from 40 to 120 inches. Suitable for most standard bathrooms, bathtubs, showers, kitchens, hotels, and RVs. The height of the basket is also adjustable with hand knobs to accommodate taller bottles.\n• EASY TO SET UP: Tension shower caddy assembles and installs quickly with no drilling, no tools and no damage to your walls or ceiling.\n• AMPLE STORAGE SPACE: Shower caddy has 4 large shelves, each shelf can hold 5-8 bottles. Provides a convenient storage solution for all your bathroom essentials, without taking up valuable floor space.', 0, 0, 0),
('b1772704-cd15-41c7-ba75-9913af9eeb4b', 'VNT-ELE-0014', 'AI Smart Auto-Stop Charging Adapter', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 26, 20, 29, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51yTtnpmMZL._AC_SL1001__6a7daab7c4c16.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61BUm9fwpUL._AC_SL1001__6a7daab7c877e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61DBGsjgw6L._AC_SL1001__6a7daab7cc1f2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61er0CsxO2L._AC__6a7daab7cfc7b.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61nmBunbV7L._AC_SL1001__6a7daab7d0ec0.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61tk5aPf8AL._AC_SX679__6a7daab7d49e7.jpg"]', 'AI Smart Auto-Stop Charging Adapter', '【Hardware-Level Auto Cut-Off Protection】Unlike conventional software-based chargers that rely on trickle charging, our built-in AI chip triggers a physical relay disconnect once full capacity is reached. This completely cuts off current flow, eliminating risks of battery swelling and overheating for safe, worry-free overnight charging.\n• 【140W Universal Fast-Charging Engine】Supports full power output up to 140W with native compatibility for major charging protocols including PD and QC. This high-efficiency system delivers full-speed charging across all Type-C devices, from high-performance workstations to everyday smartphones, without compromising your original charging speed.\n• 【Dual-Mode Smart Sensing System】Our intelligent dual-current detection adapts automatically to different power needs: White mode optimizes delivery for laptops and tablets, while Blue mode provides precise, gentle protection for smaller accessories like power banks and portable fans. Enjoy tailored safety for every device you charge.\n• 【Protective Memory Silicone Interface】The built-in memory silicone padding creates a soft buffer at every connection, eliminating metal-on-metal friction to safeguard your device’s charging port. This anti-scratch layer maintains a secure, non-slip grip while keeping the port of your high-end electronics in pristine condition.\n• 【Ultra-Compact Fire-Resistant Build】Lightweight at only 0.8 ounces and smaller than a matchbox, this travel-friendly adapter is perfect for on-the-go use. It’s constructed with flame-retardant PC material for superior heat resistance, ensuring reliable performance even during extended charging sessions.', 1, 0, 0),
