('23ac6283-6937-4022-acde-81f02d94a333', 'VNT-ELE-0016', 'Steam Brush | Rechargeable Detangling Tool with Oil', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 58, 50, 31, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss6_6a4e604287fa3.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss5_6a4e60428f32f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss4_6a4e604295eb2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss3_6a4e60429b10a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss2_6a4e60429fe87.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ss1_6a4e6042a45a6.jpg"]', 'Steam Brush | Rechargeable Detangling Tool with Oil', 'Restorative Nutrient Delivery: Featuring steam technology, this frizz control comb ensures consistent moisture distribution, smoothing hair without damage and promoting a glossy appearance, making it a must-have for quick touch-ups or maintaining long-lasting hairstyles\n• Ergonomically Optimized: This innovative steam brush serves as both a bob cut hair straightener and ergonomic styling device, providing effortless bang smoothing for short hairstyles, simplifying styling tasks even in busy schedules\n• Easy to Apply: Featuring advanced rechargeable technology, the steam hair brush serves as a reliable cordless hair straightener brush. Designed for portability, this travel hair brush allows users to achieve smooth styles without limitations. Whether at home or on the road, the wireless hair comb ensures consistent performance, enhancing convenience for daily or occasional use\n• Nourishing Hair Care Tool: The steam hair straightener brush functions as an oil diffuser hair brush, infusing moisture into strands while styling, promoting healthier hair with reduced frizz and enhanced shine, ideal for daily use on damaged hair repair comb regimens at home or travel\n• No-Pull Hair Care: The hair straightener brush functions as a gentle detangling brush, incorporating a no-pulling hair comb structure to ensure a sensitive scalp hair tool that prevents breakage and tangling, enabling smooth brushing even in thick or curly hair during morning routines', 0, 0, 1),
('9dbc11e9-879a-4055-96f6-b8f22fba3532', 'VNT-ELE-0017', 'Stuffed Cat Plush Backpack', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 76, 65, 32, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61Vi9sUBvWL._AC_SY741__6a22f77c2cdcc.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71bz9XOQwEL._AC_SX679__6a22f77c2d427.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71D-s0uFT8L._AC_SX679__6a22f77c2e104.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71jpp2fpLtL._AC_SX679__6a22f77c2efd5.jpg"]', 'Stuffed Cat Plush Backpack', 'Crafted with faux fur and intricate details, this cute plush backpack is so lifelike that it\'s often mistaken for a real cat!\n• Eye-catching Backpack - Not just a display of unique personality, but also a showcase of distinctive feline breeds.Be bold and freely showcase yourself in front of friends or loved ones with this bag!\n• Included Scarf Accessory - The detachable design lets you customize the accessory style freely, so try different decorations! Enhance your fashion sense and find joy in everyday life.\n• Heartwarming Surprise - This Calico Cat backpack is an ideal delight!The included box packaging and greeting card offer convenience. The accompanying grooming tool helps keep its fur tidy.\n• Handcrafted Lifelike Cat Backpack - Using 3D modeling to capture real cat expressions, each backpack is meticulously crafted to simulate agile poses and proportions. Crafted by experienced artisans, from hand-selecting materials to cutting and sewing, every detail is meticulously handmade.', 0, 0, 0),
('e9df6f50-0627-46ca-9583-ad24af08648c', 'VNT-ELE-0018', '5-in-1 Car Charger with Star light', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 54, NULL, 33, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_241_0abfdf64-5f94-43a9-8b7e-b58064df7e16_6a20407a187ab.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_237_3a122da5-08df-4221-a10c-924ec65752fb_6a20407a194e0.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_238_ee4410a9-734e-4ab2-94d3-a807347a0d92_6a20407a19f47.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_239_f709ce9d-83e4-40b7-a149-cbcc17008880_6a20407a1aa8a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_150_88d65308-9f4a-40db-bc8c-de499c591b68_6a20407a1b658.jpg"]', '5-in-1 Car Charger with Star light', 'Designed with an LED-lit port for night visibility and universal compatibility for all USB devices. Perfect for organized, efficient, and stylish on-the-go charging.\nHighlights\n• Fast & Efficient Charging: Equipped with PD3.0 technology, it delivers up to 45W of high-speed power to rapidly charge phones, tablets, and other devices.\n• 5-in-1 Multi-Functional Design: Combines a car charger, built-in air freshener, dual USB ports, LED ambient light, and a retractable cable for all-in-one convenience.\n• Retractable Cable System: Keeps your car neat with a tangle-free, space-saving cable that extends and retracts smoothly.\n• LED-Lit Charging Port: Easy to use in low light conditions with a stylish glow that enhances your car’s interior aesthetics.', 0, 0, 0),
('8e95da0b-526d-4e71-b993-c01cd265ceee', 'VNT-ELE-0019', 'Car Starry Sky Projector USB Directly Connected', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 54, 45, 34, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/41fmfwxxLZL._AC_SL1500__6a0b9862b1c30.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71b73n-hhsL._AC_SL1442__6a0b9862b271c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71GS4xNAKHL._AC_SL1500__6a0b9862b8b6c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71soeB4hXAL._AC__6a0b9862bde8c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/81buEjeZotL._AC_SL1500__6a0b9862bfe1f.jpg"]', 'Car Starry Sky Projector USB Directly Connected', 'One Operation Design】Intuitive interface with no complicated setup. 3 Power Connections → Mode Selection → Focus Adjustment for Professional Starry Sky. Physical operation panel for safety while driving\n• 360 Degree Rotation Mechanism: Adopts a magnetic base that supports all directions. Freely install anywhere in your car including dash, side panel rest, etc. Angle fine-tuning dial for precise positioning\n• Energy saving long design: Eco friendly with 2 W of power consumption. 50 hours of continuous use while reducing the strain on your vehicle\'s battery. Eco mode switching to further save energy\n• Customizable light: Equipped with 32 levels of brightness adjustment. Projects high brightness during the daytime, and a gentle night light with low brightness when sleeping. Timer function (15/30/60 minutes) to prevent forgetting to turn off\n• 【Universal Compatibility】Support 5V/1A standard USB power supply. Can be used in any power source environment, such as car, power bank, household outlet. Lightweight 3.0 oz (85 g) body makes it easy to carry in your bag', 0, 0, 0),
('924daa85-678c-4c8e-817b-24f0d246c1ff', 'VNT-ELE-0020', 'Neck and Back Massager for Pain Relief Deep Tissue', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 78, 65, 35, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61XXIE-MV3L._AC_SL1500__6a06f8909ba4d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61YEVkNOrML._AC_SL1500__6a06f890a2fa7.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71MZwLlv9LL._AC_SY879__6a06f890a8f3e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71VVHEGiFmL._AC_SL1500__6a06f890aa118.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/7168R4bYzYL._AC_SL1500__6a06f890af095.jpg"]', 'Neck and Back Massager for Pain Relief Deep Tissue', '4D Kneading Massage for Deep Relaxation】 The ReSomagic Smart Neck Shoulder Massager features 4D kneading massage technology that mimics real human hands for a deeply relaxing experience. It targets the neck, shoulders, and upper back, helping to relieve muscle tension, stiffness, and fatigue after work, travel, or workouts.\n• 【Customizable Comfort and Optional Warmth】 This Smart Neck Shoulder Massager offers adjustable intensity levels and optional gentle warmth to enhance your comfort. The even heat conduction helps loosen tight muscles and promotes better relaxation during your massage session.\n• 【Wireless and Portable Design】 Enjoy the convenience of a Wireless Portable Real Hands Massager that gives you to move without cords. Massager is for home, office, or travel use—simply recharge and relax anywhere.\n• 【User-Friendly and Safe Operation】 Designed for simplicity and safety, this Real Hands Massager includes intuitive controls, an ergonomic shape, and an auto shut-off timer to prevent overuse. Choose between handheld or strap-supported use for maximum comfort and flexibility.\n• 【Suitable for Various People and Occasions】 The ReSomagic Smart Neck Shoulder Massager is suitable for various people, including office workers, drivers, athletes, and seniors. It’s an ideal relaxation for both men and women, helping everyone enjoy daily comfort and stress relief.', 0, 1, 1),
('41adfae3-2b8e-409e-bd2d-0a1f7af8c853', 'VNT-ELE-0021', 'Mirumi, A charm robot', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 55, NULL, 36, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/s-1040x1300_v-fms_webp_e22ac99f-a449-4f34-a430-61f1ac508b2b_middle_69ed40d50fd78.jpg"]', 'Mirumi, A charm robot', '1. ATTACHABLE ROBOT\n2. REACTS TO SORROUNDINGS\n3. IMITATES LIKE A SHY INFANT\n4. TURNS AROUND IT\'S HEAD\n5. INTERACTS IN A PLAYFULL WAY\nRobots often bring convenience to our lives—but that’s not our purpose in making them.\nWe create robots that bring people closer by inspiring emotional connection.\nImagine noticing a baby’s gazing up and instinctively waving back, or exchanging a smile with a stranger after your eyes meet by chance.\nThese small, unplanned moments can stir up joy in our hearts, connecting us in unexpected ways.\nMirumi is designed to evoke those feelings through its tiny, endearing gestures that invite a smile—both from you and from those around you.', 1, 0, 0),
('a8d32981-2720-48aa-87e6-a7ef56371c24', 'VNT-ELE-0022', 'Smart Electric Vacuum Suction Scraping Therapy Massager', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 55, 45, 37, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_184_51NLC7E1fDL._SL1000__69ec847b6ac33.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_199_61U5lf15gOL._SL1000__69ec847b6bfaa.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_207_61f-Uu790uL._SL1000__69ec847b6d239.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_236_61TVoE4-FnL._SL1000__69ec847b6e361.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_246_51IAecPWGIL._SL1000__69ec847b6f4b8.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_77_61W5juWkUIL_69ec847b70518.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_256_51i8MnI0feL._SL1000__69ec847b72be9.jpg"]', 'Smart Electric Vacuum Suction Scraping Therapy Massager', '9 LEVELS OF SUCTION & HEAT: Customise your session with adjustable negative-pressure suction and constant-temperature heating between 45–55 °C for enhanced treatment effectiveness.\n• MULTIFUNCTIONAL THERAPY: Combines cupping, gua sha scraping, 8‑steel‑bead vibration, and red light therapy to promote circulation, detoxification, and muscle relief.\n• 30‑MIN AUTO TIMER: Intelligent timer ensures safe, targeted use—ideal for shoulders, back, arms, and legs without risk of overuse.\n• FLAMELESS & PORTABLE DESIGN: Safe flameless cupping in a compact, USB‑charged ABS body (16 × 7 cm); includes USB cable and acupuncture guide chart.\n• BOX CONTENTS: 1 x Electric Massager.', 0, 0, 0),
