('9e880a29-7159-4e0b-ab79-c1fc9a35eeae', 'VNT-ELE-0026', 'Exclusive Quran Surah Magnet Speaker', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 50, 40, 41, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images//uae_not.jpeg"]', 'Exclusive Quran Surah Magnet Speaker', 'A Divine Addition to Your Home \nTransform your kitchen into a space of serenity and reflection with Quran Magnets™—a unique fridge magnet that plays the Holy Quran.  Simply place it on your fridge, press play, and let the soothing recitations fill your home. Perfect for busy households, it brings the beauty of the Quran into your daily routine, whether you’re cooking, cleaning, or spending time with family.  Because every moment is an opportunity for remembrance.\nPowerful in Impact \nDesigned for convenience, Quran Magnets™ features a compact, magnetic design that sticks effortlessly to any metal surface.  With high-quality audio and simple controls, you can easily play, pause, or adjust the volume. Choose from a selection of Surahs or reciters to customize your listening experience.  It’s not just a magnet—it’s a gateway to spiritual connection.\n Perfect for Every Muslim Home \nWhether you’re seeking to create a peaceful atmosphere, teach your children the Quran, or simply stay connected to your faith, Quran Magnets™ is the ideal companion.  Its thoughtful design and powerful functionality make it a meaningful gift for Eid, Ramadan, or any occasion.  Bring the Quran closer to your heart and home today.', 0, 0, 0),
