('32e377b5-dea2-4c45-a443-4fbac01508e1', 'VNT-ELE-0029', 'Foldable Walking Cane with LED Light', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 39, 30, 44, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q1_68ea3d080e3e7.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1760181620_1617bb7cb6d80861b1b2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1760181623_b5371afd2adf2eb4c35c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1760181627_5bf0c733eef3969dcd4f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1760181632_ac948d229fb8a4935a7f.jpg"]', 'Foldable Walking Cane with LED Light', '𝑩𝒖𝒊𝒍𝒕-𝒊𝒏 6 𝑾𝒂𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒑𝒓𝒐𝒐𝒇 𝑳𝑬𝑫 𝑳𝒊𝒈𝒉𝒕𝒔: Because the cane has LED lighting, you can stay visible at all hours, especially when you get up at night. This is great for you, so you can take a walk at night, get up for a snack, or see in the dark. The bright light will safely guide you in the dark and there\'s no need to bring a separate flashlight at night.\n• 𝑳𝒊𝒈𝒉𝒕𝒘𝒆𝒊𝒈𝒉𝒕, 𝑺𝒕𝒖𝒓𝒅𝒚, 𝑨𝒅𝒋𝒖𝒔𝒕𝒂𝒃𝒍𝒆: Made of sturdy aluminum, our cane is lighter than typical wooden canes and safely supports up to 250 pounds, while featuring a foldable feature that easily folds into a compact 11 in. Easy to store and travel with.\n• 𝑭𝒊𝒕 𝒇𝒐𝒓 𝒀𝒐𝒖𝒓 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒅𝒆𝒓𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏: 5 adjustable heights to meet different usage needs and scenarios. The ergonomic handle contours to fit the hand to reduce hand fatigue, prevent muscle spasms and relieve wrist stress. The cane also features a wrist strap, an integrated wrist strap that keeps the cane in your hand without dropping it.\n• 𝑺𝒕𝒂𝒃𝒍𝒆, 𝑺𝒆𝒄𝒖𝒓𝒆 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑭𝒍𝒂𝒕: Non-slip rubber tips on the bottom provide extra security and traction on most surfaces to help maintain balance. Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.\n• 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒕𝒆𝒄𝒕 𝒀𝒐𝒖𝒓 𝑳𝒐𝒗𝒆𝒅 𝑶𝒏𝒆𝒔: Help your parents and grandparents with this easy-to-use, reliable crutch. Perfect for the elderly, geriatric and injured. Also the perfect cane for men and