('39f99a60-0905-43c0-b898-0e192b9995b0', 'VNT-ELE-0036', '3 in 1 Multi-Function Charging Stand', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 45, NULL, 51, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cc5_68d52cbe5cd60.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758801104_a2e998cb9b7c1c78f71a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758801108_3a9163be1baf8e831122.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758801110_2ee5ee4e3610a4b4d487.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758801114_deadf1c41c5be0487ac1.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758801120_b9698c255ac54e2655eb.jpg"]', '3 in 1 Multi-Function Charging Stand', '3 in 1 Rotatable Charger】3 interfaces to compatible with almost all smart phones. Lightning interface for iPhone, Micro USB and Type-C for Android and Others.\n• 【QI-Certified Wireless Charger Pad】10W, 7.5W(Fast Charging) and 5W(Standard Charging) wireless charging modes are supported. Compatible with all QI-enabled phones, such as iPhone XR/XS Max/XS/X/8 Plus/8, SAMSUNG S10/S9/S8/S7/S6/Note 9/Note 8/Note 7/Note 5, Google pixel 3 xl. For details, please refer to the description.\n• 【iWatch & AirPods Charger】One multi-function charging stand can charging for all your devices, such as smart phone, iWatch and AirPods.\n• 【Safe & Reliable】CE, FCC, and RoHS certification; Built-in intelligent chip with multiple protection, such as over charge, over temperature, short circuit etc. It will stop charging automatically while the phone is full charged.\n• 【Package & Warranty】You will get 1 * Multi-function Charging Stand, 1 * Smart Watch Charging Stand and 1 * User Manual. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.', 0, 0, 1),
('f3ec562e-c794-442b-923f-3bdc08187d63', 'VNT-ELE-0037', 'Waterproof Butyl Rubber Adhesive Tape', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 10, 8, 52, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801350_d7eee90a32a72008cb84.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801353_f27fedebf74d735796de.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801354_97f292cbc0b783c9668c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801357_5b0721afc3fc4a019222.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801359_3d28b1a0fc8ce54ab8ac.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757801363_e6586433ac53290ed676.jpg"]', 'Waterproof Butyl Rubber Adhesive Tape', 'This butyl rubber film tape is an extruded, sticky and pressure sensitive sealant with excellent waterproof adhesion\n• This tape is tear-resistant, ageing and UV resistant. With high tensile strength, the tape can immediately form a seal against water, air and dust\n• The product is very easy to use, just peel off the peeled film and apply this butyl rubber sealing tape anywhere you need it\n• Repair application: suitable for plastic and metal pipes (e.g. flexible aluminium pipes), filling gaps and sealing joints, polycarbonate sheets, roofs, gutters and cladding systems as well as caravan roofs; excellent as a repair tape for inflatable pools or tents\n• Each roll has a length of 5 m and is available in widths 5 cm, 10 cm, 15 cm, 20 cm and 30 cm', 0, 0, 0),
('93d655f6-0292-40f3-8597-1acb0f928f0a', 'VNT-ELE-0038', 'Portable Small Hookah Set', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 86, 70, 53, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/h6_68c1f563c98f8.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541799_fd4849a894c37534d438.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541802_b7a2c53217eb41b8ec49.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541804_11763c83011e3d9c0e6e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541806_4e7a6159bc63ffbc67da.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541809_be372a9506c69a5c162f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541811_8fce9601ff5c993d758f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541814_8df7c96079c65a5e5a51.webp"]', 'Portable Small Hookah Set', 'This is the new portable hookah that Hookah-Shisha is selling, we want to be the first to bring you this stylish and sexy mini hookah. The perfect on-the-go hookah that fits most standard cup holders and fits easily into a backpack. Let you enjoy years of fun. Suitable for cars, outdoor travel, home, bars, clubs, weddings, parties, gifts, etc. Portable and durable, you can take it anywhere. Enjoy anytime, anywhere and share the best gift to your friends, lovers, partners.\n• The whole hookah fits perfectly into your car cup holder .The car hookah has a covered on top to keep your coals safe, and a lid - with a grill on top for air circulation. Screw on and lock, the lid stays locking even during vigorous exercise. The charcoal remains inside the unit, all wrapped in shiny metal for protection.Makes it the perfect smoking companion in the car. so don\'t have to worry about the carbon coming off, leaving ash, burns and hookah stains on your car.\n• Accessories: high-grade frosted hookah + silicone hose + metal carbon gasket + silicone grommet [high sealing, water is not easy to flow out] + coal clip + downpipe + handle\n• Easy to assemble, disassemble, clean Each part can be disassembled individually for cleaning, and can be assembled back into a cup shape for easy storage without taking up space. Reusable: Easy to wash with water after every use to keep it clean and pure every time, especially when you change tobacco flavors. Bring you a better experience', 0, 0, 0),
('4bc38854-3a38-4a8a-8e09-ee5c2eb3d813', 'VNT-ELE-0039', 'cockroach Killer Gel', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 8, NULL, 54, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/killer_68b99591ab000.jpg"]', 'cockroach Killer Gel', 'Effective Cockroach Elimination: Targets and kills roaches instantly with powerful gel bait, ensuring long-lasting pest control.\n• Easy-to-Use Syringe Applicator: Pre-loaded syringe allows precise application in hard-to-reach areas for maximum effectiveness.\n• Versatile Indoor & Outdoor Use: Ideal for use in kitchens, washrooms, kennels, offices, warehouses, and more.\n• Safe for Sensitive Areas: Specifically designed for food preparation areas and hygienic spaces, with minimal odor and no mess.\n• Fast & Reliable Solution: Delivers quick results with visible cockroach reduction in days, keeping your environment pest-free.', 0, 0, 0),
('79faa807-13be-4665-a16f-a62b6479bdd3', 'VNT-ELE-0040', 'Early English Education Audiobook', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 31, 25, 55, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61fRXP01mBL._SX679__68ad2ae94b19f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61hGlRhXryL._SX679__68ad2ae94c023.jpg"]', 'Early English Education Audiobook', 'Interactive Learning – Touch the pages to hear words, phrases, and sounds, making learning engaging and hands-on.\n•  Audiobook Mode – Built-in speaker provides clear pronunciation and fun sound effects to enhance listening skills.\n•  Finger-Point Technology – Just point and learn! No buttons or complicated controls, ideal for little hands.\n•  Bright & Colorful Pages – Eye-catching illustrations and vibrant layouts capture children’s attention and improve focus.\n•  Boosts Early Education – Encourages language development, reading readiness, and cognitive skills.\n•  Kid-Safe & Durable – Made with non-toxic, child-safe materials and designed to withstand active play.\n•  Perfect Gift Idea – Great for birthdays, holidays, or as an educational treat for your little one!', 0, 1, 1),
('d00c426a-3d6f-40d5-a388-f88969cee8c9', 'VNT-ELE-0041', 'A distinctive e-book for teaching children', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 32, 25, 56, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756179553_1c0daf4d7f7bb29c08e4.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756179444_a7935ed7c39f62a525d5.png","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756179554_a3c240332f852f01fb73.webp","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756179558_36d37d3f011be6d6e776.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756179560_500f07873e5a88f06d03.jpg"]', 'A distinctive e-book for teaching children', 'With just one click on the pictures or the sound button... let your child enjoy a variety of content.\nIt is really a simple and entertaining way of learning.\nAn e-learning book that features a variety of topics and playful ways for your children to develop their cognitive skills. This content includes: the Arabic and English alphabets, fruits and animals, etiquette and morals, how to perform ablution and prayer, and wonderful songs.\nIt\'s truly a great gift: The Arabic and English learning e-book features wonderful rhymes and clear Arabic and English voices, which are easy to capture your children\'s attention and interest. It makes a great gift idea for a birthday or any other occasion.\n1 piece e-book\nLanguage of words used in books: Arabic and English\nBook size : 23.5 x 2.7 x 20.5 cm\nFabric material: plastic\nPower supply mode: ordinary dry battery, 1.5V "AAA type" 3X (need to bring your own battery)\nProduct shipping packaging: Carton\nCarton size: 52X32.5X90 cm/48 pieces\nTotal weight: 26g\n【High Quality】Our readers use high-quality materials. They are water and stain resistant - won\'t tear easily - and come in bright colors and clear patterns.\n【Educational Toy】These electronic learning books are a smart learning machine for children - they can develop and cultivate the child\'s cognitive ability - help them with language expression - cultivate memory and improve their thinking method. They look similar to real books and children will love them.\n【Two Languages】To maximize the child\'s learning experience, use a variety of knowledge to interact with the child for fun and benefit. Available in two languages: Arabic and English. You can switch to your preferred language as needed.\n【Easy to Remember】As sound is combined with picture, vivid picture to attract children\'s attention to learn as the content of the books is easily remembered. These books are suitable for the purpose of interactive entertainment, through learning and testing, they can be used to train children\'s early intelligence.\n【Portable】] Product size: about 23.5 x 2.7 x 20.5cm. Product net weight: about 115g. Lightweight and portable design makes it easy to carry and store, suitable for outdoor use, family trips or adventures with kids.', 0, 0, 0),
('6f3fe155-17b3-4eff-9910-b2bb7dce9d12', 'VNT-ELE-0042', 'Tiger eye Bracelet', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 4, NULL, 57, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1755269039_60f75c93203f5807774c.jpg"]', 'Tiger eye Bracelet', 'MTGWOFGL46413296', 1, 0, 0),
('150dc8bf-d595-4c27-ae4d-4d60829dc6d4', 'VNT-ELE-0043', 'Vacuum Flask LED Temperature Display Water Bottle 500 ml', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 22, 17, 58, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/b6_688b616238594.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001492_82d0aaad258e9d129963.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001495_2de1aad213a6878407d2.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001498_db874c8e2f0bcb2b5fdb.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001501_30e6f8868af015a7a204.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001504_cb667f82010e70c6403a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754001507_aff1567ad82f3b51d935.jpg"]', 'Vacuum Flask LED Temperature Display Water Bottle 500 ml', 'EASY TO POUR: Featuring a mouth that’s specially designed to enable drip-free sipping as well as wide enough for ice-cubes, for those who like their drinks extra-chilled.\n• EASY TO HOLD: The specially crafted exterior remains condensation free so it not only ensures that your hands and bag stay dry but also that the flask doesn’t slip when you hold it.\n• EASY TO CARRY: The compact design of this bottle allows easy accommodation in backpacks and rucksacks, making it well-suited for carrying on expeditions and trips. It can be accommodated in office and school bags as well. It can also fit neatly inside your gym bag or sports bag.\n• Cold Stays Cold. Hot Stays Hot The most wonderful thing about the CROCKERI Stainless Steel Thermos Flask Bottle With Liquid Temperature Display is that it keeps hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold, for upto 24 hours, whether it’s a piping hot coffee or a chilled iced tea.\n• BEST USAGE: Office/School/College/Gym/Picnic/Home', 0, 0, 0),
('196a94b2-d06c-4a6c-8028-abf5db92afb6', 'VNT-ELE-0044', 'CAR WAX', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 18, 14, 59, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1753811260_885cd64befc283317021.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-polish-wax-230g-263125_6886a32ca42c9.jpg"]', 'CAR WAX', 'Superior Shine: Achieve a showroom-quality gloss that enhances your car’s color and gives it a flawless mirror-like finish.\n• ?? UV Protection: Protects your vehicle’s paint from harmful UV rays, preventing fading, cracking, and discoloration over time.\n• ? Water Repellency: Creates a hydrophobic layer that repels water, dirt, and grime, making your car easier to clean and maintain.\n• ?? Durable Coating: Forms a protective barrier against scratches, stains, and contaminants like tree sap, bird droppings, and road debris.\n• ? Safe for All Surfaces: Gentle yet effective formula is safe to use on all paint types, including metallic and clear coats.\n• ??? Easy Application: Applies effortlessly with a smooth, non-sticky consistency, making it ideal for both beginners and professionals.\n• ? Long-Lasting Results: Provides weeks of protection and shine with just one application.', 0, 0, 1),
('a600d591-2694-4b25-9c83-55a1505d393e', 'VNT-ELE-0045', 'Car seat cushion', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 19, NULL, 60, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754534160_dc899fbe6c3cda4a5c1f.webp"]', 'Car seat cushion', 'PNUNNIGD26243437', 0, 1, 0),
('de03d05f-a920-4968-a26b-1250345ecbe5', 'VNT-ELE-0046', 'Portable Mini Bladeless Fan', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 41, 35, 61, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-bladeless-fan-694-955.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-bladeless-fan-694-301.jpg"]', 'Portable Mini Bladeless Fan', '. The internally configured 900mAh large-capacity polymer lithium battery can work continuously for 5 hours.\n• 2. The Type-c interface of USB charging, no longer worries about the problem of insufficient power.\n• 3. The flexible clip design helps you easily clip the fan to the chest, waist, backpack, and other places.\n• 4. The wind direction that can be adjusted will brings you a cooler experience.\n• 5. The cleverly designed parts structure reduces the volume of the fan as much as possible, making it more convenient to carry.\n• Voltage: 5.0 volts', 0, 0, 0),
('c9b36420-5227-466b-98a4-66acfb2f98a9', 'VNT-ELE-0047', 'Foldable Portable Electric Kettle', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 23, 20, 62, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/foldable-portable-electric-kettle-692-616.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/foldable-portable-electric-kettle-692-717.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/foldable-portable-electric-kettle-692-171.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/foldable-portable-electric-kettle-692-868.jpg"]', 'Foldable Portable Electric Kettle', '[Easy to Use]: The folding electric kettle has only one switch control button, just press the button, then water will be boiled in 3-5 minutes. It supports 110V-220V, and can reach a maximum power of 600W. You can drink your desired hot drinks, such as tea, coffee, soup without waiting too long.\n• [Food-grade Safety Protection]: It is made of safe food-grade silicone, does not contain PBA, is non-toxic, odorless, and resistant to high temperatures. 304 stainless steel kettle base, with heat-resistant silicone body and plastic handle; kettle body and heating plate are made of metal. The heating plate is also very safe with dry-burning protection and overheating protection.\n• [Lightweight and Portable Design]: The electric kettle adopts a foldable design, which is very convenient and light, allowing you to carry it with you when you travel, saving a lot of space when packing. Thanks to its lightweight design, this portable water bottle won\'t add to your travel burden.\n• [Humanized Foldable Design]: Our electric kettle has a capacity of 600ml and weighs 0.6kg. Expand size is 17cm*17*17cm (L*W*H); Folded size is 17*17*10cm (L*W*H). It id portable to put in your suitcase. You can also separate the power cord from the kettle body for more convenient storage.\n• [Applicable to Multiple Occasions]: It is convenient to use in most occasion, such as travel, business office, outdoor picnic, staying at the hotel, reading leisure, entertainment dinner, sports and fitness.', 0, 0, 0),
('b7085b71-5cda-4077-9a8b-0ff9817f9937', 'VNT-ELE-0048', 'Collapsible Folding Outdoor Utility Wagon, Black', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 140, NULL, 63, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/collapsible-folding-outdoor-utility-wagon,-black-687-724.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/collapsible-folding-outdoor-utility-wagon,-black-687-657.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/collapsible-folding-outdoor-utility-wagon,-black-687-838.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/collapsible-folding-outdoor-utility-wagon,-black-687-199.jpg"]', 'Collapsible Folding Outdoor Utility Wagon, Black', 'LARGE CAPACITY - Sets up in seconds, No assembly required! Outside Dimensions Approx: 35" x 20" x 23" Inside Dimensions Approx: 32.5 x 17.5 x 10.5\n• CONVENIENT COMPACT STORAGE - Wagon folds to only 8" thick! Folded size approx. 29.5" x 20" x 8" and includes a convenient carry case. Weighs 24.5 Lbs.\n• LIGHTEN THE LOAD! - The heavy duty frame allows loads up to 150 lbs., and the Durable 600D Fabric can be easily cleaned. UV and mildew resistant\n• FUNCTIONAL FEATURES include an adjustable handle for effortless transport and 2 Mesh Cup holders to keep your beverages secure\n• EASY TRANSPORT - Perfect for hauling gear to outdoor sporting events, concerts, trips to the park and great for use around the house. Please note that it is NOT made to transport children.', 0, 0, 1),
('4c5413a3-7812-4287-aa97-de6338b452f2', 'VNT-ELE-0049', '4pcs Portable Car Side Window Shade', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 60, 50, 64, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4pcs-portable-car-side-window-shade-686-763.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4pcs-portable-car-side-window-shade-686-505.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4pcs-portable-car-side-window-shade-686-701.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4pcs-portable-car-side-window-shade-686-976.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4pcs-portable-car-side-window-shade-686-693.jpg"]', '4pcs Portable Car Side Window Shade', 'OBGFBZXN46771283', 1, 0, 0),
('744730fe-397d-4480-a381-c14e47372380', 'VNT-ELE-0050', 'Car seat organizer seam storage box with a large space', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 36, 30, 65, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-organizer-seam-storage-box-with-a-large-space-642-020.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-organizer-seam-storage-box-with-a-large-space-642-717.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-organizer-seam-storage-box-with-a-large-space-642-297.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-organizer-seam-storage-box-with-a-large-space-642-938.jpg"]', 'Car seat organizer seam storage box with a large space', 'A car organizer helps organize your items in the car, making them easier to access and store.\n• The car organizer is available in different shapes and sizes, making it suitable for different cars.\n• The car organizer has many pockets and shelves, providing multi-purpose storage space.\n• The car organizer helps keep your items safe and stable while driving.\n• The car trunk organizer helps keep your trunk clean and organized.\n• The car organizer helps increase the safety and comfort of driving the car\n• The car organizer is a stylish addition to the car trunk.', 0, 1, 0);
