('a431ed19-b4d5-45dc-aa5e-98cdcf5ff167', 'VNT-ELE-0051', 'Car Seat Back Storage Bag', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 18, NULL, 66, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-469.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-880.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-146.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-145.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-769.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-seat-back-storage-bag-641-096.jpg"]', 'Car Seat Back Storage Bag', 'Product information :\nMaterial: polyester\nUse position: back of seat\nInstallation method: hook type\nStyle: back pocket\nSize Information:\nColor 52*29cm\nPacking list:\nCar seat mommy hanging bag *1', 0, 0, 0),
('a53c6622-ad7c-4b6a-9353-9d8b38ddf6ed', 'VNT-ELE-0052', 'Bed Vacuum Cleaner', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 34, 28, 67, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-328.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-103.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-854.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-866.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-157.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bed-vacuum-cleaner-637-004.jpg"]', 'Bed Vacuum Cleaner', 'Strong Mite Removal Instrument?Uses Ultraviolet Rays to Remove Mites, Strong Suction, Large Vibration Amplitude, Take Away Mites, Dander, Dust, Etc., Mites Machine for Bed Without Leaving Allergens.\n• ?Purple Light And Pulsation Function? : Mattress Vacuum Cleaner Adopts Purple C-253.7nm Wavelength Purple Light, Which can Directly Penetrate Mites and Effectively Clean, the Mattress Cleaner is Equipped With Dual Pulsating Pads, High Frequency Vibration Brings Deep Dirt to the Fabric Surface.\n• ?More Powerful Motors? : Separate Control of Vibration, a Pulsating Pad With Dusting Brush, 8000/Min High Frequency Dual Board Beating, to Flapping the Mites Out, to Get Dust Mite Out of Beds,', 0, 0, 1),
('e3780b16-131b-47cf-bc91-12c38521c2fc', 'VNT-ELE-0053', 'X-Shaped Shoe Rack', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 25, 20, 68, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/x-shaped-shoe-rack-636-645.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/x-shaped-shoe-rack-636-679.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/x-shaped-shoe-rack-636-804.jpg"]', 'X-Shaped Shoe Rack', 'Space-Saving Design: This 5 tier folding shoe rack offers a stackable solution to neatly store up to 30 pairs of shoes while minimizing floor space.\n• Sturdy Steel Construction: Made of powder-coated steel tubing, the heavy-duty shelves and crisscross supports can hold weights of up to 40 pounds per shelf.\n• Easy Assembly: No tools required for this shoe rack, simply snap together the poles and shelves, then fold for compact storage when not in use.\n• Versatile Storage: Great for small spaces, this rack can be used in entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, bathrooms, kitchens, or garages to hold shoes or other small items.\n• Multiple Color Options: Available in black, white or silver finishes to complement any room\'s décor while keeping shoes organized and off the floor.', 0, 0, 0),
