air, debris, liquid, dust, bread crumbs, pet hair, and cat litter in hard-to-reach gaps. It\'s the ultimate tool for quick and efficient cleaning in both your home and car.\nUpgraded HEPA Filter\nEquipped with an upgraded washable HEPA filter, this mini vacuum can capture an impressive 99.99% of particles, effectively protecting the motor and preventing secondary air pollution. Emptying the dust container is a cinch - just rotate it to dispose of the trash and then rinse it under water for cleaning and drying.\n4 in 1 Clean Professional Accessories\nThe cordless hand vacuum comes with an array of versatile accessories to meet all your cleaning needs. The package includes 1dusting brush, 1crevice nozzle tool, 1hose, 1 washable filter, 1floor brush, and 2connect tools. These attachments enable you to reach narrow gaps, corners, and difficult-to-access areas. The brush is perfect for carpets and pet hair, while the long hose can tackle hidden and deep corners in cars and warehouses. The floor brush takes care of floors and curtains, making it a comprehensive solution for both home and car cleaning.', 0, 1, 0),
('eb2e98e4-73f9-400e-b0c3-1de2518bd36a', 'VNT-ELE-0056', 'Portable Karaok sound system with 2 Wireless Mike', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 38, 30, 71, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-karaok-sound-system-with-2-wireless-mike-619-901.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-karaok-sound-system-with-2-wireless-mike-619-251.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-karaok-sound-system-with-2-wireless-mike-619-273.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-karaok-sound-system-with-2-wireless-mike-619-267.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-karaok-sound-system-with-2-wireless-mike-619-663.jpg"]', 'Portable Karaok sound system with 2 Wireless Mike', '2 Wireless Microphones?Our karaoke machine comes with 2 wireless microphones that use advanced active noise reduction technology, a professional DSP audio processor to auto adjust treble and bass. Every word from you will be perfect! Can be used as microphone, karaoke machine, high quality speaker, voice changer, . A convenient, multi-functional microphone toy that can bring kids fun anywhere, anytime.\n• Fun Voice Change & Multi-Colored LED Lights ?Professional audio processor and tuning system create an amazing KTV live sound environment and wonderful echo reverberation. Using the 4 different effects to change your voice and provides more fun for your kids (including Original, Female voice, Male voice, Monster voice). LED lights dancing with the rhythm of the music, creating a fun atmosphere.\n• Connect Anywhere?Pair the karaoke machine with any Bluetooth-enabled device, or play music from a TF card or USB drive. With a stable signal transmission range of 10m/32.8ft, it is suitable for all your favorite devices, such as iPhone, Android phone, iPad, tablet, PC and so on. You will never miss a happy moment.?NOTE: Microphones that are too close can produce screeching and strange sounds, which is relatively common audio feedback, so try to keep the microphone away from the speaker.?\n• ?Portable & Long Time Use?No matter where you go, our small portable wireless karaoke microphone and speaker will go to the party with you. Built-in 2000 mAh rechargeable battery ensures 3-4 hours of fun. Enjoy non-stop fun. Birthday parties, outdoor events, travel...This portable wireless speaker and microphone will meet all your ""fun singing"" needs.\n• ?Great Gifts?With our mini karaoke microphone, everywhere is the stage. You can karaoke alone for joy or let your kids,family, friend start their live show. It is a great birthday or festival gifts foryour kids, friends or family. Better choice gifts for all kinds of the festival (Easter, Christmas, Valentine,Halloween, Thanksgiving, New Year).', 1, 0, 1),
