('c2407554-0261-4574-81a1-1b4c93ab6f5b', 'VNT-ELE-0058', 'Electric Remote Control Helicopter', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 47, 37, 73, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-remote-control-helicopter-589-625.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-remote-control-helicopter-589-914.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-remote-control-helicopter-589-364.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-remote-control-helicopter-589-384.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-remote-control-helicopter-589-793.jpg"]', 'Electric Remote Control Helicopter', 'F07 UH-1D RC Helicopter?The F07 UH-1D six-channel 6G flybarless helicopter is based on the Bell UH-1 Huey helicopter, with a scale of 1:34. It is a highly realistic and feature-rich remote control helicopter model designed for enthusiasts and beginners. It features an innovative flybarless design and cool lighting effects.\n• ?Altitude Hold and One-Key Inverted Flight?High-precision optical flow positioning and barometer altitude hold functions facilitate indoor and outdoor control. One-key inverted flight function makes the running direction after inversion the same as the direction of normal flight.\n• ?Flight Stability & 6-Axis Gyro?No aileron design, dual-axis co-axial motors, and an electronic stabilization system provide more precise control and stable flight. The optimized structure reduces the likelihood of damage.Equipped with a 6-axis gyroscope, it can achieve stable, fast and precise flight attitude.\n• ?Efficient Motor & Responsive Servo?Adopts 2511 1200KV to reduce gear noise, providing low noise, high torque, strong power and efficiency. High-torque servos enable fast response and accuracy, and are effective in moderate winds.\n• ?Ready to Fly?Everything you need is included. Helicopter * 1, Intelligent Battery* 1 or 2 or 3, Manual * 1, Charger *1. Long Life Battery: 7.4V 1400mAh battery with safety features and TYPE-C charging.', 0, 0, 0),
