('8b877188-ca93-4d15-8122-837de75f1d5e', 'VNT-ELE-0068', 'DIGITAL CLOCK', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 33, 27, 18, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-049.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-470.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-565.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-437.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-903.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/digital-clock-418-201.jpg"]', 'DIGITAL CLOCK', 'Digital alarm clock with large LED display 6.3" x 0.7" x 2.5" x 6.2cm, allowing you to check the time clearly even it is far away from you. Our desk clock with 5 modes: clock mode, date mode, temperature mode, night mode (on/off), alarm mode. The buttons on the back are self-explanatory, so it is very easy to set up! The "cooler" between the hour and minute lights up constantly\n• Adjustable Brightness. Simply press up/down to adjust the 3 brightness levels (bright/medium/low). Besides, the alarm clock will automatically dim during 18:00-6:00 under night mode or you can select other time period for your need). Just press the snooze button and hold for more than 3 seconds to turn off the screen to prevent light at night while sleeping. Note: If you use a power supply cable, the clock will always be on.\n• Workday & Snooze Mode.There are 3 alarm modes to choose when you want to wake you up at a fixed time: Monday to Friday / Monday to Saturday / Monday to Sunday. Just press ALARM, then use "UP" and "DOWN" buttons to set the hour/minute/snooze/ontime/workday mode. In addition, you can get 1-60 minutes extra sleep by pressing the SNOOZE button when the alarm goes off or press any other key to cancel the alarm.\n• Voice Control & Power Saving Mode.When powered by battery, you can get an additional function - voice control, which means you can activate the display by making some noise like clapping your hands, rolling on the table or touching the clock. In addition, the LED alarm clock will automatically turn off after 16 seconds of no operation and enter power saving mode, but the system still keeps normal timing and temperature and keeps the previous settings.\n• USB BATTERY OPERATED.This alarm clocks for bedrooms comes with a 1m/39.37in power cord AC adapter not included - very good for battery saving. Comes with time memory function when powered by AAA batteries. (When powered by USB alone, there is no time memory function after power off.', 0, 0, 1),
