ter cup holder can be taken out anytime without difficulty. Come with installation instructions.\nCompatible with Most Car Models: – This adjustable swivel tray is suitable for all most car models and can attach to any standard cup holder hole and locks securely in place. The jointed arms swivels from driver to passenger and may be raised or lowered at will.', 0, 0, 0),
