lerts: Sends notifications to your phone and email when motion is detected\n• Adjustable Settings: Customize sensitivity and detection zones to suit your needs\nPeace of Mind:\nProtect Your Family and Property: Monitor babysitters, children, staff, and deter thieves\nDiscreet and Effective: Install these small cameras to keep an eye on your home or workplace', 0, 0, 0),
