('3b44025d-70ff-4146-8098-e4a2c6cd3c3f', 'VNT-TLS-0001', 'Drain Clog Remover Tool', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 9, 8, 42, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/d5_68c1f3b43b17a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541332_0398284bbb730d20404b.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541335_6b3fec0addc371c350e5.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541343_46e4fdcee8278c6b7f33.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541349_c37a61f1f8da8590845e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757541356_4889da6837b9de8e89d1.jpg"]', 'Drain Clog Remover Tool', 'Multi-Functional Unclogging Tool: This flexible claw pickup tool clears blockages in sinks, toilets, and drains, and can also retrieve dropped items, making it a versatile solution for home maintenance.\n• Multi-Angle Flexibility: This flexible claw pickup tool\'s highly bendable head can twist and turn to fit various pipe shapes and angles, ensuring no clog is out of reach, whether it’s a U-shaped sink trap or a curved toilet pipe.\n• Spring-Action Design: This flexible claw pickup tool\'s spring-loaded pressing mechanism allows the tool to extend deep into pipes—simply squeeze the handle to securely clamp onto debris for easy removal.\n• Effortless Clog Removal: This flexible claw pickup tool simply extends the flexible arm, presses to grip debris, and pulls to clear blockages—quickly restoring free-flowing drains with minimal effort.\n• Compact & Space-Saving Storage: This flexible claw pickup tool\'s collapsible and lightweight design allows for easy storage in cabinets, drawers, or under sinks, taking up minimal space while remaining readily accessible whenever a plumbing emergency strikes.', 0, 0, 1),
