('439a9726-deef-4031-98be-8de8df5b432b', 'VNT-TLS-0004', 'Air Compressor', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 48, 40, 45, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-compressor-620-383.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-compressor-620-474.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-compressor-620-729.jpg"]', 'Air Compressor', 'Voltage: DC 12V\n• Max Amperage: 10 AMP\n• Usage Duration: 12-15 minutes\n• Max Pressure: 965 kPa (140 PSI)\n• Airflow Displacement: 35 L/min\n• Ideal For: Inflating car tires, bicycles, air mattresses, and sports equipment.\n• Built-in Safety: Prevents overheating during continuous use.', 0, 1, 0),
('50212f8e-a500-45d4-9f74-3fbe4a78823a', 'VNT-TLS-0005', '45Pcs Cordless Screwdriver', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 32, NULL, 46, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/45pcs-cordless-screwdriver-298-697.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/45pcs-cordless-screwdriver-298-392.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/45pcs-cordless-screwdriver-298-408.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/45pcs-cordless-screwdriver-298-499.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/45pcs-cordless-screwdriver-298-684.jpg"]', '45Pcs Cordless Screwdriver', 'Light and Portable: These screwdrivers are featherweight and easy to carry, perfect for tasks on the go.\n• T-Handle Design: Enjoy the comfy T-handle grip for better control when turning screws.\n• Handheld Champ: Designed for handheld use, these screwdrivers fit snugly in your hand.\n• User-Friendly: These screwdrivers are a breeze to operate, making your tasks easier.\n• Easy Grip: The ergonomic design ensures a firm and secure grip during use.\n• These features make these screwdrivers ideal for a wide range of tasks!', 0, 0, 1),
('c9079aa0-65ff-4f0f-bd0b-af44a456de8d', 'VNT-TLS-0006', 'Multifunctional Haircut And Shaver Tool', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 32, 26, 47, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-586.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-018.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-039.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-734.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-016.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-haircut-and-shaver-tool-297-809.jpg"]', 'Multifunctional Haircut And Shaver Tool', 'Take Control of Your Style: Achieve the perfect self-styled look at home with ease! Clear your neck, back, and body without the worry of burns or irritation. The Haircut tool\'s 40mm reach ensures the ideal power position for those hard-to-reach areas.\n• 5 Custom Attachments: This Home Haircut tool comes with 5 precision-engineered attachments (long, medium, short, groomer, man scaper) to cater to your preferred style. Enjoy a safe and effective beard/hair cutting experience, even with the thickest hair.\n• 90-Degree Offset Blades Angle: Featuring a 90-degree offset blades angle, the Haircut tool effortlessly combs and cuts for stubble, short, medium, and long beard styles. Perfect for hair clipping and contouring, offering versatility in styling.\n• Built-in Extending Handle: Never struggle to reach the back of your head again! The Home Haircut tool includes a built-in extending handle for those tricky areas, ensuring maximum user comfort, safety, and convenience during self-styling.\n• Trim with Confidence: Experience precise cuts with confidence using this Home Haircut tool. Paired with guide combs, it allows for a more accurate cut, suitable for various hairstyles. With 5 limitation combs of different lengths, it\'s versatile for families and different groups, making it perfect for travel or business trips.', 0, 0, 0),
