('943044dc-4f00-4fc5-ba6e-5ec1914334c4', 'VNT-TLS-0008', 'Car Air Pump', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 95, NULL, 49, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-air-pump-159-804.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-air-pump-159-166.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-air-pump-159-907.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-air-pump-159-791.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-air-pump-159-710.jpg"]', 'Car Air Pump', 'Car Installation: Allis Chalmers generator, Allis Chalmers grade\n• Other Features:\n• Emergency Light, Power Indicator, Tire Pressure Monitoring\n• Max. Amperage: 30Amp\n• Flow Rate @0PSI(13.8 Volts): 2.54CFM\n• Max. Duty Cycle (@23C & 100 PSI): 33%', 0, 0, 0),
