('55514da5-324e-408c-be82-4f6d98043ab5', 'VNT-TLS-0010', 'Portable Electric Nail Clipper', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 25, 20, 51, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-nail-clipper-121-469.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-nail-clipper-121-745.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-nail-clipper-121-232.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-nail-clipper-121-254.jpg"]', 'Portable Electric Nail Clipper', 'Product Features:\n• High Efficiency: Powerful trimming with 800-1000g force for a precise cut every time.\n• Low Noise: Whisper-quiet operation for a calm, stress-free nail trimming experience.\n• Battery or Rechargeable: Choose between battery-operated or rechargeable options. Rechargeable models save you money in the long run! ????\n• Ergonomic Design: Fits comfortably in your hand with easy-to-maneuver controls. Some models even come with rubber grips for extra control.\n• Safety Features: Built-in safety guards protect your skin from cuts, perfect for kids or elderly users.\n• Adjustable Settings: Customize your trimming with adjustable speeds, perfect for different nail types and personal preferences.\n• Built-in Light: An integrated light ensures you can see clearly while trimming, ideal for DIY nail care.\n• Portable & Compact: Lightweight and travel-friendly design with a protective case—perfect for nail care on the go!\nMake nail trimming safe, easy, and efficient with this must-have gadget!', 0, 0, 0),
('f6c0c75e-7aed-4073-9d9e-3aa9e7f8c0e0', 'VNT-TLS-0011', 'Stain Whitener Reform', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 8, NULL, 52, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stain-whitener-reform-119-556.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stain-whitener-reform-119-398.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stain-whitener-reform-119-719.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stain-whitener-reform-119-458.jpg"]', 'Stain Whitener Reform', 'Stain Whitener Reform\nAbout Product:\nPurpose:\n• Designed to remove or lighten stains on fabrics and surfaces\nFunctionality:\n• Breaks down or lifts stain pigments from the material\n• Makes the affected area appear cleaner and brighter\nCommon Uses:\n• Clothing\n• Upholstery\n• Carpets', 0, 0, 0),
('0202fb41-a79c-439f-8e08-c287f8736546', 'VNT-TLS-0012', 'Jump Starter', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 102, 80, 53, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-926.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-816.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-460.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-622.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-207.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/jump-starter-83-312.jpg"]', 'Jump Starter', 'Specifications:\n• Brand: Entatial\n• Battery Cell Composition: Lithium\n• Vehicle Service Type: Car\nKey Features:\nEmergency Charging:\n• Versatile Use: Ideal for situations where the car battery is low, the car has been left unused for a long time, the battery is worn out, or the car can\'t start due to insufficient voltage in winter.\n• Quick Solution: This starting power pack can easily solve these problems, getting your car up and running quickly.\nCold-Resistant:\n• Durable in Extreme Cold: The lithium battery features a built-in smart power IC, allowing it to operate even in temperatures below -20°C.\nPower Display:\n• Digital Equipment Use: Can also charge your digital devices.\nPracticality:\n• Travel-Friendly: Ideal for use while traveling, ensuring you have a reliable power source on hand.\nSafe Protection:\n• Advanced Safety Features: Includes overcurrent protection, overload protection, overvoltage protection, overcharging protection, and high-temperature protection.\n• Ensured Safety: These technologies provide comprehensive safety for all users.', 0, 0, 0),
('98adf5e1-67f2-479f-9193-879519618356', 'VNT-TLS-0013', 'Car Luminous Tire Valve Cap(4 pcs set)', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 8, 6, 54, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-968.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-746.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-807.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-196.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-327.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-592.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-luminous-tire-valve-cap4-pcs-set-78-322.jpg"]', 'Car Luminous Tire Valve Cap(4 pcs set)', 'Introducing the Luminous Car Tire Valve\nElevate your vehicle\'s appearance and visibility with our mesmerizing Luminous Car Tire Valve!\nIlluminate Your Wheels: These tire valves are designed to add an extra layer of brilliance to your car. Equipped with built-in LED lights, your tires will radiate a captivating glow, making your vehicle a true spectacle, both day and night.\nEffortless Installation: No need for complex tools or wiring. Simply screw the Luminous Car Tire Valve onto your tire\'s valve stem, and you\'re good to go!\nEnhanced Safety: Beyond their stylish appearance, these valve caps enhance your on-road safety by increasing your visibility to other drivers, making nighttime driving a breeze.\nUniversal Compatibility: Our Luminous Car Tire Valve is designed to fit most standard valve stems, making them an ideal accessory for cars, trucks, motorcycles, and even bicycles!\nElevate your vehicle\'s aesthetics and safety with the Luminous Car Tire Valve – the ultimate combination of functionality and style. Prepare to turn heads and shine brightly on the road!\nUpgrade your vehicle\'s aesthetics and safety with the Luminous Car Valve – the perfect blend of functionality and style. Get ready to turn heads and light up the road!', 0, 0, 1),
('b5eabe9c-0a93-4077-b76f-b86eaa889ca4', 'VNT-TLS-0014', 'Car Windshield Sun Shade', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 13, NULL, 55, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-windshield-sun-shade-57-001.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-windshield-sun-shade-57-002.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-windshield-sun-shade-57-974.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/car-windshield-sun-shade-57-379.jpg"]', 'Car Windshield Sun Shade', 'Keep Your Car Cool and Comfortable Say goodbye to scorching heat inside your car! The BrellaShield is the fast and easy solution to keep your car cool and comfortable during hot summer days. Just like an umbrella, pop it open and expand it to fit against your car\'s windshield effortlessly.\nEasy to Store and Install No more hassle with bulky shades! Click the locking latch, and the BrellaShield quickly shuts into a compact size. Easily store it in your glove box, door panel, or under the seat without taking up extra space.\nUniversal Fit for Most Vehicles No need to worry about compatibility. The BrellaShield collapses to less than 1 square foot, and its universal size fits the windshields of most trucks, cars, and SUVs.\nProtect Your Car\'s Interior Keep your car\'s interior safe from intense heat and harmful UV rays. The BrellaShield reflects sunlight to help maintain a cooler temperature inside your vehicle. It also protects against fading and cracking of upholstery and dashboards.\nPrivacy and Safety Enjoy privacy while keeping your vehicle at a safe temperature. Block the sun\'s rays and create shade for your car, truck, SUV, or RV with ease, using the BrellaShield. It\'s not only easy to use but also simple to store when not in use.\nExperience the convenience and protection of the BrellaShield - your perfect companion for a cooler and more comfortable driving experience!', 1, 1, 0),
('580f251c-8111-4a1f-80ca-2f4742768db4', 'VNT-TLS-0015', 'Auto Rebound Abs Wheel With Elbow Support', 'VANTA TLS', 'tools', 32, 28, 56, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/auto-rebound-abs-wheel-with-elbow-support-33-796.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/auto-rebound-abs-wheel-with-elbow-support-33-918.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/auto-rebound-abs-wheel-with-elbow-support-33-065.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/auto-rebound-abs-wheel-with-elbow-support-33-260.jpg"]', 'Auto Rebound Abs Wheel With Elbow Support', 'Perfect Abs with Ab Roller!\nSculpt your abs effortlessly, whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast or a professional athlete. Achieve confidence in your summer bikini with the help of an abs roller!\nHigh-Quality Construction:\nThe wheel is crafted from durable, impact-resistant material, ensuring longevity. The handle features EVA foam for enhanced comfort, and the rubber wide wheels are not only durable but also floor-friendly and silent.\nEfficient Abs Training:\nMake your abs training more effective with just a few minutes each day. Strengthen your core and improve stability, contributing to enhanced performance in other exercises.\nVersatile and Convenient:\nThe abs roller is your go-to workout tool anywhere, anytime. Whether at home, in the office, or at the gym, its small and portable design allows you to incorporate abs training into your routine without time or location constraints.\nAll-Round Abdominal Exercise:\nTarget not only the rectus abdominis but also stimulate deep abdominal muscle groups like external obliques and transverse abdominis. Achieve a more three-dimensional and shapely abs line!\nEnhance your fitness journey with the efficiency and versatility of the abs roller, paving the way for stronger and well-defined abdominal muscles!', 0, 0, 0),
