ing skin, and loss of elasticity and firmness.\n• [numbuzin 9, PRO TIP] Pair No.9 Eye Cream with No.9 Eye Patches to maximize lifting and firming! Place No.9 Eye Patches on top of the areas where you applied No.9 Eye Cream. Use consistently for visibly more volumized and revitalized skin.', 0, 0, 0),
('bf0d74ea-2bfb-4082-950c-b0d9ec7d0b2a', 'VNT-BTY-0018', 'Medicube Neck Wrinkle Cream', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 14, 12, 74, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61GNP2d5SyL._SL1500__6a85962126b79.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71aQtvoX5XL._SL1500__6a8596212b705.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71lT+luyZTL._SL1500__6a8596213032f.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71pgkwMbPpL._SL1500__6a85962134ba4.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/81ggy6Ay5YL._SL1500__6a85962139538.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/715E9rSGdGL._SL1500__6a8596213e662.jpg"]', 'Medicube Neck Wrinkle Cream', 'TURN, GLIDE & FIRM] Turn the applicator, gently squeeze to dispense the cream, then glide the built-in gua sha head along the jawline, neck, and décolleté. Inspired by sculpting massage techniques, the applicator helps elevate your daily firming ritual.\n• [YOUTHFUL-LOOKING CARE] Powered by PDRN and Volufiline 5%, this cream helps improve the appearance of fine lines and visible signs of aging while supporting firmer, fuller-looking skin.\n• [BUILT-IN GUA SHA APPLICATOR] Features a curved massage head designed to hug the jawline, neck, and décolleté for targeted contour care. The hygienic twist on/off applicator makes it easy to incorporate into your daily skincare routine.\n• [HELPS TARGET TECH NECK CONCERNS] Helps visibly smooth the appearance of horizontal neck lines and supports firmer, more elastic-looking skin affected by daily screen-time habits.\n• [JAWLINE TO DÉCOLLETÉ CARE] Designed to extend your skincare routine beyond the face, helping care for the jawline, neck, collarbone, and décolleté area with a lightweight, non-sticky finish.\n• [5-MINUTE DAILY MASSAGE ROUTINE] Twist, apply, and massage with the all-in-one gua sha applicator for an easy daily firming ritual without sticky residue.', 0, 0, 1),
('1415855b-a1bc-47f9-b6a7-f4eb776968ff', 'VNT-BTY-0019', 'Black Hair Dye Stick for Instant Gray Coverage & Root Touch Up', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 13, 11, 75, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61R3KUt3+PL._AC_SL1500__6a6d6f6053693.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71cc+5xkGyL._AC_SL1500__6a6d6f60588e7.jpg"]', 'Black Hair Dye Stick for Instant Gray Coverage & Root Touch Up', '[Black Instant Gray Coverage] Quickly cover gray or uneven hair color with our black hair dye stick, designed for fast and natural-looking touch-ups. The smooth stick texture glides easily across roots or small areas for even application. The temporary color blends seamlessly with your natural shade and can be washed off easily with shampoo. Perfect for daily use, travel, or emergencies when you need quick coverage that looks natural and fresh.\n• [Convenient & Portable] This hair dye stick is compact and easy to carry, ideal for quick touch-ups anywhere. Simply twist up and apply directly to the desired area for even coverage. Its lightweight design fits easily into purses, makeup bags, or travel cases. Whether for home or travel, it provides a simple solution for maintaining consistent hair color at any time.\n• [Natural Finish] Achieve a soft, natural finish that blends evenly with your existing hair color. The delivers a realistic tone that does not appear harsh or overly dark. Designed for both men and women, this hair dye stick creates a refreshed look that feels natural and confident. Perfect for short-term use and special occasions where quick results are needed.\n• [Waterproof & Sweat-Resistant] Stay worry-free in daily activities with the waterproof and sweat-resistant formula that keeps your color in place. Whether during hot weather or light workouts, this dye stick helps maintain coverage without smudging. The temporary color stays put until shampooed, ensuring you look polished and confident all day.\n• [Easy to Wash Off] The temporary hair color can be easily removed with regular shampoo, leaving no residue or stains on hair or skin. It provides a clean, mess-free coloring experience suitable for any hair care routine. Ideal for users who prefer flexibility and do not want permanent hair dye.\n• [Smooth Application] The soft texture allows for smooth and controlled coloring. Apply directly to roots or sections that need blending without requiring tools or mixing. The even color distribution ensures consistent coverage every time, providing a neat finish with minimal effort.', 0, 1, 0),
('7654712f-1107-48dd-8840-8816746b4d04', 'VNT-BTY-0020', 'Marvis Smokers Whitening Mint toothpaste', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 15, NULL, 76, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m4_6a4e5f442a036.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m3_6a4e5f442d8a7.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m2_6a4e5f4434709.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m1_6a4e5f44354f0.jpg"]', 'Marvis Smokers Whitening Mint toothpaste', 'Transform your smile and teeth-cleaning ritual with the Whitening Mint Toothpaste from luxury Italian toothpaste brand Marvis; a refreshing, creamy teeth-whitening toothpaste in a cool mint flavour that whitens and protects teeth while freshening breath. Developed to keep teeth and gums healthy whilst preventing decay, the toothpaste utilises gentle a xylitol and sorbitan-based formula to cleanse and condition the teeth without irritation. Experience luxurious and contemporary oral hygiene.\nAbout the brand:\nMarvis is a ‘heritage toothpaste’ which first came onto the market in the 1950s. When it comes to dental hygiene, you want the best for your teeth, not simply a fashion product - but Marvis deliver top quality dental hygiene alongside a striking visual style.\nHow to use:\n1. Brush twice a day for at least two minutes each time.\n2. Use in conjunction with mouthwash.\n3. Use a soft or medium bristled toothbrush.\n4. Replace your toothbrush every 2-3 months.\nHighlights\n• Whitens and brightens teeth whilst preventing tooth\n• Helps in decay and fighting tartar and plaque\n• Features the sharp taste of cool mint for lasting freshness\n• Helps in fighting germs and prevent toothache', 1, 0, 0),
('3c52f213-1459-4820-aaa0-807b70943db5', 'VNT-BTY-0021', 'LAOZIK™ All-in-One Laser Eraser Pen', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 24, 20, 77, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/af4b36da89b31a30b7faec5cf39b0a3b_6a37484564380.jpg"]', 'LAOZIK™ All-in-One Laser Eraser Pen', 'If you struggle with skin imperfections that undermine your confidence, this is the most important article you’ll read this year.\nFinally, A Real Solution for Unwanted Skin Imperfections\nOver my career, I’ve consulted with thousands of individuals, many of whom felt like they were in a losing battle against their own skin. They came to me with a host of frustrating issues:\n– Embarrassing Skin Tags\n– Unsightly Moles\n– Stubborn Warts\n– Telltale Age & Dark Spots\nI’ve seen how these small marks can cause a huge decline in self-esteem, making someone feel older than they are and disconnected from the person they see in the mirror.\nFor years, the only real solutions were expensive, in-clinic procedures. But it wasn’t until I uncovered the real reason these imperfections appear that I finally found a way to help people take back control of their skin, safely and affordably, right from their own home.\nThe Shocking Root Cause of Skin Blemishes\nWhat if those moles, skin tags, and dark spots aren’t just random signs of aging?\nThe real issue may be something called “Epidermal Chaos.” In our youth, the skin naturally renews itself through a process called cellular turnover, which efficiently clears away dead cells and minor imperfections before they surface.\nOver time, however, aging, sun exposure, and daily stress slow this process down. The skin’s natural “cleanup crew” becomes overwhelmed, allowing small cellular glitches—like excess skin or pigment clusters—to linger. These eventually show up as skin tags, dark spots, or other blemishes that become permanent features.', 0, 0, 0),
