('ae21b010-e695-4ee8-9ede-325b41765fdf', 'VNT-BTY-0024', 'Lavender Skin Care Cream', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 13, 10, 15, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61MaASvcNpL._AC_SX522__6a037307ea103.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71A6TjISoRL._AC_SL1500__6a037307eaaa8.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71TpwC0WHCL._AC_SL1500__6a037307f0029.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71VmD6w1X6L._AC_SL1500__6a03730800f2a.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/716LSi3SqDL._AC_SL1500__6a03730805a89.jpg"]', 'Lavender Skin Care Cream', 'Powerful Scar Healing: The NOVOLAN Lavender Skin Care Cream is expertly designed to promote healing for various types of scars, including those from burns, surgery, and injuries. Infused with natural ingredients, the cream works to soften and diminish the appearance of scars over time, helping to restore confidence in your skin’s appearance.\n• Effective for Stretch Marks: This cream not only addresses existing scars but also helps to prevent and reduce the appearance of stretch marks. Ideal for use during pregnancy or periods of rapid weight gain, the nourishing formula supports skin elasticity, keeping it hydrated and supple, while working to minimize the visible lines associated with stretch marks.\n• Acne Scar Reduction: Formulated to target the specific needs of acne-prone skin, this lavender cream works effectively to reduce the appearance of acne scars and blemish marks. Its gentle yet powerful ingredients help to fade discoloration while promoting an even skin tone, allowing you to feel confident showcasing clear, healthy skin.\n• Deep Hydration for All Skin Types: The NOVOLAN Lavender Skin Care Cream is designed to deeply moisturize and hydrate all skin types, combating dryness effectively. The rich texture absorbs quickly without feeling greasy, ensuring your skin feels nourished and refreshed with each application. Incorporate this cream into your daily skincare routine for optimal hydration.\n• Multi-Purpose Skin Repair: More than just a scar cream, NOVOLAN Lavender Skin Care Cream is versatile enough to be used for various skin repair needs. Whether it’s calming irritation, minimizing scars, or leaving your skin feeling soft and hydrated, this cream is an essential part of any skincare regimen, earning its place in your beauty routine', 0, 1, 0),
('e936159f-5009-4453-ab84-06899e8f1c63', 'VNT-BTY-0025', 'Scalpy Hair Growth Serum for Hair Loss & Thinning', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 19, 15, 16, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_82_61TDzg0I2lL._AC_SL1500__69eb65eb9e729.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_114_614RWEIhH7L._AC_SL1500__69eb65eb9fecc.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_122_61cAOwn303L._AC_SL1464__69eb65eba39dd.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_90_61wWYazY1qL._AC_SL1500__69eb65eba713b.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_98_71YVDZ5ZsQL._AC_SL1500__69eb65ebaaa3e.jpg"]', 'Scalpy Hair Growth Serum for Hair Loss & Thinning', 'HAIR GROWTH & HAIR LOSS PREVENTION – Clinically tested to reactivate dormant follicles, reverse thinning, and prevent hair loss for thicker, fuller hair.\n• PET-SAFE, MINOXIDIL-FREE FORMULA WITH PROVEN INGREDIENTS – Salicylic Acid, Dex-Panthenol, and L-Menthol along with mineral-rich Glacier Water strengthen roots and accelerate hair growth. No parabens, silicones, or harsh chemicals.\n• NON-GREASY, COOLING SCALP TREATMENT – Fast-absorbing formula that instantly cools down the scalp and soothes the follicles without leaving a greasy residue. Maintains the hair volume without weighing down the roots.\n• INNOVATIVE TRIPLE ROLLER APPLICATOR FOR MAXIMUM ABSORPTION – A metal-ball massaging applicator delivers the formula directly to the roots, boosting blood flow and ensuring deep penetration, hence better results.\n• USE DAILY & FOR ALL HAIR AND SCALP TYPES – Perfect for both men and women with any hair or scalp types. Use daily for best results and experience stronger, thicker, and healthier hair over time.', 0, 0, 0),
