('66a38807-61e0-4e1e-af3f-96ba087befd6', 'VNT-BTY-0031', 'Botox Bee Venom Cream', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 12, 10, 22, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bo5_697b9a0e281f5.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bo4_697b9a0e28eff.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bo3_697b9a0e29bc9.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bo2_697b9a0e2a936.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bo1_697b9a0e2b512.jpg"]', 'Botox Bee Venom Cream', 'Powerful Anti-Aging & Wrinkle Reduction- This Bee Venom Wrinkle Removal Cream is specially formulated to lift, tighten, and rejuvenate your skin, visibly reducing fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother, younger-looking complexion. Bee venom works as a natural alternative to Botox by stimulating collagen and elastin production, helping to diminish crow’s feet, forehead lines, and sagging skin over time.\n• Multi-Purpose Skincare Formula – Firming & Hydrating- Unlike ordinary face creams, this Bee Venom Face Cream combines anti-wrinkle, firming, and deep moisturizing benefits in one powerful formula. It not only helps tighten loose skin but also provides intense hydration, leaving your skin plump, soft, and radiant. Perfect for those looking for an all-in-one solution to combat aging while maintaining skin moisture.\n• Skin Firming for Face & Body – Boosts Collagen- This Bee Venom Cream promotes firmer, more elastic skin by enhancing collagen production, which helps restore youthful bounce and reduce sagging. Use it on your face, neck, décolletage, hands, and even legs to improve skin texture and achieve a smoother, lifted appearance over time.\n• Deep Hydration for Soft, Supple Skin- Dry, dull skin can make wrinkles appear worse—this cream locks in moisture with nourishing ingredients that hydrate and revitalize your skin. The rich yet lightweight formula absorbs quickly without greasiness, leaving your skin silky-soft and refreshed all day long.\n• Gentle & Suitable for All Skin Types- Whether you have dry, oily, sensitive, or combination skin, this Natural Bee Venom Cream is gentle yet effective for daily use. Free from harsh chemicals, it’s a safe, non-irritating addition to any skincare routine. Apply it morning and night for best results and enjoy healthier, younger-looking skin with continued use!\n• Why Choose Our Bee Venom Cream?- Reduces wrinkles & fine lines, Lifts & firms sagging skin, Boosts collagen for elasticity Deeply hydrates & nourishes, Safe for face & body – all skin types -Transform your skincare routine with this luxurious, results-driven cream and reveal a more youthful, radiant complexion! Click "Add to Cart" now and experience the effects of bee venom at home!', 0, 0, 0),
