HIUM CORONARIUM ROOT EXTRACT, MANGIFERA INDICA (MANGO) LEAF EXTRACT, POTASSIUM SORBATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE, JANIA RUBENS EXTRACT, ASCORBIC ACID, SODIUM CITRATE, ENGELHARDTIA CHRYSOLEPIS LEAF EXTRACT, CI 14700/RED 4, CALLICARPA JAPONICA FRUIT EXTRACT [V2925A]', 0, 0, 1),
('551a0d3d-8f9a-4358-ab25-d4dc6f7e7f3d', 'VNT-BTY-0039', 'Silky Splash Vamaro Shaver', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 31, 25, 30, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/s5_68bac772165cd.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757071284_8d577c4cdfde002f1053.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757071287_e02d44a1a80d2c5fd014.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757071290_63c653eee70cb32f8572.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1757071292_301438520f0764c7bedb.jpg"]', 'Silky Splash Vamaro Shaver', 'SilkySplash 2 in 1 Women\'s Razor and Trimmer - Smooth, Precision & Total Freedom:\n• SILK SMOOTH SKIN IN SECONDS - Forget skin irritation and prolonged shaves - SilkySplash shaver ensures smooth, well-groomed skin in seconds. Whether dry or in the shower, thanks to its skin-friendly technology and precise tips, it glides smoothly across your skin without redness, pimples, without compromise.\n• The perfect shave - Smooth smooth: With the SilkySplash razor, you can tailor your shave exactly to your needs. The trimmer tip gently cuts hair to desired length, while the smooth tip ensures silky smooth skin without hair. Thanks to its skin-friendly technology, the shaver is suitable for all areas of the body, whether it be legs, armpits or sensitive areas. Maximum accuracy, exactly as you want\n• Dual Function 2 in 1 - Klyne 2.0 combines a trimmer for large areas (legs, arms) and a precision razor for sensitive areas: jersey, armpits and face, a complete and effective solution for smooth skin in minutes.\n• Wet & Dry Use - IPX7 Waterproof: In the shower or dry, Klyne shaver adapts to your preferences, its 3D floating film and micro-vibration allow for a precise, soft and safe shave even in the finest curves.\n• Fast charging and long battery life: thanks to USB-C charging, a full charge is possible in 30-45 minutes for up to 60 minutes of battery life. CONVENIENT - Up to 25 uses per charge, ideal for express touch-ups or travel.\n• Compact, practical, always ready: thanks to its ergonomic shape and compact size, it fits easily into a bag or toiletry bag and is always at hand.', 0, 1, 0),
