('fa809532-6cf3-4c8c-a7b5-ec1bc2fba16d', 'VNT-BTY-0042', 'Temulawak - New Acne Removing Serum (Original)', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 19, 15, 33, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/n4_68aee3f251a78.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756292106_c17231e00bc01a5760c7.webp","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756292109_11aad26b22f25e7717c5.webp","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756292111_c7c5e72262b33a56a153.webp","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1756292114_df4cc42da0aa0c690790.webp"]', 'Temulawak - New Acne Removing Serum (Original)', 'Temulawak New Acne Removing Serum is a targeted skincare treatment designed to fight acne, repair skin damage, and reduce acne scars. Enriched with natural extracts and nourishing ingredients, this serum helps soothe irritated skin, fade blemishes, and restore a healthy, smooth complexion. It is formulated for quick action, showing results within 2 days of use.\nFeatures\n2-Day Effective Formula – Quick action against acne and skin blemishes.\nAcne Removing – Fights active breakouts effectively.\nScar Reducing – Helps fade acne scars and marks.\nRepairing – Restores damaged and irritated skin.\nNourishing – Improves overall skin texture and health.\nNatural Temulawak extract for skin healing benefits.\nNet content: 15 ml.', 0, 0, 1),
('7193cfc7-b5d3-4b04-8fa3-a8a8d410b029', 'VNT-BTY-0043', 'Scalp Massage Brush with Oil Applicator', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 71, 55, 34, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51jngbGxCTL._AC_SL1000__68a8a021c573d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61EgkXuI7LL._AC_SY879__68a8a021c67d5.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61LT1-pPBXL._AC_SL1000__68a8a021c7349.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61REeJAOW7L._AC_SX679__68a8a021c8af4.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71fiG+rZQ+L._AC_SY879__68a8a021c98c9.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/716C4Ja0ngL._AC_SL1500__68a8a021ca927.jpg"]', 'Scalp Massage Brush with Oil Applicator', '【EFFICIENT OIL APPLICATION】: This essential oil scalp massage brush features high-frequency vibrations and 8 flexible comb teeth that conform to your scalp. The built-in serum chamber makes applying essential oils easy and efficient while massaging your scalp.\n• 【360° HUMAN】: The brush mimics the soothing touch of human hands, offering a 360° kneading massage with three modes (soothing, refreshing, relaxing) and 72 massaging bristles for a spa-like experience.\n• 【RED AND BLUE LIGHT 3-in-1 THERAPY】: The soothing vibrations relieve scalp tension, while thermostatic red and blue light therapy opens pores for better absorption and promotes hair growth.\n• 【COMPREHENSIVE CARE】: Comb, massage, and deliver nutrients directly to the scalp with each stroke, ensuring uniform application of liquid and a 360-degree massage for efficient scalp and hair root care.\n• 【PORTABLE】: Equipped with a Type-C charging cable, the scalp massager charges fully in one hour and lasts up to ten days. It automatically stops after 10 minutes of continuous use to protect the device.', 0, 0, 0),
('d3111dc3-855e-470d-aece-959664e620e1', 'VNT-BTY-0044', 'Retinal Shot Tightening Booster', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 12, NULL, 35, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61mOw9421pL._AC_SX679__68a2ddf0a0edc.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61qntyT4quL._AC_SX679__68a2ddf0a1c65.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61sWoVn4YnL._AC_SX679__68a2ddf0a27c5.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71cdi3D9xGL._AC_SX679__68a2ddf0a3318.jpg"]', 'Retinal Shot Tightening Booster', 'Restore skin elasticity: repair age-related damage highly effectively with the retinol shot tightening serum. Our cream binds up to 1000x more moisture than conventional products. Ideal for dry, mature and sensitive skin - provides 24 hours of long-term hydration without a sticky feeling.\n• Fast absorption + make-up foundation: light texture with instant effect, technology absorbs the cream within 20 seconds, forms a matting protective film - perfect as a make-up base. Non-comedogenic for men and women.\n• 【Handy】Small and elegant, it fits easily into any cosmetic bag thanks to its portable design and is convenient and space-saving to use anywhere.\n• Gentle skin care: This booster focuses on restoring skin vitality and provides gentle care for all skin types, minimises irritation and provides a mild yet effective solution, especially for sensitive skin.\n• Advanced formula: With innovative ingredients that penetrate deep into the bottom layer of the skin, our formula provides remarkable regeneration and a radiant, youthful glow.', 0, 1, 0);
