('b8df6753-cec1-4b42-994f-0d616285954f', 'VNT-BTY-0046', 'Collagen Lifting Body Oil, Beauty Women Tight Skin', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 9, 8, 37, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754576393_c766bc60e394b22e1c26.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754576393_265b6b24ea608358782b.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754576393_d4b75b85163df771845b.jpg"]', 'Collagen Lifting Body Oil, Beauty Women Tight Skin', 'Lift body skin and improve female curves.2: Pure natural plant formula, safe and non-irritating.3: Make the skin smooth, hydrated and moisturized.4: It helps to open the absorption channel of the skin and improve the absorption rate of nutrients.5: Bust/buttocks will become moisturized, firm and plump.Product Specifications:Name: Collagen Boosting Body OilCapacity: 30mlPacking list: 1 bottle of body oilKind tips:1. Due to manual measurement, please allow 1-3mm error. Please make sure you don\'t mind before bidding.2. Colors may vary due to display differences, please understand.\nHighlights\n• 【BeautyWomen Collagen Lifting Body Oil】Nurture the appearance of lifted, youthful skin with collagen lifting body oil. Your vitamin e oil helps firm and hydrate sluggish skin with clean ingredients, skin that is smoother and softer.\n• 【Ingredient Safety】BeautyWomen Collagen Lifting Body Oil is made from 100% natural ingredients, ensuring that it is safe for your skin while providing you with a quality product.\n• 【Lifting And Tightening】Herbal Essence Collagen lifting body oil moisten immediately and fill wrinkles, minimize the appearance of fine lines with visible results after the first application.\n• 【Anti Aging Collagen Serum】Instantly ageless collagen lifting body oil can stimulate, the production of collagen to help you solve the wrinkle.\n• 【For All Skin Types】BeautyWomen Collagen Lifting Body Oil is ideal for all skin types. Suitable for the anti-aging needs of women of different ages', 0, 0, 1),
('d8a92963-969a-4e95-8c06-ea178b6bbc75', 'VNT-BTY-0047', 'Pack of 2 FEG Hair Growth Spray Plus Derma Roller, Suitable For Both Men and Women', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 35, NULL, 38, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1122_688cc5a5e73de.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754418272_7a7ec7b1538b12bcbb74.jpg"]', 'Pack of 2 FEG Hair Growth Spray Plus Derma Roller, Suitable For Both Men and Women', 'ZFMCGHAD73238164', 0, 0, 0),
('a053cc5a-1c71-460b-95d5-5c5a04b04ac9', 'VNT-BTY-0048', 'Bubble Plant Hair Dye', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 18, 15, 39, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51TyPawEQ8L._AC_SX679__688b5be28e9a8.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61x0EObsCYL._AC_SX679__688b5be28f811.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71NqnUZTXsL._AC_SY300_SX300_QL70_ML2__688b5be2905c5.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71yuZVM7JtL._AC_SX679__688b5be29080d.jpg"]', 'Bubble Plant Hair Dye', 'Natural Bubble Dye? : Different from traditional hair dye. Herbal essence formula, mild and non-irritating, nourish the scalp and supplement the nutrients needed by the hair.\n• ?Color Conditioner Shampoo?: Gentle and nourishing to the scalp, also protects your scalp from drying out, locks in moisture and shine, and controls frizz.Unlike the traditional hair color shampoo, natural plant hair dye shampoo creates rich bubbles that won\'t stain your skin.\n• ?Gray Hair Coverage? : Bubble Hair Dye is Suitable for all types of hair, including thick, fine and normal-density hair, as well as straight or curly hair textures. Effectively cover gray hair, you will no longer be affected by gray hair.\n• ?How To Use?: Requiring no bowl or brush, just put on plastic gloves, apply the instant hair dye shampoo on your hair, massage for 5- 10 minutes , After 20 Minutes Rinse Well With Clean Water. Finally You Will Have Shiny Color Hair You Like.\n• ?Save Time & Money?: With this hair dye shampoo, you can dye hair at home. Forget long and costly visits to hair salons. You can now dye your hair quickly and easily at home by yourself and save a ton of money.', 1, 0, 0),
('8701eb97-3b1a-4f63-baf9-83564693742b', 'VNT-BTY-0049', '120ML Hair Removal Spray', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 14, 12, 40, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-564.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-693.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-845.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-048.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-561.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/120ml-hair-removal-spray-697-557.jpg"]', '120ML Hair Removal Spray', '3YWCMDBD01249261', 0, 1, 0),
('da6fe9d9-4d5f-483f-ad87-9d2c505cc49e', 'VNT-BTY-0050', 'Automatic Curling Iron', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 25, NULL, 41, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/automatic-curling-iron-693-745.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/automatic-curling-iron-693-573.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/automatic-curling-iron-693-635.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/automatic-curling-iron-693-934.jpg"]', 'Automatic Curling Iron', 'Ones-Click Wonder: Say goodbye to complicated styling and hello to our Automatic Hair Curler! With its One-Click Curl Design, achieving beautiful curls is just a button press away. No skills required, just an easy and safe way to get the curls you crave.\n• ?Efficient Curling: Achieve stunning curls effortlessly with our Automatic Hair Curler. Its ability to adapt to different hair types with 360 degree rotation and 3 free choice of heating temperature ensures an efficient curling experience.\n• ?Fine Protection: The Automatic Hair Curler\'s Safety Closure Design pairs with its Auto Shut-Off function, ensuring stress-free styling with no actions detected for 60 minutes.\n• ?Frizz-free Hair: Flaunt your hair with our Automatic Hair Curler. Its negative ions give hair a nourishing touch, reduce frizz, and create fluffy and soft hairstyles. The 32mm lazy big roll allows quick styling, making it perfect for lazy days.\n• ?Harm-Reducing Curling: Our advanced hair curler locks in hair moisture with negative ions that protect each cuticle, reducing harm and friction for ultra-smooth, lasting curls. Say goodbye to frizz and hello to healthy-looking hair with every use.', 0, 0, 1),
('08fa87b7-f9b8-49cf-9822-1be7f11d4614', 'VNT-BTY-0051', 'Turmeric and Kojic Acid Pads', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 15, 12, 42, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/turmeric-and-kojic-acid-pads-690-572.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/turmeric-and-kojic-acid-pads-690-528.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/turmeric-and-kojic-acid-pads-690-502.jpg"]', 'Turmeric and Kojic Acid Pads', 'Brighten & Even Skin Tone\nInfused with natural brighteners, these pads help reduce dark spots, discoloration, and hyperpigmentation. Turmeric and Kojic Acid work together to give your skin a radiant, even-toned glow with consistent use.\n???? Powerful Results\nSee visible improvement in skin clarity and tone within days. Regular use promotes a smoother, brighter complexion, reduces dullness, and restores your skin’s natural glow.\n???? Fights Acne\nFormulated to unclog pores, reduce inflammation, and prevent breakouts. Turmeric’s anti-inflammatory properties and Kojic Acid’s antibacterial benefits help clear and calm acne-prone skin.\n???? Nourish & Revitalize\nThese pads not only treat skin concerns but also deeply nourish your skin. Packed with antioxidants, they help hydrate, soothe, and protect your skin barrier—leaving it soft, fresh, and healthy.', 0, 0, 0),
('535e5895-9b8d-4519-911d-18211deac9ec', 'VNT-BTY-0052', 'CC Cream High Definition Radiance Face Cream', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 22, 18, 43, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cc-cream-high-definition-radiance-face-cream-688-432.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cc-cream-high-definition-radiance-face-cream-688-268.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cc-cream-high-definition-radiance-face-cream-688-373.jpg"]', 'CC Cream High Definition Radiance Face Cream', 'Visible Results\nGet camera-ready skin every day! This CC Cream instantly improves skin tone, blurs imperfections, and gives your face a radiant, airbrushed finish. Expect smoother, brighter, and more even-looking skin from the first use.\n???? Key Benefits\nCorrects uneven skin tone and discoloration\nProvides natural-looking coverage with a radiant glow\nHydrates and smooths the skin throughout the day\nBlurs fine lines and imperfections\nActs as a primer, moisturizer, and foundation in one\nSuitable for all skin types\n???? Power Ingredients\nNiacinamide – Brightens and evens out skin tone\nHyaluronic Acid – Deeply hydrates and plumps skin\nVitamin C – Boosts radiance and reduces dullness\nSPF Protection – Shields skin from harmful UV rays\nBotanical Extracts – Calm and nourish sensitive skin\n???? How to Use\nStart with clean, moisturized skin.\nApply a small amount of CC Cream to your face using fingers, sponge, or brush.\nBlend evenly for natural coverage and glow.\nCan be worn alone or under foundation for extra coverage.', 0, 0, 0),
('9642c77e-6eab-44ec-811c-b51d7c3b8f75', 'VNT-BTY-0053', 'Medical Scar Removal Spray', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 8, NULL, 44, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-036.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-714.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-236.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-653.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-395.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-176.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-487.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/medical-scar-removal-spray-685-228.jpg"]', 'Medical Scar Removal Spray', 'Proregen Medical Scar Removal Spray: our formula helps promote skin firmness and elasticity to reduce the appearance of most types of scars.\n• Scar Remove Medical Grade Scar Spray: after the skin is damaged, the body produces excess free radicals and inflammatory reactions, leading to scar formation. vitamin e can neutralize free radicals and reduce inflammatory reactions, thereby promoting scar healing and reducing scar formation.\n• Scar Removal Spray: efficient care, finally provide customers with the most gentle and skin-friendly nutrition, suitable for all skin types.\n• Acne Scar Treatment for Face: The Advanced Scar Spray forms a breathable layer to increase the skin hydration, protect the scar tissue, normalize the collagen synthesis and balance the skin growth procedure,which can make your skin look smooth and even!\n• For all skin: Our Proregen Medical Scar Removal Spray, including only natural components, release and ensuring it suits even most sensitive skin with parabens, sulfates, and fragrance-free composition? helps flat and smooth scar texture in all skin types.', 0, 0, 0),
('833a84fe-9620-4b4e-8032-2848a6b48677', 'VNT-BTY-0054', 'Heated Eyelash Curlers', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 13, 10, 45, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-462.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-574.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-783.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-247.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-813.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heated-eyelash-curlers-651-103.jpg"]', 'Heated Eyelash Curlers', 'Effortless Curling: Achieve beautifully curled lashes with minimal effort. Our Heated Eyelash Curler simplifies the curling process, eliminating the need for traditional, manual curlers.\n• Advanced Heating Technology: Utilizes cutting-edge heating elements to ensure safe and precise temperature control. Say goodbye to the risk of over-heating or pinching your lashes.\n• Rechargeable Convenience: Powered by a rechargeable battery, eliminating the need for disposable batteries. It\'s an eco-friendly and cost-effective choice for lash maintenance.\n• Portable Design: Compact and handheld, these curlers are designed for on-the-go use. Slip them into your purse or makeup bag for quick touch-ups wherever you are.\n• Beauty On-Demand: Ideal for both everyday use and special occasions, these curlers provide you with the flexibility to enhance your lashes whenever you desire.', 0, 1, 1),
('b94f3c1c-a10d-4678-89a2-568f1e013ab7', 'VNT-BTY-0055', 'New Hair Darkening Shampoo Bar, Natural Organic Conditioner', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 15, 12, 46, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/new-hair-darkening-shampoo-bar,-natural-organic-conditioner-625-935.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/new-hair-darkening-shampoo-bar,-natural-organic-conditioner-625-423.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/new-hair-darkening-shampoo-bar,-natural-organic-conditioner-625-939.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/new-hair-darkening-shampoo-bar,-natural-organic-conditioner-625-580.jpg"]', 'New Hair Darkening Shampoo Bar, Natural Organic Conditioner', 'Natural Safety:Our hair darkening shampoo bar safer compare to any traditional shampoo while bringing you a shiny & vivid hair look.\n• Maintenance and Repair:Hair darkening shampoo bar provides an all-around hair care as black soap for gray hair keeps the scalp healthy and hair’s natural moist and shine.\n• Easy to Use:Darkening shampoo bar is suitable for all hair types. black soap perfect for both men and women is very easy to use just gently.\n• Daily Hair Care:Use natural darkening soap as a daily hair shampoo every day.Enhances hair color and maintains its brightness.insisting on long-term use of our black soap can reduce the growth of gray hair.\n• Organic Component:Black soap for gray hair made from natural Polygonum and Ginseng ingredients ect.', 1, 0, 0),
('785aadd5-15d2-4b14-91a8-fa260810723a', 'VNT-BTY-0056', 'Men Eye Cream Anti Aging', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 10, NULL, 47, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754978516_31a447c8a5754222d161.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754978516_c63bef3b57cdd3277d1c.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1754978516_6d5596b27913df6e8c18.jpg"]', 'Men Eye Cream Anti Aging', 'PEPTIDE COMPLEX: Advanced eye gel formula enriched with peptides helps reduce the appearance of dark circles and puffiness around the eyes\n• TARGETED TREATMENT: Specially formulated eye moisturiser designed for men\'s under-eye area to address fine lines and signs of fatigue\n• QUICK ABSORPTION: Lightweight gel texture absorbs rapidly into the skin without leaving any greasy residue or heavy feeling\n• CONVENIENT PACKAGING: Comes in an easy-to-use tube with precision tip applicator for controlled dispensing and hygienic application\n• DAILY USE: Suitable for morning and evening application as part of regular skincare routine for optimal results', 0, 0, 0),
