('10557d07-3f65-4c7b-8407-57f24aff0555', 'VNT-BTY-0108', 'Triple Action Eye Cream Original', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 39, 33, 34, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-706.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-599.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-411.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-507.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-188.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/triple-action-eye-cream-original-272-170.jpg"]', 'Triple Action Eye Cream Original', 'Triple Action Eye Cream: Experience a transformative eye care solution designed to enhance your natural beauty.\n• Brightens: Targets dark circles and tired eyes to give you a luminous, refreshed appearance. Our advanced formula helps to lighten discoloration and restore a youthful radiance.\n• Hydrates: Infused with rich moisturizers to deeply hydrate and plump the delicate skin around your eyes. This hydration helps to smooth fine lines and creases, leaving your skin feeling soft and supple.\n• Rejuvenates: Helps reduce puffiness and swelling, giving your eyes a revitalized and energetic look. Our powerful blend of ingredients works to restore your skin’s firmness and elasticity.\n• Fast-Absorbing: Enjoy a lightweight, non-greasy formula that absorbs quickly, allowing you to apply it seamlessly into your daily skincare routine. Perfect for use under makeup or as a part of your nighttime regimen.\n• Visible Results: With regular use, notice brighter, more hydrated, and youthful-looking eyes that truly sparkle with vitality', 0, 0, 0),
('993fbc74-c9a7-40bc-9dbc-7ca34b8ff774', 'VNT-BTY-0109', 'Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum (Original)', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 34, 28, 35, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/niacinamide-10--+-zinc-1--serum-original-271-214.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/niacinamide-10--+-zinc-1--serum-original-271-053.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/niacinamide-10--+-zinc-1--serum-original-271-702.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/niacinamide-10--+-zinc-1--serum-original-271-491.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/niacinamide-10--+-zinc-1--serum-original-271-958.jpg"]', 'Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum (Original)', 'Hydrates & Nourishes: Helps maintain skin’s natural moisture, keeping your skin soft and supple.\n• Blemish-Fighting: Reduces the appearance of blemishes, redness, and acne scars.\n• Brightening Power: Niacinamide works to even out skin tone, giving you a radiant, glowing complexion.\n• Controls Oil Production: Zinc helps regulate excess oil, reducing shine and preventing future breakouts.\n• Skin Barrier Support: Strengthens your skin’s natural barrier, protecting against environmental stressors.\n• Gentle on Skin: Perfect for sensitive, oily, or combination skin types—no irritation, just results!\n• Minimizes Pores: Tightens and refines pores, leaving your skin smooth and flawless.\n• Day & Night Use: Lightweight formula absorbs quickly, making it perfect for both morning and night routines.\n• Non-Comedogenic: Won’t clog pores—just pure skin-loving benefits', 0, 1, 0),
