('1a9066b7-2fe4-476d-8303-4c3f5a8f67eb', 'VNT-BTY-0120', 'Ultrasonic Pest Repeller', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 9, 8, 46, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ultrasonic-pest-repeller-257-220.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ultrasonic-pest-repeller-257-091.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ultrasonic-pest-repeller-257-337.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ultrasonic-pest-repeller-257-007.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ultrasonic-pest-repeller-257-524.jpg"]', 'Ultrasonic Pest Repeller', 'Principle of Repelling Insects: Utilizing low-frequency ultrasonic waves, this pest repeller stimulates the brain and auditory nervous system of mice and pests, effectively expelling various types of pests.\nQuiet and Effective: The low-frequency ultrasonic operation is quiet, odorless, and ensures a peaceful sleep environment for your family. Suitable for homes, warehouses, offices, hotels, supermarkets, hospitals, restaurants, and garages.\nLess Power Consumption: High efficiency with low power consumption, eliminating the need for batteries. A power-saving solution that effectively repels pests without any odor.\nWide Effective Coverage Area: Covering an effective area of up to 1600 SQ, place a single mouse repeller in each room for optimal results. For larger infestations, use 6-12 units to ensure comprehensive pest repelling, as ultrasonic waves may not penetrate walls or solid objects.\nEasy to Use: Simply plug the electronic repellent into a power outlet. The repellent activates when the blue light turns on, effectively repelling a variety of pests including rodents, hamsters, mice, fleas, ants, mosquitoes, flies, spiders, cockroaches, bugs, and insects.', 0, 0, 0),
