('d6381235-1e53-48b1-90b4-93d6857149d5', 'VNT-BTY-0133', 'Ordinary Suncare Filters (SPF-30) (Original)', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 52, 40, 59, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ordinary-suncare-filters-spf-30-original-237-552.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ordinary-suncare-filters-spf-30-original-237-513.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ordinary-suncare-filters-spf-30-original-237-679.jpg"]', 'Ordinary Suncare Filters (SPF-30) (Original)', 'SPF-30 Protection: Shield your skin from harmful UVA/UVB rays with broad-spectrum protection.\n• Lightweight Formula: Non-greasy and absorbs quickly, leaving your skin feeling fresh and comfortable.\n• Skin-Loving Ingredients: Enriched with antioxidants and hydrating compounds to nourish and protect your skin.\n• No White Cast: Perfect for all skin tones—leaves no white residue behind.\n• Hydration Boost: Keeps your skin moisturized throughout the day, preventing dryness.\n• Long-Lasting: Enjoy extended sun protection without constant reapplication.\n• Travel-Friendly: Compact and easy to carry, perfect for your on-the-go suncare routine.\n• Dermatologist-Approved: Safe and effective for daily use, even on sensitive skin.', 0, 0, 0),
('0f67a92c-61c8-47f1-9dec-6aa3710e8ade', 'VNT-BTY-0134', 'Mini Wax Heater Machine', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 15, NULL, 60, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-655.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-627.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-867.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-924.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-652.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-wax-heater-machine-234-781.jpg"]', 'Mini Wax Heater Machine', 'Designed to Perfection: Meticulously crafted for aesthetic excellence, ensuring a visually pleasing and sophisticated design.\nSeamless Functionality: Engineered with a focus on flawless and smooth operation, providing a user experience free from interruptions or complications.\nUnparalleled Performance: Sets a standard of excellence with performance that surpasses expectations, delivering exceptional results and efficiency.\nCompact Construction: Designed with a space-efficient and practical build, offering convenience without compromising on performance or features.', 0, 1, 1),
('c1879a03-4bb4-408e-ae05-4fca3ceaa677', 'VNT-BTY-0135', 'Smart Swab Spiral Ear Cleaner', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 10, 9, 61, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-706.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-367.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-182.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-964.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-171.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-239.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-swab-spiral-ear-cleaner-232-565.jpg"]', 'Smart Swab Spiral Ear Cleaner', 'Easy Earwax Remover: Effortlessly remove earwax by placing the spiral grooved tip into your ear, twisting, and gently extracting the wax. It\'s a simple and effective solution.\nSafe & Pain-Free: The soft and flexible silicone head ensures a safe and comfortable earwax removal experience, avoiding the risk of going too far like traditional cotton swabs.\nAs Seen On TV Product: The Smart Swab is an innovative earwax removal tool with patented technology, featured on television. Beware of fake imitations.\nWhat You Get: The set includes 1 reusable plastic handle, 16 disposable silicone tips, and 1 storage case for convenient use and storage.\nInstructions: Safe for adults (both men and women), use once or twice a week to maintain a clean and healthy ear canal. Follow the provided instructions for optimal results.', 0, 0, 0),
('96e079ad-0c6b-4bfa-9185-089b5639e5b2', 'VNT-BTY-0136', 'Facial Care Streamer', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 34, 29, 62, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-care-streamer-229-391.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-care-streamer-229-596.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-care-streamer-229-455.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-care-streamer-229-286.jpg"]', 'Facial Care Streamer', 'Multifunctional SPA Face Scarf: Naturally deep cleanses, promotes blood circulation, prevents signs of aging, adds moisture, opens pores for better penetration, reduces acne, blackheads, pigmentation spots, and eliminates sinus congestion, resulting in refreshed and revitalized skin.\nFast Dimming: Quickly dimmable in 20 seconds, providing a deep moisturizing effect with strong and lasting fog. The nano steamer produces a warm mist that is harmless to the skin, offering an enjoyable experience.\nDual-Purpose Machine: Can be used for facial intimacy to open pores and moisturize deeply. It also acts on the nose, effectively regulating the water-oil balance of the T zone, removing blackheads, and relieving nose congestion for smoother breathing.\nSafety and Leakage Prevention: The professional steamer uses high-quality ABS material, ensuring safety, environmental friendliness, and no harm to the skin. The large water tank holds 60ml, providing ample moisture without leaks. A little hot water may be released during steam generation, which is normal and not harmful.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Fits all skin types, relieving dry skin, coarse texture, large pores, dark skin, shiny face, lack of elasticity, acne spots, and fine lines. Ideal for individuals with busy lifestyles, stress, sensitive skin, and suitable for the elderly and children.', 0, 0, 0),
('9e444653-5ddc-432b-85ac-32e2a59e126c', 'VNT-BTY-0137', 'Black Hair Shampoo', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 17, NULL, 63, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-608.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-885.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-001.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-387.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-542.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-224.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/black-hair-shampoo-174-022.jpg"]', 'Black Hair Shampoo', 'FAST DYEING: Our plant extract hair dye shampoo swiftly dyes your hair, effectively covering gray strands instantly, leaving your hair shiny and beautifully black, giving you a youthful appearance.\n• SIMPLE USAGE: Just like using ordinary shampoo, wear gloves, apply the black hair shampoo, and massage it into your hair for a few minutes. It\'s incredibly easy to use.\n• SAFETY TO USE: Our herbal hair coloring shampoo is non-greasy, providing a comfortable application experience. It won\'t damage your scalp or hair and poses no harm to your overall health.\n• 400ML: With a total net content of 400ml, our hair dye shampoo offers convenient daily use at home and lasts for a considerable period, ensuring you always have it on hand.\n• PLANT EXTRACT: Enriched with pure plant serum, our hair coloring shampoo not only colors but also nourishes your hair and skin, promoting overall hair health.', 0, 0, 0),
('3334065a-4914-46e0-97e2-9a513961b272', 'VNT-BTY-0138', 'Sokany Hair Remover', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 33, 28, 64, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/sokany-hair-remover-170-906.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/sokany-hair-remover-170-995.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/sokany-hair-remover-170-947.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/sokany-hair-remover-170-873.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/sokany-hair-remover-170-786.jpg"]', 'Sokany Hair Remover', 'Introducing our versatile hair remover, designed to make grooming hassle-free and safe! Here\'s why you\'ll love it:\n• Effortless Hair Removal: Easily and safely remove even the shortest and finest hairs with precision.\n• Body & Face Hair Remover: Perfect for use on various body parts including lip, chin, knees, cheeks, and toes, ensuring smooth skin all over.\n• Suitable for All Skin Types: Gentle and effective, making it suitable for all skin types, even sensitive skin.\n• Convenient Kit: Includes an adaptor for power, thread for threading, and powder for smooth application.\n• Travel-Friendly: Compact and portable design makes it ideal for travel, ensuring you stay well-groomed wherever you go.\nExperience smooth, hair-free skin effortlessly with our hair remover kit!\n• Brand: Sokany\n• Power Source: Corded Electric\n• Water Resistance Level: Not Water Resistant\nAbout this Item:\n• Item Category: Electric Shaver', 0, 0, 1),
