('3314036b-5212-47b3-b88f-dab4d4358536', 'VNT-BTY-0141', 'Portable Hair Straightener Comb', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 15, 12, 67, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-195.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-658.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-450.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-096.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-924.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-hair-straightener-comb-147-271.jpg"]', 'Portable Hair Straightener Comb', 'Negative ION Hair Straightener:\n• Comb straightener for women that effectively moisturizes hair cuticles.\n• Maximum frizz control, prevents knotting and split ends.\n• Say goodbye to static hair and welcome smooth and silky locks.\nStraightening Comb:\n• Utilizes even heat technology for quick heating and uniform heat distribution.\n• Wider space between comb teeth efficiently straightens knots and shapes hair.\nPerfect Hairstyle Anytime, Anywhere:\n• Keep your desired hairstyle on the go.\n• From curly to straight, this comb can achieve the perfect style.\n• Portable and wireless for easy carrying in a bag.\n• Can be used after charging, making it convenient for use anywhere.\nMaterials:\n• Thermal conductivity by tourmaline ceramics with three temperature adjustments.\n• Contains a hair care ceramic coating to prevent damage.\n• Ensures even heating and straightening of all hair.\n• Anti-hot shell for safety, preventing contact with the face.\nSuitable for All Hair Types:\n• Dual-use for rolling and straightening.\n• Suitable for soft, thinning, thick, and curly hair.\n• Simply brush through hair for a frizz-free and wavy taming effect.', 0, 0, 0),
('97f66eba-6b39-45af-ad7d-d27cb140d147', 'VNT-BTY-0142', 'Purple Whitening Toothpaste', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 4, 3, 68, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-428.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-263.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-307.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-254.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-329.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/purple-whitening-toothpaste-138-830.jpg"]', 'Purple Whitening Toothpaste', 'Purple Toothpaste purple corrector toothpaste penetrates the gaps in the enamel , leave no residue, help effectively clean your teeth.\n• Colour Corrector Works to brighten teeth by utilizing color correcting technology.By counter-balancing the different hues in your teeth, conceals stains and improves brightness.\n• Purple Corrector This purple toothpaste, combined with two water-soluble dyes, can eliminate any shade of yellow and present the brightest smile.\n• Long Lasting Results With regular use, this dental toothpaste can help you maintain a bright, white smile that lasts. You\'ll be able to enjoy the confidence that comes with a beautiful smile every day.\n• Convenient And Easy To Use Just apply purple whitening toothpaste and toothbrush for 2 minutes, and you will see how quickly your teeth look brighter!', 0, 0, 1),
('743a5aa3-83c7-40d8-9db7-d5b1108b518c', 'VNT-BTY-0143', 'Anti Wrinkle Beauty Apparatus', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 19, NULL, 69, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-193.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-210.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-420.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-097.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-909.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/anti-wrinkle-beauty-apparatus-133-818.jpg"]', 'Anti Wrinkle Beauty Apparatus', 'Effortless Beauty with our Face Roller:\nErgonomic Design:\n• The face roller features a Y handle designed for ergonomic comfort.\n• Easy-to-operate design ensures a seamless user experience.\nPortable and Slimming:\n• Compact size allows for easy carrying, enabling face slimming and relaxation at any time.\n• Ideal for on-the-go beauty sessions to keep your face feeling refreshed.\nUSB Charging:\n• Convenient USB charging capability.\n• Compact and portable, ensuring it\'s ready to use whenever and wherever you need it.\nComfortable and Handy Handle:\n• The handle provides a comfortable grip for easy and effective use.\n• Experience a quick beauty massage for a face-lift effect.\nMicro Current Pulse Technology:\n• Utilizes micro current pulse technology for advanced skincare.\n• Promotes blood circulation, eliminates excess fat, and fights against wrinkles and edema.\n• Achieve smooth, firm, and resilient skin in no time.\nIndulge in the luxury of a beauty massage with our face roller – your companion for a revitalized and radiant skin experience!', 0, 0, 0),
('0bc00182-47a4-43c3-8948-e8dd2f0d16bd', 'VNT-BTY-0144', 'Portable Oral Irrigator', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 19, 15, 70, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-oral-irrigator-116-973.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-oral-irrigator-116-708.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-oral-irrigator-116-548.jpg"]', 'Portable Oral Irrigator', 'Deep Cleaning for Teeth and Gums:\n• Designed with a 360° rotating nozzle, ideal for people with periodontal disease, braces, or dental implants.\n• Helps prevent oral health issues like bad breath, tooth decay, bleeding gums, and yellow teeth.\nLong Battery Life and Portable Design:\n• Lightweight and portable, making it convenient to carry like a toothbrush.\n• Charges via any USB port, adding to its portability.\n3 Pressure Modes:\n• Strong Mode: For deep cleaning, removing food residue between teeth.\n• Soft Mode: Suitable for first-time users and those with sensitive teeth.\n• Pulse Mode: Massages gums, promoting gum health.', 0, 1, 0);
