('11334fe2-6ecb-4bc3-884e-e4fd4ccad7f9', 'VNT-BTY-0159', 'Eye Beauty Device', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 39, 31, 20, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-013.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-981.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-873.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-093.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-263.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/eye-beauty-device-29-678.jpg"]', 'Eye Beauty Device', 'Portable Skincare Wands for Radiant Skin On The Go!\nExperience the power of clinically proven microcurrent and red light therapy with our portable skincare wands. Achieve glowing skin with the therapeutic warmth and low-voltage energy emitted by these innovative wands.\nRed & Blue Light Therapy:\nOur wands harness the benefits of red and blue light therapy to promote skin health. Red light aids in collagen production and rejuvenation, while blue light targets acne-causing bacteria. Enjoy the dual benefits for clearer, radiant skin.\nTherapeutic Warmth:\nThe wands emit a soothing grade of warmth, enhancing the effectiveness of your skincare routine. This gentle warmth, not heat, helps to temporarily de-puff the skin, promoting a refreshed and revitalized appearance.\nPortable & Rechargeable:\nDesigned for your convenience, these skincare wands are portable and rechargeable. Easily fit them in your bag or purse for skincare on the go, whether you\'re traveling or running errands. The wand is rechargeable and offers up to 12 treatments per charge, ensuring lasting convenience. A cable is included for easy charging.\nTransform your skincare routine with the ease and effectiveness of our portable red and blue light therapy face wands. Radiant, revitalized skin is just a treatment away!', 0, 1, 0),
('6c5f0dde-bc86-4dd6-866b-2be97b11209b', 'VNT-BTY-0160', 'Mini Laser Hair Removal', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 68, 54, 21, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-laser-hair-removal-28-705.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-laser-hair-removal-28-945.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-laser-hair-removal-28-730.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-laser-hair-removal-28-544.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-laser-hair-removal-28-865.jpg"]', 'Mini Laser Hair Removal', 'Latest IPL Laser Hair Removal Tech:\n• Utilizes advanced IPL (Intense Pulsed Light) technology for safer, painless, and permanent hair removal.\n• IPL light pulses penetrate hair follicles, causing gradual shrinking upon contact with light and heat, accelerating natural hair falling out and inhibiting growth.\n2 Flashes Modes:\n• Automatic and manual modes cater to different skin areas.\n• Auto mode suits straightforward areas like arms and legs; manual mode for precision areas like the face and armpits.\n• Maintain a 90° vertical skin angle with the lamp head to prevent wasting flashes.\n5 Adjustable Energy Levels:\n• Offers five adjustable light energy settings for a gentle yet effective treatment.\n• Adjust the level based on the skin area and hair growth.\nSay Goodbye to Traditional Hair Removal:\n• Destructs hair follicles with laser for permanent hair removal, ensuring safety and permanence.\n• Hair reduction of over 95?hievable after 8 weeks, eliminating the need for painful repetitive shaving.\nFull Body Hair Removal:\n• Suitable for both men and women, ideal for full body hair removal including arms, underarms, bikini line, legs, back, and chest.\n• Yields effective results comparable to treatments in beauty spas and salons, conveniently usable at home.', 1, 0, 0),
('45ba022c-8f3d-4df8-a3ae-a268e1067034', 'VNT-BTY-0161', 'Facial Hair Remover', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 10, NULL, 22, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-006.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-743.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-341.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-113.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-071.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/facial-hair-remover-25-357.jpg"]', 'Facial Hair Remover', 'Introducing our Facial Hair Remover, the ultimate solution for quick and painless hair removal. Here\'s why it\'s the perfect addition to your beauty routine:\nBattery Operated: Requires just 1 AA battery cell for convenient and portable use, allowing you to achieve smooth and flawless skin on the go.\nInstant and Painless: Say goodbye to unwanted facial hair effortlessly. Our hair remover removes hair instantly and painlessly from the lip, chin, and cheeks, as well as peach fuzz, allowing makeup to glide on flawlessly.\nGentle and Hypoallergenic: Gentle enough for daily use, our hair remover eliminates the need to wait for regrowth, ensuring smooth skin every day. It\'s hypoallergenic and dermatologist recommended, making it suitable for all skin types.', 0, 0, 0),
('3d7de763-8216-4fd5-bbc2-ba95c8a91b10', 'VNT-ELE-0092', 'Smart Car Air Freshener', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 54, 42, 23, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Smart%20Car%20Air%20Freshener%201_6af32886a1845.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Smart%20Car%20Air%20Freshener%202_6af32886a5cc1.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Smart%20Car%20Air%20Freshener%203_6af32886a6278.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Smart%20Car%20Air%20Freshener_6af32886a69a0.jpg"]', 'Smart Car Air Freshener', 'Smart car air freshener features a rechargeable battery, providing the convenience of wireless operation without the need for constant charging. Enjoy the freedom and portability of this device.\n• 【Customizable Fragrance】With a 3-level adjustable intelligent diffuser, this car air freshener allows you to control the intensity of the fragrance according to your preference. Create a personalized and pleasant aroma experience while on the road.\n• 【Projection Design】The pickup light design of this aroma diffuser adds a touch of atmosphere to your car interior. Experience a mesmerizing starry projection that creates a tranquil and enchanting ambiance during your drives.\n• 【Intelligent Functions】Equipped with intelligent features such as auto on/off and memory function, the aroma diffuser will automatically start or turn off when your car starts or turns off. Enjoy hands-free convenience and a hassle-free experience.\n• 【Compact and Stylish Design】Boasting a compact and sleek design, this car air freshener seamlessly blends into your vehicle\'s interior. Enhance the aesthetics of your car while enjoying the refreshing fragrance on all your journeys.', 0, 0, 1),
('ecf29e29-b6d6-4d2f-b2e9-d822a11cefb5', 'VNT-ELE-0093', 'Google Fitbit Air', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 77, 60, 24, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Google%20Fitbit%20Air%201_6ae4943b08514.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Google%20Fitbit%20Air%202_6ae4943b0d6ff.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Google%20Fitbit%20Air%203_6ae4943b125ce.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/Google%20Fitbit%20Air_6ae4943b171a7.jpg"]', 'Google Fitbit Air', 'Google Fitbit Air is the unbelievably comfortable, exceptionally smart way to transform your health[1]; and Google Health brings together effortless tracking and adaptive coaching to help make the most of your everyday[2]\n• Unlock more with Google Health Premium: With a premium membership, get personalized coaching that’s built with Gemini and adapts to your life[2]; get a 3-month trial at no cost to you[5] (Google Health Premium subscription sold separately)\n• Comfortable fit - One Size Tracker (130-210 mm): The lightweight, micro-adjustable fit sits comfortably and quietly, so you can wear Google Fitbit Air through work, play, and sleep; advanced sensors and new algorithms power more accurate, precise health tracking, 24/7[1]\n• Designed for every occasion: With no screen to distract you or disrupt your style, your tracker moves seamlessly from bracelet to workout band to sleep band, and you can change looks in seconds – just press the pebble in, click, and go\n• Long battery life: Google Fitbit Air’s battery lasts up to a week, and fast charging gets you one day of battery life in just five minutes[6,7]', 0, 0, 0),
('013cf722-0ff8-4aa9-bc3a-c0fafffc228b', 'VNT-ELE-0094', '10 Port USB Power Hub', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 17, NULL, 25, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/10-port-usb-power-hub-632-801.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/10-port-usb-power-hub-632-008.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/10-port-usb-power-hub-632-281.jpg"]', '10 Port USB Power Hub', '10 Ports – Charge up to 10 devices simultaneously, keeping all your gadgets powered up in one spot!\n•  Universal Compatibility – Works with smartphones, tablets, cameras, headphones, and more. Charge all your devices with ease!\n•  Fast Charging – Equipped with smart charging technology for quick, efficient power delivery to each device.\n• Overcharge Protection – Built-in safety features to prevent overcharging, overheating, or short-circuiting. Your devices are in good hands!\n• Compact & Sleek Design – Fits perfectly on your desk, nightstand, or travel bag without taking up much space.\n• Wide Voltage Range – Compatible with 110-240V outlets, making it ideal for home, office, or international travel.\n• Durable & Safe – Premium materials ensure long-lasting use and safety for all your electronics.\n• LED Indicators – Individual LED lights let you know which ports are in use, so you can always keep track.\n• Eco-Friendly – Energy-efficient design helps save power and reduce your carbon footprint.', 0, 1, 0),
