('14ecdd75-567f-4593-98b0-c49269af90c5', 'VNT-ELE-0107', '3 in 1 Electric Spin Scrubber Machine', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 64, 50, 38, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-electric-spin-scrubber-machine-319-978.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-electric-spin-scrubber-machine-319-054.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-electric-spin-scrubber-machine-319-891.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-electric-spin-scrubber-machine-319-497.jpg"]', '3 in 1 Electric Spin Scrubber Machine', 'Professional & Effective Cleaning:\n• The electric cleaning scrubber spins up to 300 RPM, providing high-torque scrubbing power. The 360-degree rotating brush head ensures thorough and complete stain removal.\n3 Replaceable Brush Heads:\n• Comes with 3 types of scrubber brush heads, including flat, half-round, and corner brushes. These versatile brush heads are powerful and adjustable to meet various cleaning needs, making it suitable for bathroom tile cleaning, floors, and more. The premium lightweight and durable material ensure longevity.\nExtended Handle:\n• Features an extendable handle with flexible bristles, allowing the brush to reach hidden corners and tiny crevices effortlessly. The handle can be extended to around 40 inches, making it easy to clean higher places.\nCordless & Waterproof:\n• The cordless design enhances convenience and hassle-free cleaning. It operates without disturbing or entangling the user. The waterproof feature ensures safe usage under wet conditions.\nIdeal for a Gift:\n• A thoughtful and practical gift for individuals with backaches, stiff shoulders, or lumbago. The electric spin scrubber lightens the burden of cleaning, eliminating the need to bend or wave hands to scrub away dirt.', 0, 0, 0),
('c32f0187-7b2c-44e6-80ca-c875a7f2294f', 'VNT-ELE-0108', 'Electric Mosquito Zapper', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 25, 19, 39, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-mosquito-zapper-315-031.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-mosquito-zapper-315-959.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-mosquito-zapper-315-901.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-mosquito-zapper-315-992.jpg"]', 'Electric Mosquito Zapper', 'Highly Effective: Our fly swatter racket boasts a powerful 3000V high voltage power grid that delivers an instant and satisfying zap to eliminate flies. Have a blast zapping bugs anytime, anywhere with this handy electric mosquito swatter.\nVery Safe: Featuring two protective mesh nets on either side of the high-power grid, our mosquito zapper ensures your safety. Even if you accidentally touch it, rest assured you won\'t get hurt during your bug-busting mission.\nUSB Charging: Enjoy easy and cordless fly zapping with convenient USB charging. A quick 2 to 3 hours is all it takes to reach a full charge. The red light indicator turns green when charging is complete, signaling that you\'re ready for action.\nDual Mode: This 2-in-1 fly killer racket offers manual use or automatic mosquito killer mode, allowing placement at your preferred spot. The mosquito-killing lamp mode is ideal for home use when plugged in.\nLonger Battery Life: Unlike traditional mosquito swatters, our electric fly swatter features a rechargeable 1200mAh battery. Enjoy a longer battery life, reduced waste, and a pollution-free solution to keep your surroundings bug-free.', 0, 0, 1),
('7084cda0-f234-41cc-b4c7-ad7d46775e3c', 'VNT-ELE-0109', 'Electronic Blood Pressure Monitor', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 17, NULL, 40, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-blood-pressure-monitor-288-188.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-blood-pressure-monitor-288-111.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-blood-pressure-monitor-288-603.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-blood-pressure-monitor-288-985.jpg"]', 'Electronic Blood Pressure Monitor', 'Home Electronic Sphygmomanometer: Your health at your fingertips! Our compact and portable electronic sphygmomanometer lets you measure your blood pressure anytime, anywhere.\nArm Type Design: Designed for accuracy, our arm-type sphygmomanometer ensures precise measurements. Just remember to roll up your sleeves or remove your coat for the most accurate results.\nClear Readings: Easily distinguish between systolic and diastolic pressure readings, helping you quickly assess your data for normalcy. With ample memory storage and irregular heartbeat detection, it keeps you informed about your health status and displays the average of your last three measurements.\nStay in control of your health with our home electronic sphygmomanometer – it\'s your on-the-go companion for monitoring your blood pressure!', 0, 1, 0),
('9d10988a-b659-4387-9b68-bd5e71093dcb', 'VNT-ELE-0110', 'Smart Firework LED Lights', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 26, 22, 41, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-678.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-587.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-512.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-702.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-946.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-806.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/smart-firework-led-lights-287-706.jpg"]', 'Smart Firework LED Lights', 'Create a wonderful atmosphere for your space with Smart Firework Lights! Enjoy a visual feast of lighting with 16 million colors , 213 dynamic modes , music sync , mic modes , and timer.\nMusic/Mic Modes & 213 Dynamic Modes: LED lights color changing sync to music and mic via smartphone with the App , perfect for your Christmas party . Choose from 213 dynamic light modes to deck out your room in style!\nThree Control Methods: Control your LED Firework lights using the 40-key remote , App, or control box . With the remote and App, you can turn the lights on/off, adjust brightness, select colors/dynamic modes, change light flashing speed, set timers, and choose music and mic modes. The control box lets you turn the lights on/off and switch modes easily.\nEasy to Install: Installation is a breeze! Simply peel off the tape on the back of the lights and stick them wherever you like. Then, connect them to a power supply, and voilà!\nWidely Used: These lights are perfect for home Christmas decoration, whether it\'s in your bedroom, living room, kitchen, or on your walls and stairs. They\'re also great for weddings, parties, bars, and festivals.\nHave any questions Feel free to ask, and we\'ll get back to you within 24 hours!', 0, 0, 0),
