mfort\nUpgraded version ensures no water leakage concerns\nSet the mood with LED lights:\nBuilt-in soft LED lights with 7 color options\nCreate romance or enhance your sleep environment\nDiscover ultimate comfort and versatility with the 3-in-1 Personal Air Cooler. Elevate your air experience today!', 0, 0, 1),
('8bafcf12-0997-4a8e-955e-c71e89bbdb68', 'VNT-ELE-0121', 'Electric Callus Remover', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 14, NULL, 52, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-208.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-521.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-911.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-403.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-562.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-callus-remover-204-143.jpg"]', 'Electric Callus Remover', 'Introducing our Electric Callus Remover!\nRevolutionize your self-care routine with this advanced device, offering ultimate comfort and efficiency. Here\'s what makes it a must-have:\nUSB Interface Charging: Embrace convenience with USB charging capability. Simply plug in and power up!\nCharging Voltage: 5V – Fast and efficient charging for uninterrupted use.\nCharging Current: 2A – Ensuring a swift and powerful charge.\nLow Speed Turn (During Work): Witness the soothing green light as it indicates low-speed operation. Enjoy a gentle and effective treatment for your feet.\nHigh Speed Turn (During Work): When you need more intensity, the red light signals high-speed operation. Experience a thorough and invigorating exfoliation.\nGreen Light (Charging Complete): Once fully charged, the green light shines bright, letting you know it\'s ready to deliver outstanding performance.\nRed Light (Charging): While charging, the red light gracefully indicates power flowing in. Witness the transformation as your device gets ready for action.\nSay goodbye to calluses and hello to smoother, more radiant feet! Elevate your pampering session with the Electric Callus Remover – your feet deserve the best care. Get yours today!', 0, 0, 0),
('54cd47ba-fdcb-4958-a8e2-b6c6bd0c5aed', 'VNT-ELE-0122', 'One Step Brush', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 27, 21, 53, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-770.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-107.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-574.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-070.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-094.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-725.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-170.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/one-step-brush-203-598.jpg"]', 'One Step Brush', 'Introducing the One Step Hot Air Brush!\nUnleash your hair\'s potential with our one-of-a-kind design:\nOval-shaped barrel for sleek shaping and volumizing\n360-degree rotating cord for tangle-free styling\nGet ready for luscious locks:\nAchieve natural, fluffy hair with added volume\nWhy settle for one styling tool when you can have it all\nReplace hair dryer, straightener, curler, and volumizer\nSay hello to healthy, vibrant hair:\nCeramic titanium barrel for even heat distribution, bye-bye damage\nIonic technology locks moisture, adds shine, and tames frizz\nYour hairstyling routine just got a makeover:\n1200W power and 3 heat settings (COOL/WARM/HOT) for custom styling\nSleek rotary button for effortless hair drying and styling\nGlobetrotters, rejoice!\nCompact size (4 inches * 13 inches) fits snugly in your suitcase\nStylish design for an enjoyable travel companion\nUpgrade your hair game today!', 0, 0, 0),
('bc462fe8-aadd-4299-975c-ced9e70063a7', 'VNT-ELE-0123', 'LED Crystal Table Lamp', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 32, 25, 54, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-077.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-592.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-539.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-070.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-050.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/led-crystal-table-lamp-202-140.jpg"]', 'LED Crystal Table Lamp', 'Illuminate Your Space with the LED Crystal Table Lamp!\nCreate an enchanting ambiance in your bedroom or on your desktop with our LED Crystal Table Lamp. Its romantic rose light and diamond-like atmosphere make it a captivating addition to your decor.\nFeatures:\nPerfect Size: Standing at 8.66 inches high and 3.54 inches in diameter, it\'s just the right size for a touch of elegance.\nVoltage Efficiency: Operating at less than or equal to 36V, it\'s both energy-efficient and safe.\nLow Power Consumption: With only 1.5W of power, it\'s gentle on your energy bill.\nNotice:\nPlease use the palm of your hand to touch the top of the lamp for best results, avoiding fingers.\nConvenient Control:\nChoose your control style:\n1. USB Switch: Effortlessly switch on the lamp to witness mesmerizing light and shadow effects. The lamp\'s acrylic material ensures a sleek design.\n2. Touch Remote: Opt for the remote control option to adjust the lamp\'s settings from a distance, enhancing your convenience.\n3D Elegance:\nFeaturing a unique 3D effect resembling sparkling diamonds, the refracting crystal lights emit a vivid, colorful glow that brings out the lamp\'s exquisite beauty. It\'s a stylish addition to your living room, bedroom, study, and more, creating an inviting and romantic atmosphere.\nWhat\'s in the Package:\n1 x LED Crystal Table Lamp\n1 x Data Cable\n1 x Remote Control\nElevate your space with the captivating LED Crystal Table Lamp. Experience the magic today and transform your surroundings!', 0, 0, 0),
('0eee0566-fa14-4a39-a95d-baeefac42e62', 'VNT-ELE-0124', 'Portable Mini Ironing Machine', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 14, NULL, 55, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-027.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-263.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-381.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-452.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-776.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-805.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mini-ironing-machine-201-103.jpg"]', 'Portable Mini Ironing Machine', '2-in-1 Wet & Dry Steam Iron: The micro steam iron has both dry and wet ironing experience to meet individual ironing needs. Turning on the power, and they can be heated to 300°F within 2 minutes, you can iron your clothes directly, for a better and faster-ironing effect, you can also press the water spray button to spray water and then iron the clothes.\nUpgraded Titanium Metal Panel: The steam iron for clothes uses a large titanium panel, irons at a constant temperature of 150?, quickly preheats, and irons smoothly. It can easily penetrate every fiber in the clothes so that the clothes can quickly recover as new, even the precious fabrics can be carefully taken care of without damaging the clothes.\nPointed Curved Design: The front and back sides of the hanging ironing machine panel are designed with water chestnut corners, which can flexibly iron narrow areas such as buttons, plackets, and collars, allowing the details to be displayed elegantly.\nTransparent Visualization Water Tank: The mini steam iron uses a 60ml integrated water tank design. It is convenient to add water and will not leak water, and you can iron many pieces of clothing at a time. Transparent visualization can keep an eye on the water usage of the water tank at any time, easy to operate, and safer.\nPortable Iron for Home & Travel: The garment steamer can be used to iron silk, plush, cotton, linen, and other fabrics. The mini hand-held iron can save space, lightweight, compact design, and is very suitable for travel, it can be easily put into suitcases and backpacks, and can be easily carried anytime, anywhere.', 0, 1, 1);
