('c70954c5-e0a5-44a4-aa7a-06a1459ea79c', 'VNT-ELE-0125', 'Vaneless Neck Hanging Fan', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 17, 15, 56, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-684.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-069.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-343.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-327.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-582.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-776.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-122.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vaneless-neck-hanging-fan-200-782.jpg"]', 'Vaneless Neck Hanging Fan', 'Stay Cool and Safe: Our 2023 portable hanging neck fan\nFeatures 48 wind outlets and 60pcs twin-turbine fan blades\nProvides quick cooling in just 3 seconds\nSafe for all ages, no worries about hair entanglement\nHands-Free & Fashionable: Lightweight and portable neck fan\nResembles a stylish headphone\nAllows you to go hands-free in style\nPerfect for sports, work, travel, and more\nUSB Rechargeable & 3-Speed Wind: Convenient and versatile\nRechargeable via USB\nBuilt-in 1800 mAh battery lasts 2.5 to 7 hours (depending on speed)\nChoose from three adjustable wind speeds\nLow-Noise & Comfortable: Enjoy a quieter environment\nLow-noise motor design\nCrafted with eco-friendly ABS and silicone for comfort and durability\nQuieter operation for enhanced comfort\nEnjoy the Breeze: Stay comfortable, fashionable, and cool anywhere', 1, 0, 0),
('71660c70-84bc-4394-afbb-b3b48913487e', 'VNT-ELE-0126', 'Vanity Mirror Lights', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 25, 21, 57, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vanity-mirror-lights-179-765.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vanity-mirror-lights-179-927.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vanity-mirror-lights-179-460.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/vanity-mirror-lights-179-919.jpg"]', 'Vanity Mirror Lights', 'Features of the LED Mirror Lights:\nEnergy-Saving and Durable:\n• Professional LED lights for energy-saving and extended use.\n• Brightness adjusted through professional tests to ensure longevity and prevent eye strain during prolonged use.\nHidden Extra Wire and 3M Double-Sided Tape:\n• Retractable wire design allows the extra wire to be hidden into the bulb\'s base.\n• Rotate the lampshade for a neat and seamless DIY effect.\n• High-quality 3M double-sided tape for secure and long-lasting attachment.\n• Transparent tapes leave no marks on the mirror when removing the lights.\n???? Evenly Fill Light for Delicate Makeup:\n• Hollywood style LED vanity mirror lights with 10 bulbs.\n• Customizable combination of bulbs for even light distribution from multiple angles.\n• Eliminates dark corners and shadows, ensuring clear and detailed makeup application.\n• Ideal for avoiding the frustration of inadequate makeup caused by insufficient light.', 0, 0, 0),
('88430872-75ae-4516-a7d5-8be53277a35c', 'VNT-ELE-0127', 'Mini Round Projector', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 118, NULL, 58, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-469.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-037.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-450.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-529.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-528.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-774.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-round-projector-154-565.jpg"]', 'Mini Round Projector', 'Phone Projector & 200\'\' Giant Screen:\n• 180° rotating design for versatile projection, even on the ceiling.\n• Provides a sharp image on screens ranging from 40 to 200 inches.\n• Ideal for creating a cinematic experience in your living room, family room, or other areas of your home.\nAndroid 11 and Dual Band Wi-Fi Built-in 6:\n• Dual 5G + 2.4G built-in Wi-Fi with the latest 6.5G Wi-Fi 6 for a smoother and lag-free online video experience.\n• Android 11 for easy access to movies or presentations on your favorite platforms.\n• No need for an additional TV box, making it suitable for outdoor events.\nSupport 4K & Auto Horizontal Keystone Correction:\n• High resolution with 720P Full HD Native and 1080P 4K support.\n• Impressive image quality, vivid colors, and a 10000:1 contrast ratio.\n• Automatic horizontal keystone correction and manual keystone correction for easy setup.\n???? Bluetooth 5.0 & Speaker:\n• 5W stereo speakers with HiFi system for an immersive listening experience.\n• No need for additional speakers, providing ultra-clear and powerful sound.\n• Bluetooth 5.0 allows for stable connections with multiple Bluetooth speakers, perfect for outdoor movies.', 0, 0, 0),
('0b1450a9-4c43-4cc9-866c-d03b79b47155', 'VNT-ELE-0128', 'Golden Crest Juicer', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 57, 48, 59, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-924.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-073.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-293.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-769.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-267.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/golden-crest-juicer-146-922.jpg"]', 'Golden Crest Juicer', 'Model: SC-1589\n• Capacity: 2 Liters\n• Item Dimensions (D x W x H): 21 x 20 x 49 centimeters\n• Material: Stainless Steel\n• Style: Modern\n• Power Source: Corded Electric\n• Wattage: 4500 watts\nSpecial Features:\n• Portable: Easy to carry and move, making it ideal for use in different locations.\n• High Power: With 4500 watts of power, this blender can handle tough ingredients effortlessly.\n• Easy to Clean: Both the body and blade are made from stainless steel and are dishwasher safe for convenient cleaning.\n• Modern Design: Stylish and sleek, it complements any kitchen décor.\nAbout this Item:\n• Brand: Golden Crest\n• Dishwasher Safe: True\n• Material: Stainless Steel\n• Blade Material: Stainless Steel', 0, 0, 1),
('bb336d90-ef1d-477f-a026-6924ef8e6685', 'VNT-ELE-0129', 'Crusher Juicer', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 24, 20, 60, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-813.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-427.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-763.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-934.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-706.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/crusher-juicer-140-161.jpg"]', 'Crusher Juicer', 'A crusher juicer is a type of juicer designed to extract juice from fruits and vegetables by crushing and grinding them.\nCrusher Juicer often use slow, masticating, or cold-press technology to preserve nutrients and minimize heat generation during the juicing process.\nThis method helps to retain the flavor, vitamins, and enzymes of the produce, resulting in healthier and more nutritious juice.\nCrusher juicer is popular for their efficiency in juicing leafy greens, hard vegetables, and fruits, and they typically produce a higher yield of juice compared to traditional centrifugal juicers', 0, 1, 0),
('ce16a4a4-7cfc-4918-a57c-650252c1c9e4', 'VNT-ELE-0130', 'Planetarium Projector', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 54, NULL, 61, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/planetarium-projector-114-203.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/planetarium-projector-114-847.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/planetarium-projector-114-453.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/planetarium-projector-114-894.jpg"]', 'Planetarium Projector', '12 in 1 Planetarium Projector\n• Includes 12 different 4K HD galaxy disks:\n• Earth\n• Moon\n• Solar System\n• Milky Way X2\n• Andromeda Galaxy\n• Galaxy\n• NGC4302-NGC4298\n• Hubble Deep Field\n• M60--UCD1\n• North America Nebula\n• Mystic Mountain\n• Magellanic Cloud\n• Offers a fantastic experience of the universe with realistic galaxy disks.\nHD Realistic Galaxy Projector\n• Adjustable focus for a clear image.\n• 360° rotatable angle.\n• Supports projection distance of 6.56-16.4 feet.\n• Projects up to 12.5m.\n• Can be projected onto the ceiling, walls, and floors.\nUser-friendly Design & Auto-off Timer\n• Operates quietly, creating a relaxing sleeping environment.\n• Slow rotation speed imitates cosmic changes.\n• Auto-off timer options: 1 hour, 2 hours, or automatic shutdown after 4 hours.\n• Can be turned back on if desired.\nEasy to Use\n• Simple 3-step setup:\n• Insert film disc.\n• Turn on the switch.\n• Adjust the focus.\n• Perfect for kids, promoting intellectual development.\nDecorative Night Light Projector\n• Creates a romantic atmosphere for various occasions:\n• Birthdays\n• Weddings\n• Anniversaries\n• Parties\n• Children\'s Day\n• Christmas\n• Ideal for bedroom, kids\' room, game room, home theater, wall, ceiling, and room decoration.\n• A special gift for friends, lovers, family, and children.', 0, 0, 0),
('da77be52-d3aa-4508-9ba2-262402efa6f1', 'VNT-ELE-0131', 'Portable Blender With Cup', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 22, 18, 62, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-blender-with-cup-111-284.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-blender-with-cup-111-023.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-blender-with-cup-111-739.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-blender-with-cup-111-968.jpg"]', 'Portable Blender With Cup', 'Features:\n• Versatile Application – Perfect for use in cars, RVs, outdoors, hotels, garages, commercial spaces, and households. Enjoy fresh blends wherever you are!\n• Portable Blender with Cup – Compact and lightweight design, making it easy to carry and ideal for smoothies, juices, and shakes on the go.\n• Automatic Pulp Ejection – Features a smart pulp ejection system for a hassle-free blending experience. No more manual cleanup!\n• Quiet Motor Technology – Operates with minimal noise, ensuring a peaceful blending session at home or on the road.\n• Self-Cleaning Capability – Simplifies cleaning with an easy self-cleaning function—just add water and let it clean itself!\n• Strength Control – Customizable blending power to suit your needs, whether you’re crushing ice or blending soft fruits.', 0, 0, 0),
('5475b610-f82f-46f9-819c-490852588038', 'VNT-ELE-0132', 'Portable Nail Gun', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 30, 24, 63, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-925.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-921.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-862.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-408.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-749.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-678.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-nail-gun-109-887.jpg"]', 'Portable Nail Gun', 'This item appears to be a high-quality, versatile spray gun or nail gun designed for construction work. Here’s a detailed breakdown of its features and benefits:\nQuality Construction:\n• Safety Features: Includes an explosion-proof barrel for safe operation.\n• Comfort: Non-slip rubber handle and non-slip shield provide better grip and comfort during use.\nCompact and Practical:\n• Portability: Light and small design allows for easy one-handed operation.\n• Convenience: Comes with a plastic box for easy transportation and storage of the machine and nails.\nNoise Reduction:\n• Double Silencer: Equipped with a thicker steel silencer to significantly reduce noise, making it safer and more comfortable for use in various environments without disturbing others.\nEase of Maintenance:\n• Residue Removal: Simple to clean; just hold the silencer and pull several times to remove any residue, ensuring the tool is ready for the next use.\nVersatility:\n• Application: Suitable for use on red brick walls, concrete walls, 8mm aluminum alloy tubes, and thick plates.\n• Environmental Friendly: Produces minimal dust, promoting energy-saving and environmentally friendly construction practices.\nPower Control:\n• Adjustability: Features a three-stage power control, allowing the user to adapt the power output to meet different construction requirements.', 1, 0, 1),
('35cfe1df-8664-49ff-9608-ffef6823cc18', 'VNT-ELE-0133', 'Outdoor Mini Speaker', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 13, NULL, 64, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-speaker-with-mic-108-346.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-speaker-with-mic-108-392.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-speaker-with-mic-108-691.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-speaker-with-mic-108-434.jpg"]', 'Outdoor Mini Speaker', 'About Product:\nProduct Name:\nOutdoor Mini Speaker\nFeature:\n• Powerful Sound in a Mini Size: Compact yet delivers crisp, high-quality audio for outdoor adventures.\n• Seamless Bluetooth Connectivity: Pairs effortlessly with your devices for wireless music streaming.\n• Durable & Rugged Design: Built to withstand outdoor elements, perfect for hiking, camping, or poolside fun.\n• Water-Resistant: Splash-proof construction ensures reliable performance in any weather.\n• Portable & Lightweight: Easily fits in your bag or backpack, making it ideal for on-the-go lifestyles.\n• Easy-to-Use Controls: Adjust volume, skip tracks, and pause playback with simple button controls.\n• Multiple Playback Modes: Supports Bluetooth, AUX, and SD card inputs for versatile use.\n• Built-In Microphone: Convenient for hands-free calls while you’re out and about.\n• Perfect Gift for Music Lovers: A thoughtful present for those who love the outdoors and great sound.', 0, 0, 0),
