('d72b0d8c-b920-412c-9946-4956b298f4c8', 'VNT-ELE-0136', 'Electric Coffee Warmer', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 16, NULL, 67, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-786.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-177.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-764.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-704.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-571.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-coffee-warmer-72-316.jpg"]', 'Electric Coffee Warmer', 'Your Temperature, Your Choice Maintain your coffee at the perfect temperature. This coffee mug warmer not only slows down the cooling of your hot coffee but also heats it to your desired temperature, keeping it just right all day long. No more waiting – sip your coffee whenever you please.\nEasy to Clean & Portable to Carry : The heating plate is a breeze to clean, and this coffee warmer is lightweight and portable. Take it with you on outdoor adventures or trips, ensuring you can enjoy warm coffee anytime, anywhere. Let this mug warmer warm not only your stomach but also your heart. ????????\nEfficient & Safe Heating : Designed for power efficiency, this coffee warmer focuses on fast and effective heating. Avoid touching or getting too close to the heating area to prevent burns. The cup cover helps minimize heat loss, enhancing the overall heating and insulation performance. Remember, its primary function is to keep your beverage warm, not to heat it up to scalding temperatures.\nSafe & Durable : Crafted with high-tech materials, this coffee cup warmer is highly heat-resistant and fire-resistant. Its spill-proof design adds durability and ensures easy cleaning.\nPerfect Gift Choice : With its beautiful and compact design, this pocket watch coffee mug warmer is the ideal gift for your loved ones. Whether it\'s your partner, parents, friends, or anyone dear to you, surprise them on birthdays, Valentine\'s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, or other special occasions. Show your genuine care with this thoughtful gift.', 0, 0, 1),
