('711101a5-2bf6-41f9-bf50-01bc829c11b3', 'VNT-ELE-0145', 'Car Windshield Repair Kit', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 12, NULL, 76, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-855.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-457.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-243.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-032.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-623.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t-502-773.jpg"]', 'Car Windshield Repair Kit', 'Quick Repair?: Windshield repair kit can quickly and effectively reduce the appearance of cracks and chips in your windshield within 20 minutes without special tools. Save your time and money to prevent the damage from spreading. Restores your windshield to almost new condition. Maintains long-term maintenance effect\n• ?Upgraded Design?: The new 2nd generation design is durable. It has a stronger repair device and 4 thicker rubber feet that allow you to better fix the device on the glass, and the resin can spread evenly on the glass. Finally, it gives you amazing repair results\n• ?Advanced Resin Formula?: The windshield repair kit contains advanced resin repair fluid with deep permeability, the shear strength can reach 20Pa, and the repair resin can be fully penetrated into the cracks and chips of the cracks with the pressure driven by the pressure motor.\n• ?EASY TO USE?: The windshield chip repair kit is easy to use. Firstly, clean and dry the glass surface of the windshield. Secondly, squeeze the resin into the cracks and apply it to the treated film, then dry it quickly and harden it under UV light for 5-10 minutes. Finally, scrape off the remaining resin with a flat spatula\n• ?Wide Application?: This windshield repair kit repairs all types of laminated windshields such as eye damage, cracks, chips, star chips and spider webs. Cracks no larger than 12 inches/30cm in diameter and round damage no larger than 1 inch in diameter. If you are not satisfied in any way, please feel free to contact us', 0, 0, 0),
