('1d22d666-a1c3-4a72-8aa9-f4b83db18244', 'VNT-ELE-0151', 'Roarswa Mobile Phone Holder with Bluetooth Speaker HD', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 20, NULL, 17, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-849.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-110.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-687.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-250.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-129.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/roarswa-mobile-phone-holder-with-bluetooth-speaker-hd-475-767.jpg"]', 'Roarswa Mobile Phone Holder with Bluetooth Speaker HD', '4 in 1 Design: This device combines four functions of adjustable cell phone holder, high-fidelity Bluetooth speaker, USB power station and microphone into one device, perfect for video calls, e-learning, watching videos and more.\n• Adjustable Angle and Height: This cell phone holder not only has a variety of adjustable angles, but also can adjust the height of the holder according to your needs, meeting different viewing needs.\n• Cell Phone Holder with Bluetooth Speaker: The cell phone holder is equipped with a high-quality Bluetooth speaker, allowing you to enjoy lossless high-fidelity audio playback while using the holder, which is the best choice for you to free your hands while watching videos.\n• Universal Compatibility: The holder is suitable for all 4-10 inch cell phones, tablets, e-readers, etc., including devices with protective cases, etc.\n• Practical Tool & Perfect Gift: The cell phone holder with bluetooth speaker is a good choice when watchin