 can be placed in the tripod groove for travel for easy storage when not in use.\n• ??LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE?: The Self-Power Tripod Phone Stand is designed with portability in mind. With a folded length of 13 inches (33.3cm) and a weight of 0.86 lbs (393g), it is incredibly lightweight and easy to carry. You can easily put it in your backpack and take it with you wherever you go, making it the perfect travel companion. Its small size also makes it ideal for outdoor activities like hiking, camping or cycling, as it won\'t weigh you down.\n• ??Wide Compatibility?: The universal phone holder is compatible with all mobile phones between 6.5cm to 10cm. With a universal 1/4 inch screw mount, it can be used for most digital cameras, action cameras, webcams, camcorders. The iPhone tripod mount is suitable for almost all smartphones, fits iPhone 14 13 12 11 Pro Max, Samsung Galaxy S10 / S9 / S8, Huawei P40 / P30 / Mate 40 / Mate 30 and more.', 0, 0, 1),
