('e3a1b0b2-226e-43ba-9609-0c0560313857', 'VNT-ELE-0162', 'Air-One Earphone', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 27, 22, 28, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-one-earphone-310-200.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-one-earphone-310-045.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-one-earphone-310-178.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/air-one-earphone-310-313.jpg"]', 'Air-One Earphone', 'Introducing the Air-One Light Luxury Earphone – your perfect companion for an active and immersive audio experience! These innovative wireless Bluetooth headphones feature a unique earhook design for a secure fit during intense workouts and running sessions. What sets them apart is their cutting-edge bone conduction technology, which delivers crystal-clear audio while allowing you to stay aware of your surroundings.\n• With ultra-long endurance, the Air-One headphones keep the music playing for hours on end, making them ideal for extended workouts or daily use. The explosion rear hanging design ensures they stay comfortably in place, even during the most dynamic activities.\n• Experience a new level of convenience and safety with the Air-One Light Luxury Earphone – a game-changer in the world of wireless audio.', 0, 0, 0),
('8c00af52-7c7d-40c7-a492-f5d2e40efa80', 'VNT-ELE-0163', '4K HD Wifi Receiver', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 23, NULL, 29, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-446.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-678.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-588.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-877.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-218.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4k-hd-wifi-receiver-303-223.jpg"]', '4K HD Wifi Receiver', 'Three Transmission Protocols for seamless connectivity: Enjoy a stable signal on your TV screen with an external 10m Wi-Fi signal, surpassing other devices (802.11b/g/n) for a reliable experience.\n• Wide Compatibility for all your devices: Compatible with Android 4.2, iOS 7.0, Windows 8.1, this adapter lets you play games, surf the web, view photos, and share live camera moments on a large screen, freeing you from the limitations of your device\'s display.\n• No APP installation hassle: Simply plug and play without the need for app installations to support wifi screen. Experience seamless and automatic switching for a hassle-free media enjoyment on a large screen: Plug->Connector->Mirror.\n• High-quality picture support: Enjoy 1080P resolution by connecting your PC, smartphone, or TV to the projector. Mirror everything from your mobile device\'s display to create your exclusive cinema and audiovisual party without the hassle of cables.', 0, 0, 0),
('1c5593b5-42e5-453b-ae0b-08736fa38094', 'VNT-ELE-0164', 'Bike Phone Holder', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 18, 14, 30, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bike-phone-holder-246-878.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bike-phone-holder-246-693.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bike-phone-holder-246-264.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bike-phone-holder-246-023.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bike-phone-holder-246-646.jpg"]', 'Bike Phone Holder', 'Sturdy and Secure: Specially designed shape grips each corner of your phone tightly, ensuring its safety even on bumpy roads.\n• Shockproof Protection: Silicone pads keep your phone safe from scratches and vibrations during your ride.\n• Wide Compatibility: Universal bike cell phone holder fits 4.7 to 6.8-inch phones with a thickness of up to 15mm, including iPhone 14 series, iPhone 13, iPhone 12 Pro, and other similar-sized devices.\n• Adjustable Features: Easily switch between horizontal and vertical screen positions for convenient phone use during rides—perfect for answering calls or using GPS.\n• Easy Installation: One-hand operation for quick and tool-free installation on your bike handlebar. Enjoy hassle-free setup and enhanced riding experience!', 0, 1, 1),
('83cfad12-df11-4dc0-9783-f3123d14a2b6', 'VNT-ELE-0165', 'M10 TWS Wireless Earphones', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 14, 11, 31, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m10-tws-wireless-earphones-211-533.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m10-tws-wireless-earphones-211-167.jpg"]', 'M10 TWS Wireless Earphones', 'Latest Bluetooth 5.1 Technology:\n• Compared to traditional Bluetooth 4.2, these wireless earphones incorporate the latest Bluetooth 5.1 technology. Enjoy faster transmission speed, an extended transmission distance, and enhanced data transmission. This technology ensures a powerful and stable connection, delivering high-quality, low-latency, and consistently stable audio signals. The wireless range extends up to at least 10 meters (accessible).\nHIFI Stereo Sound:\n• Experience HIFI stereo sound with high-performance composite diaphragms that minimize sound distortion. These wireless headphones provide deep bass and crisp treble, creating an immersive musical experience. The built-in microphone allows easy call handling, ensuring clear communication while driving or enjoying music without external interference.\nLED Power Display and 1500mAh Battery:\n• The Bluetooth headset comes with a large 1500mAh capacity charging box, offering up to 4 hours of talk time. A smart LED power display allows you to monitor the headset\'s battery level. Note: Language mode can be switched between Chinese and English by pressing the function key five times.\nSmall Appearance and IPX7 Waterproof:\n• The wireless Bluetooth headsets are ergonomically designed for a perfect fit with three sets of silicone caps (small, medium, and large). With an IPX7 waterproof rating, these earphones are sweat-resistant, making them an ideal companion for sports activities.\nComfortable Design:\n• The ergonomic and lightweight design ensures a comfortable and secure fit in your ear, eliminating discomfort, friction, sliding, or slipping. Suitable for extended wear without causing discomfort. Make sure to charge them fully before the initial use.', 0, 0, 0),
('a09fb95e-46ff-4ff8-920d-deb21f6d6933', 'VNT-ELE-0166', 'M30 TWS Wireless Earphones', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 12, NULL, 32, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-745.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-243.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-595.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-902.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-215.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-045.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-748.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/m30-tws-wireless-earphones-199-772.jpg"]', 'M30 TWS Wireless Earphones', 'Model: M30 pro\nBluetooth specification: V5.2\nBluetooth Profile: A2DP,AVRCP, HFP;HSP\nWorking voltage: 3.1V~4.2V\nCharging voltage: 5V-1A\nBattery capacity of the headset: 50MAH\nBattery capacity of the storage box: 2000MAH\nTransmission distance: >10M\nCall time: About 6 hours\nPlay time: About 6 hours\nWaterproof : IPX7\nCharging time of headset: 1h\nCharging time of the Charging box: 2h\nSupport system: All Bluetooth devices and mobile phones', 0, 0, 0),
('4531f2e7-afde-4d6a-a95e-43ea79340877', 'VNT-ELE-0167', '360° Mobile Phone Tracking Holder', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 27, 21, 33, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-807.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-675.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-681.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-273.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-798.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-424.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-mobile-phone-tracking-holder-167-402.jpg"]', '360° Mobile Phone Tracking Holder', 'Industry-specific Attributes:\n• Usage: Outdoor, Indoor, For living, Bed, Desk, Others, Home\n• Feature: Adjustable, Leakproof, Anti-Corrosion, Dustproof, Portable, Flexible, Compatible with iPad\n• Private Mold: No\n• Compatible Brand: For iPhone, Samsung, Huawei, Xiaomi, and more', 1, 0, 0),
('4e3c7906-9cb9-441b-a3c8-fcdf76a05a19', 'VNT-ELE-0168', 'Calus 6 Pro Wireless Earburds', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 37, 29, 34, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/calus-6-pro-wireless-earburds-164-581.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/calus-6-pro-wireless-earburds-164-695.jpg"]', 'Calus 6 Pro Wireless Earburds', 'Call Time: Enjoy 4-5 hours of uninterrupted call time.\n• Music Playing Time: Listen to music for 4-5 hours without needing to recharge.\n• Earphones Battery: Each earphone is powered by a 3.7V-200MAH battery.\n• Headphones Compartment Battery: The headphone compartment features a 3.7V-200MAH battery for extended usage.\n• Control Mode: Utilizes Side Touch Mode for convenient control and operation.', 0, 0, 1),
('3cc244d0-85e1-4660-ac18-af2549be6e9e', 'VNT-ELE-0169', '3-in-1 Wireless Charging Pad', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 20, NULL, 35, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-980.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-380.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-310.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-673.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-800.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-060.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-187.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3-in-1-wireless-charging-pad-141-362.jpg"]', '3-in-1 Wireless Charging Pad', '3 in 1 Wireless Charging Station\nCharge your phone, Apple Watch, and AirPods all at once! This versatile wireless charger is compatible with AirPods 2/3, AirPods Pro/Pro 2, and Apple Watch Series 6/5/4/3/2/SE.\n15W Wireless Fast Charging Effortlessly charge your iPhone 14/14 Plus/14 Pro/14 Pro Max, 13/13 Pro/13 Pro Max, 12/12 Pro/12 Pro Max, 11/11 Pro/11 Pro Max, XS/XR/XS MAX/X/8/8Plus, Samsung Galaxy S21/S20/S10/S9/S8/Plus/S7, and other phones that support 5W wireless charging.\nAdjustable & Portable Design With a smooth 180° folding feature, this wireless charging pad transforms into a convenient phone holder in seconds! ???? Watch movies horizontally or chat vertically while your device charges securely with the built-in magnetic attraction. Perfect for the office, home, dining table, or bedroom.\nQi-Certified & Safe Multi-Protection ? Your safety is our priority! This wireless charger is Qi-certified and equipped with intelligent protection technology, preventing over-voltage, short-circuits, and over-current issues. The professional magnetic isolation sheet ensures zero radiation for you and your family\'s peace of mind.\nCase Friendly No more hassle of removing your phone case for charging! ???? Our magnetic wireless charging stand supports power transmission through protective cases up to 0.2 inch/5mm. Just place your phone on the charger, and it\'s good to go! (Please remove metal, magnetic attachments, or credit cards before charging.)\nExperience the ultimate convenience and safety with our 3 in 1 Wireless Charging Station! Order now and declutter your charging space!', 0, 1, 0),
('f6c10994-451b-45ba-a2f0-6bcb6df650bd', 'VNT-ELE-0170', '360° Rotatable Car Phone Holder', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 75, 65, 36, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-378.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-646.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-731.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-563.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-187.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-371.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-rotatable-car-phone-holder-136-651.jpg"]', '360° Rotatable Car Phone Holder', 'Car Phone Holder 360° Rotatable Retractable Rearview Mirror Clamp Mount Holder Condition\n• New: A brand-new, unused, unopened, undamaged item in its original\n• Brand Unbranded\n• Type Phone Holder\n• Mounting Location Rearview Mirrow\n• Mounting Type Clamp\n• Items Included Mount\n• Fastening Clamp\n• Color Black\n• Features Retractable\n• Material ABS', 0, 0, 0),
('f87dc745-d644-45a7-a068-915b908248b6', 'VNT-ELE-0171', '4 in 1 Retractable Charger', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 32, 27, 37, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-661.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-206.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-902.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-097.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-289.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-301.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/4-in-1-retractable-charger-130-368.jpg"]', '4 in 1 Retractable Charger', 'Say goodbye to messy charging accessories and tangled cords with our unique car charger!\nCharge up to 4 electronic devices simultaneously with ease. It features 1 USB A and 1 PD port, along with 2 retractable USB C cables for enhanced power charging.\nNo more cable clutter! Our charger has a flexible and scalable design that pulls the cables within 80cm. It automatically retracts for internal storage, keeping your car clean and tidy.\nAdjust the angle of the charger to your liking for a more comfortable charging experience.\nCompatible with a wide range of devices, including iPhones, Samsung Galaxy phones, tablets, and notebooks.\nUpgrade your car charging game with our versatile 4-in-1 car charger!', 0, 0, 0),
('0d8566a8-1265-41db-9e62-5431851492e0', 'VNT-ELE-0172', 'Airbuds Pro 2', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 18, NULL, 38, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/airbuds-pro-2-128-604.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/airbuds-pro-2-128-690.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/airbuds-pro-2-128-803.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/airbuds-pro-2-128-589.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/airbuds-pro-2-128-451.jpg"]', 'Airbuds Pro 2', 'Introducing the incredible Airbuds Pro 2: These cutting-edge earphones have the world buzzing with excitement.\nAirbuds Pro 2 is the latest marvel in technology, offering a complete wireless earphone experience with their wireless charging case. Setting up these fantastic Airbuds Pro 2 is a breeze, and they effortlessly pair with both Android and iOS devices, ensuring a hassle-free connection.\nThe Airbuds Pro 2 deliver a rich, top-tier audio experience and crystal-clear voice quality, all without the need for physical buttons. Thanks to built-in speech and motion sensors, they intuitively detect when they\'re in your ears, pausing playback when you take them out.\nThese sleek earbuds also offer convenient touch controls, allowing you to play, skip, or rewind your music effortlessly, even when you\'re multitasking. Airbuds Pro 2 seamlessly switch between different devices and ensure easy charging, making them an excellent value for the tech-savvy crowd.\nAirbuds Pro 2 Specifications: Built-in Microphone Up to 4.5 hours of battery life, with the charging case providing up to 3 additional charges for your AirPods. Small, Medium, and Large ear tips for a comfortable fit. Motion-sensing accelerometer for intelligent features. Bluetooth: V5.3 for seamless connectivity. Adaptive EQ for superior audio quality. Dual beamforming microphones for clear calls. Rich bass for an immersive sound experience. Force Sensor for easy control. Extended battery life for prolonged usage. Redesigned charging case for convenience. MagSafe Charging Case for lightning-fast power-ups. Automatically on, and they effortlessly connect to your devices. Simple setup across all your gadgets.\nExperience the future of wireless audio with Airbuds Pro 2!', 0, 0, 1),
('74d43a33-3b95-418f-b303-73c0a485086a', 'VNT-ELE-0173', 'Meer Mini Projector YG-300', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 60, 50, 39, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-578.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-969.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-083.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-521.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-278.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-346.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/meer-mini-projector-yg-300-127-013.jpg"]', 'Meer Mini Projector YG-300', 'Great Gift for Loved Ones: With an image size range of 32-120 inches and a projection distance of 1m-3.5m, this projector is perfect for home entertainment and office use. Its charming yellow design and high performance make it a wonderful gift for your spouse, parents, siblings, kids, and loved ones.\nAndroid 9.0 & Built-in Speakers: Featuring a robust Android 9.0 system with 1G RAM+8G ROM, this projector eliminates the need for external devices. It runs smoothly and allows you to access apps like Netflix and YouTube directly. Plus, it comes with built-in 42W HiFi stereo speakers for an immersive audio-visual experience.\nMultimedia & Multi-language: With multiple ports including 2 USB ports, HDMI, AV IR, 3.5mm audio, and VGA, you can connect laptops, TV sticks, PCs, DVD players, and USB drives. Simultaneously play media from your phone and the projector. It supports a wide range of languages, including English and Arabic.\nMost Wanted Gift! This projector is the ultimate gift choice - not too extravagant, not too simple. It\'s a gift that brings joy through movie nights, turning any room into a cozy theater. Your children will absolutely adore it!', 0, 0, 0),
('0a8d9ba3-34b5-4ad9-9d81-fd01fedc7268', 'VNT-ELE-0174', 'EchoWave P9 Wireless Headphones', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 8, 7, 40, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-967.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-665.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-570.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-799.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-430.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-921.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/echowave-p9-wireless-headphones-125-576.jpg"]', 'EchoWave P9 Wireless Headphones', 'Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth V5.0\n• Transmission Distance: 10-15 Meters Without Barriers\n• Frequency Response Range: 20Hz-20KHZ\n• Music Playback Time (100% Volume): About 3-4 Hours\n• Functionalist, Bluetooth, Waterproof, Noise Cancelling, Microphone', 1, 1, 0);
INSERT INTO products (id, sku, name, brand, category, price, discount_price, stock, colors, image, alt_text, description, is_featured, is_bestseller, is_new) VALUES
