('935f118a-5276-4716-bc7e-dc7e7bd7636e', 'VNT-ELE-0178', 'Easy DIY Furniture Mover', 'VANTA ELE', 'electronics', 16, NULL, 44, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-893.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-623.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-321.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-445.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-566.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/easy-diy-furniture-mover-55-436.jpg"]', 'Easy DIY Furniture Mover', 'Scalable & Easy to Store This furniture dolly features a telescopic base design, allowing you to adjust it vertically and horizontally to fit furniture of various sizes. Each base can be extended from 17" to 28", making it suitable for heavy objects like washing machines, refrigerators, and cabinets. When not in use, simply store the dolly in any corner of your room for easy removal.\nEasy To Use  No complicated installation steps or tools required! Just place the washing machine stand under your household appliances, such as refrigerators or washing machines, and press down the brakes at both ends to keep it steady. When you need to move the appliance, simply raise the brakes and roll it effortlessly.\nUpgraded 24 Wheels This movable base dolly comes equipped with 24 upgraded small wheels, ensuring smooth and stable movement. Easily maneuver heavy furniture and appliances to clean the bottom, making home cleaning a breeze!\nThoughtful Design The anti-slip pad design on the furniture mover reduces machine vibrations, while the 1.6" height prevents direct contact between the washing machine and wet floors. Not only does it protect your floors, but it also prevents furniture from corrosion and