t for you to easily move the crib to the bedroom, the living room or any other place you need.\n• MULTI PURPOSE AND EASY TO CARRY: The portable baby bionic bed is light and easy to carry, making it perfect for traveling. The crib comes in three colors: pink, blue and yellow. The crib cute and practical and can be used as a baby lounge chair, cradle bed, bed within a bed, anti-reflux pillow, lie prone pillow, learning seat or changing table. Perfect as a gift for friends or colleagues who are about to become mothers or fathers', 0, 0, 0),
