('29e3147f-608d-43df-b320-8c8adeeea57c', 'VNT-HME-0020', 'Stage Knife Sharpener', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 14, NULL, 65, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-976.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-132.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-685.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-074.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-385.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stage-knife-sharpener-599-525.jpg"]', 'Stage Knife Sharpener', 'Comfortable solid ABS handle, safe and comfortable\n• The amazing 3-slot knife sharpening system for razor-sharp edges on all your knives, even ceramic knives!\n• 100% diamond abrasives, sharpening technology creates double-beveled edges that last longer. Fast and efficient sharpening!\n• Slip-resistant rubber feet securely secure the unit to your work surface. Keep it safe!\n• Detachable sharpener head, take out the knife sharpener head by pressing and pulling the small groove. Easy to clean!', 0, 1, 0),
('8658c041-a715-4f8d-b776-3b5ea9dde23c', 'VNT-HME-0021', 'Mini Portable Sealing Machine', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 9, 8, 66, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-288.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-035.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-645.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-699.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-198.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-portable-sealing-machine-517-973.jpg"]', 'Mini Portable Sealing Machine', '2-IN-1 HEAT SEALER WITH CUTTER: This mini bag sealer comes with both heat sealer and cutting blade. Keeping food fresh just got a whole lot easier with this portable heat sealer, you can directly seal vacuum food bags or foil bags to prevent food spoilage. The built-in sharp stainless steel blade helps you open the package quickly and smoothly.\n• RECHARGEABLE BATTERY: This bag sealer is equipped with a built-in 400mAh battery. Compared with old heat sealing machines, this bag sealer is more powerful and environmentally friendly because there is no need to replace batteries! Usually, a full charge needs 2.5 hours, and it lasts for 10-15 days (depending on the frequency of use). Type-C cable is included.\n• Suitable for Various Plastic Bags: This mini heat sealing machine can reseal various bags to keep food fresh and crispy, such as chips, snacks, sandwiches, candy, pet food vacuum bags, etc. It also works with mylar bags and plastic bags, but not suitable for wrap, cellophane bags, kraft paper bags, pure aluminum bags or thin food storage bags.\n• Portable and Handheld Mini Plastic Bag Sealer: This mini bag sealer can be placed on the refrigerator with magnet on the back, so you can take it very conveniently. Its small size allows it to be placed anywhere in the house to save space or in bags. Weighing only 0.2 lbs, it is portable for picnics, camping trips and helps keep food fresh outdoors.\n• No preheating required: Just in 5 seconds, you can restore a sealed bag. This bag sealing machine can be heated very quickly, it is a powerful and efficient automatic sealing machine that can quickly heat and seal bags at a constant working temperature. Turn on, and in one second, you can seal the package and bag tightly in 5 seconds, convenient and time-saving. Shut down immediately after use to save battery.\n• Professional heat sealing will easily reseal the original plastic bags so food is free from dust and bacteria. Store food in the original packaging to help save the earth.\n• Airtight Seal - Creates an airtight seal and prevents your food from tasting bad and stale and preserves freshness and flavor. You can also pack your cosmetics safely when traveling.', 0, 0, 1),
('b6f90dfb-994a-4288-93a6-18439df746f3', 'VNT-HME-0022', 'Prayer Mat', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 44, 38, 67, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-770.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-791.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-297.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-240.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-387.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-740.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/prayer-mat-513-986.jpg"]', 'Prayer Mat', 'The touch-sensitive prayer mats allow the user to recognize and respond to prayer positions. For example, when the user places their feet on the footrests on the prayer mat, the sensors in the My Prayer Mat recognize the pressure, and you will hear the first part of the Muslim prayer (Allahu Akbar), followed by Surah Al-Fatiha. Then when the knees, hands, and head touch the relevant spots on the mat, you will hear the sound of that part of the prayer.\n• Teaching children how to perform Islamic prayers can be challenging, as there are different movements and positions to learn, along with the correct words and recitations, which can be difficult for young children. That’s why My Prayer Mat makes learning fun, easy and interactive, encouraging children to perform their prayers.\n• The problem that the prayer mat solves is to modernize the methods used to teach children how to pray. The prayer mat follows the latest teaching methods and is in line with the learning styles of the smartphone and tablet generation. This means that it should encourage children and help them learn faster and more successfully than traditional methods. Children learn more easily through visual-kinetic aids, and can interact with it, the first unique Islamic prayer mat.\n• My Prayer Mat is a new and innovative prayer mat because there are no other Islamic prayer mats available on the market that have been developed specifically to teach children how to perform the prayer in this way. My Prayer Mat includes touch sensor technology which other prayer mats do not have. It takes the prayer mat and completely transforms it into something interactive.\n• The new tools provided by My Prayer Rug will enable new children to learn how to perform prayer in an easy and accurate way.', 0, 0, 0),
