('cc9e1c56-2cbd-4a1a-a749-00a7c8522b17', 'VNT-HME-0039', 'Portable Self Mini Mop', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 10, 8, 19, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-328.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-472.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-265.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-867.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-923.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-self-mini-mop-433-716.jpg"]', 'Portable Self Mini Mop', 'Surface Recommendation: Wood, Ceramic\nHead Material: Cotton\nAbout this item\nConvenient and Easy to Use:\n• Portable and compact mini mop measuring 11.6*6.1 inches and weighing 8.1 ounces.\n• Lightweight and small size make it suitable for use by children (installation process requires patience).\nEasy to Remove Stains in Small Spaces:\n• Head design can be rotated and adjusted to easily remove stains in small gaps like bathrooms and rooms.\n• Ideal for cleaning in small spaces and narrow corners, providing flexible and convenient usage.\nPortable Storage Design:\n• Features a portable mini design with a hanging design for easy storage.\n• Can be placed in small areas such as cars, eliminating space waste and ensuring portability.\nApplicable to Multiple Scenarios:\n• Suitable for various scenarios, including removing desktop garbage, kitchen water stains, coffee table water stains, car window water stains, and more.', 0, 0, 0),
('de38885f-6212-43da-9193-0fb49bb24f88', 'VNT-HME-0040', 'Portable Clothes Drying Hanger', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 66, 55, 20, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-clothes-drying-hanger-432-569.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-clothes-drying-hanger-432-933.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-clothes-drying-hanger-432-653.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-clothes-drying-hanger-432-681.jpg"]', 'Portable Clothes Drying Hanger', 'Product Features:\nMultifunctional Drying: Designed to dry both shoes and wet clothes, including suits, jackets, dresses, t-shirts, underwear, bras, socks, and more. This dryer is especially useful for travelers who need a versatile drying solution on the go.\nQuick Drying: Provides quick drying in 1 to 3 hours, depending on the chosen mode. The air wrap formed inside the clothes ensures hot air collects and circulates within, drying clothes and boots efficiently.\nTwo Working Modes with Ionization: Features two modes—air and natural aerial. It produces negative ions during operation to eliminate bad odors from clothes and shoes, ensuring they smell fresh after drying.\nPortable and Foldable Design: With a compact, mini size and foldable design, it is easy to carry and store. The dryer comes with a carry bag that is 7.8 inches in length and width and weighs only 1 pound, making it highly portable.\nCustomer Service: Dedicated to customer satisfaction, offering prompt assistance. Customers can expect a response within 24 hours to resolve any issues, reflecting the commitment to high-quality service', 0, 1, 0),
('3c62bd92-e928-4180-8af8-7dcafa8e29e4', 'VNT-HME-0041', 'Portable Electric Heater Lunch Box', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 22, NULL, 21, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-081.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-453.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-241.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-848.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-024.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-254.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-073.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-heater-lunch-box-429-388.jpg"]', 'Portable Electric Heater Lunch Box', 'Stay Warm On-the-Go with Our Portable Electric Heater Lunch Box!\nElevate your lunchtime experience with this innovative lunch box:\nSafe Heating: Crafted from high-temperature resistant materials, ensuring safety and convenience.\nStylish Design: Fashionable appearance, odorless, and totally safe to use.\nEnergy-Efficient: The heating elements are safer and more energy-saving, making it a practical choice.\nFreshness Guaranteed: Specially designed cover for air permeability, keeping your food fresh.\nDirect Heating: No microwave needed! Heat your food directly through the power supply for quick and convenient meals.\nCar-Friendly: Operates on 12V low voltage, perfect for automotive heating.\nDual Function: Warms and keeps your food cozy.', 0, 0, 1),
('611ba299-d16b-4627-a9de-cb905b95890e', 'VNT-HME-0042', 'Silicone Ice Pad Insulated Car Seat Cushion', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 17, 14, 22, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images//uae_not.jpeg"]', 'Silicone Ice Pad Insulated Car Seat Cushion', 'Introducing the Gel Cushion , Generation 1 900G, designed to provide the ultimate comfort and relief!\nExperience the bliss of advanced column-buckling technology that evenly disperses body weight, banishing uncomfortable pressure points. The innovative gel cooling structure ensures a refreshing airflow to keep your bottom cool even during long sits.\nCrafted from medical-grade gel material, this cushion maintains its shape and support, delivering unwavering comfort over time. The non-slip friction bead grip bottom keeps it securely in place.\nTake comfort on the go with built-in carry handles! Easily switch between home, office, car, airplane, wheelchair, and more. And when it\'s time for a refresh, simply unzip the cover for easy cleaning.\nSay goodbye to pain! Whether it\'s coccyx issues, lumbar strain, sciatica, or degenerative disc disorders, our cushion offers relief. It\'s the gift that keeps on giving – a thoughtful present for loved ones dealing with cervical spine pain.\nDiscover the world of comfort with!', 0, 0, 0),
('bc770a2a-5993-4f99-b6eb-6db1f7aa6f9a', 'VNT-HME-0043', 'Electronic Luggage Scale', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 15, 12, 23, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-luggage-scale-427-394.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-luggage-scale-427-274.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-luggage-scale-427-554.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-luggage-scale-427-149.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electronic-luggage-scale-427-254.jpg"]', 'Electronic Luggage Scale', 'Achieve Precision Weight Measurements with Ease!\nCutting-Edge Technology: Our digital hanging luggage scale uses advanced sensor tech for ultra-precise weight readings. Trust its accuracy for effortless luggage weight management.\nHeavy-Duty Capacity: Designed to handle up to 50kg (110lbs), this scale is a powerhouse! Whether it\'s a long journey or bulky items, it provides spot-on readings for even the heaviest bags.\nUser-Friendly LCD Display: The intuitive LCD display ensures clear, easy-to-read weight measurements. The large, backlit screen guarantees visibility in all lighting conditions, even in dim environments.\nBuilt Tough for Travel: Crafted to withstand the rigors of travel, this digital hanging luggage scale is rugged and dependable. Its compact, robust design can handle frequent use and consistently deliver precise results.\nTraveler-Friendly Features: We\'ve made it convenient for you! Enjoy unit conversion (kg/lbs), the tare function to subtract container weight, and an auto-off feature for extended battery life. Say goodbye to weighing hassles with this intuitive travel essential.', 0, 0, 0),
('c558472f-949c-4ce0-8486-71aa2291a147', 'VNT-HME-0044', 'Wireless Slow Juicer Separator The New Multi Function Portable Juicer Household Usb Charging Separator Artifact', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 28, NULL, 24, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-145.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-668.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-704.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-785.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-969.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-slow-juicer-separator-the-new-multi-function-portable-juicer-household-usb-charging-separator-artifact-426-841.jpg"]', 'Wireless Slow Juicer Separator The New Multi Function Portable Juicer Household Usb Charging Separator Artifact', 'Overview:\n1. [Stir anytime, anywhere]: Easy to carry, you can make and drink fresh and nutritious juices, shakes, or smoothies anytime, anywhere, such as at the home, office, gym, travel, or any other outdoor activities.\n2. [Free hands]: Compared with the traditional manual orange squeezer, the new citrus juicer no longer needs to be pressed by hand. Control the start with just one button, freeing your hands and requiring less effort.\n3. [High Efficiency]: Just cut the orange in half and fix half of the orange on the juicer. Automatic juice extraction at the push of a button. After a short wait, you will get a glass of fresh juice.\n4. [Easy to clean]: Rinse with clean water directly after use. For the more difficult pulp fibers, you can simply use our specially equipped brushes.\n5. [Large capacity]: It can produce 400ml of juice, and friends can refill it unlimitedly.\nProduct Information:\nFunction: Fully automatic\nSpeed: 18000 rpm\nType of cutter head: Double cutter head\nLiner material: PC food-grade plastic\nAdditional features: Rechargeable and portable\nPower: 200W and below\nCapacity: 400mL and below\nVoltage: ?36V\nColor: Green\nOne-time maximum oil output: 400mL and below\nMaximum juice output at one time: 400mL and below\nPulp dregs box capacity: Below 500ml (including 500ml)\nFeeding port shape: Single port\nJuicer maximum speed: 18000 rpm\nBody material: Plastic\nSmart Type: Smart not supported\nWhether it is food-grade material: Yes\nShell process: Laser engraving\nWhether built-in battery: Built-in battery\nStyle classification: Juicer cooking/food supplement machine\nSize Information:\n13.8*11.2*23.75cm\nPacking List :\nJuicer*1, usb*1, manual*1\nProduct Picture:', 1, 0, 0),
('c8265165-2cb3-44dc-bc8d-6db56d3e1662', 'VNT-HME-0045', 'Cloud Rain Humidifier', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 46, 37, 25, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cloud-rain-humidifier-408-551.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cloud-rain-humidifier-408-571.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cloud-rain-humidifier-408-503.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cloud-rain-humidifier-408-539.jpg"]', 'Cloud Rain Humidifier', 'Experience the versatility of our Rain Humidifier, designed to enhance your environment in multiple ways:\n• Rain Diffuser: Add your favorite essential oils to relax and relieve fatigue while improving air quality.\n• Mist Humidifier: Relieve dryness with nanometer fine mist, perfect for bedrooms, offices, and more.\n• Rain Cloud Diffuser design\n• Smart Colorful Raindrop Humidifier functionality\n• Night Light feature for added ambiance\n• Aroma Diffuser suitable for household and office use\n• LED Night Light Water Drop design for aesthetic appeal\nSpecial feature Night Light\nRoom type Office, Bedroom, Living Room', 0, 1, 1);
