('4d6d6dec-12e5-421b-92f1-f069a213ecc7', 'VNT-HME-0046', '2 in 1 Mini Washing Machine', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 11, 9, 26, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-473.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-932.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-391.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-365.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-283.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/2-in-1-mini-washing-machine-403-241.jpg"]', '2 in 1 Mini Washing Machine', 'Brand TOPINCN\n• Capacity 1 Kilograms\n• Special Feature Foldable\n• Access Location Top Load\n• Finish Type Abs\n• Operation Mode Automatic\n• Included Components Suction Cup', 0, 0, 0),
('e9059893-f0d4-4d65-b8f1-a96a7af31af9', 'VNT-HME-0047', 'Multifunctional Faucet Shower', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 14, NULL, 27, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-faucet-shower-401-181.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-faucet-shower-401-163.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-faucet-shower-401-600.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-faucet-shower-401-011.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multifunctional-faucet-shower-401-077.jpg"]', 'Multifunctional Faucet Shower', 'Universal Compatibility: Fits all shower houses and faucets with shower or bathtub (mechanical or thermostatic). Easy to install - simply screw onto a standard shower hose and connect to any standard fixture.\nVersatile Usage: Suitable for bathrooms, kitchens, hotels, schools, apartments, public baths, dormitories, and more. Switch between a gentle spray and a high-pressure massage for a personalized shower experience. Makes a great gift for loved ones.\nDurable Material: Made of ABS material for durability and longevity.\nMultifunctional Design: Features five different functions and an angle-adjustable brass swivel ball bracket. Instantly upgrade your shower to a luxury spa experience. Antimicrobial slip-free handle enhances safety and hygiene, ideal for all ages.\nPause Feature: Reduces water flow to a trickle, allowing water conservation while performing tasks like lathering or shaving legs.', 0, 0, 0),
('ae718a96-815c-4a97-927b-554c494acdd6', 'VNT-HME-0048', 'Earwax Removal Kit', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 28, 22, 28, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-216.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-834.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-578.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-274.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-475.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/earwax-removal-kit-399-473.jpg"]', 'Earwax Removal Kit', 'Features:\n• HD Resolution: Enjoy high-definition image quality for clear viewing.\n• Type-C Charging: Convenient charging using a Type-C cable.\n• Android IOS: Compatible with both Android and iOS devices for versatile usage.\n• Wireless: Operates wirelessly for easy installation and flexibility.\n• Product Size: Compact and portable design measuring 145mm x 13mm x 11mm.\n• Network Standard: Supports IEEE 802.11b/g/n for reliable connectivity.\n• Antenna: Built-in antenna for enhanced signal reception.\n• Working Frequency: Operates at 2.4GHz frequency for stable transmission.\n• Transmission Speed: Smooth video streaming at 30fps.\n• Image Transmitter: Utilizes CMOS technology for image transmission.\n• Working Temperature: Suitable for operation in temperatures ranging from -10°C to 50°C.\n• Input Current: Requires DC5V/150mA input for power supply.\n• Lens Inner Diameter: Features a 3.6mm inner diameter lens.\n• Focal Length: Adjustable focal length ranging from 15mm to 20mm.\n• Working Time: Provides up to 35 minutes of continuous operation.\n• Gravity Sensor: Equipped with a 3-Axis gravity sensor for stability and orientation detection.', 0, 0, 0),
('f9adf7c9-33db-4f08-b2b9-6df9dbfc90a4', 'VNT-HME-0049', 'Wireless Camera Door Bell', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 77, 60, 29, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-camera-door-bell-397-718.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-camera-door-bell-397-411.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-camera-door-bell-397-231.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-camera-door-bell-397-756.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/wireless-camera-door-bell-397-451.jpg"]', 'Wireless Camera Door Bell', 'Features:\n• Cloud Storage Service: Store captured images and videos securely in the cloud.\n• Night Vision: Clear visibility even in low light conditions.\n• Capture Image When Doorbell Pressed: Automatically take photos when the doorbell is pressed.\n• Two-Way Audio: Communicate with visitors via the built-in microphone and speaker.\n• Long Battery Life: Enjoy extended usage time without frequent charging.\n• Notification to Smartphones: Receive instant notifications on your smartphone when someone rings the doorbell.\n• WiFi-Compatible: Connects to your home WiFi network for seamless operation.\n• HD Image: High-definition image quality for clear viewing.\nPackage Include:\n• Doorbell\n• Tape\n• Chime (optional)\n• USB Cable (Optional)\n• 3 Screws\n• 2 Anchors', 0, 0, 1),
('8282f583-67a1-4d2d-8e88-fc954d6b1f83', 'VNT-HME-0050', 'Electric Knife Sharpener', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 14, NULL, 30, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-915.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-322.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-011.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-882.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-040.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-289.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-knife-sharpener-395-259.jpg"]', 'Electric Knife Sharpener', 'Electric Knife Sharpener?: Because it has a high-power motor that can make the sharpener work continuously and efficiently, providing a great comfortable condition for cooking.\n• ?Double Sided Knife Sharpener?: Say goodbye to left-handed sharpening problems. Our double sided sharpener accommodates both left and right-handed users, and even has a dedicated slot for sharpening scissors.\n• ?Safety First?: The non-slip base keeps the sharpener securely in place during use, and the high-quality ABS plastic body is not only durable but also easy to clean.\n• ?FAST AND EFFICIENT?: Don\'t waste time struggling with dull knives. This electric knife sharpener can sharpen your knives in just 5 seconds, making it a time-saving kitchen essential.\n• ?Perfect Gift?: The electric knife sharpener is an excellent choice for anyone who appreciates efficient and time-saving kitchen tools. Surprise your family and friends with this practical and convenient gift.', 0, 1, 0),
('8b7107ed-2b8a-44d2-a36c-de1060635134', 'VNT-HME-0051', 'Hand Press Manual Water Pump', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 16, 14, 31, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-082.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-571.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-742.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-626.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-419.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/hand-press-manual-water-pump-380-784.jpg"]', 'Hand Press Manual Water Pump', 'Product Name:\nHand Press Manual Water Pump\nFeatures:\n•  Effortless Water Dispensing: Easily pump water from large bottles with a simple hand press—no electricity required!\n•  Ergonomic Design: Comfortable handle ensures smooth and easy operation for all ages.\n•  Universal Fit: Compatible with most standard water bottles and jugs for versatile use.\n•  Easy to Assemble: Quick setup and disassembly for cleaning and storage convenience.\n•  Hygienic & Mess-Free: Includes a spill-proof spout and sealing ring to prevent leaks or drips.\n•  Portable & Lightweight: Perfect for home, office, picnics, camping, or outdoor events.', 1, 0, 0),
('706c4bcd-c7e0-43ac-b27f-b8a85a085bd9', 'VNT-HME-0052', 'Anti Static Spray 100ml', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 15, 13, 32, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images//uae_not.jpeg"]', 'Anti Static Spray 100ml', 'Product Name:\nAnti Static Spray 100ml\nFeatures:\n•  Anti Static Spray (100ml) – Say goodbye to static cling and keep your clothes and fabrics fresh with this powerful anti-static spray!\n•  Prevents Static Build-Up – Effectively reduces static electricity on clothes, upholstery, and fabrics, keeping them smooth and static-free.\n•  Easy to Use – Simply spray onto your fabric for instant relief from annoying static cling.\n•  Safe & Gentle Formula – Gentle on fabrics, safe for everyday use on clothing, furniture, and more.\n•  Quick-Drying – Dries fast without leaving any residue, ensuring your items stay fresh and ready to wear.\n•  Compact 100ml Size – Perfect for home, office, or travel to handle static at any time.', 0, 0, 0),
('f97f0901-2280-4c5c-ab39-902d3a4e06b6', 'VNT-HME-0053', 'Breakfast Sandwich Maker', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 23, NULL, 33, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/breakfast-sandwich-maker-349-934.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/breakfast-sandwich-maker-349-161.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/breakfast-sandwich-maker-349-384.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/breakfast-sandwich-maker-349-901.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/breakfast-sandwich-maker-349-847.jpg"]', 'Breakfast Sandwich Maker', 'New Style Breakfast Sandwich Maker -- Stuck at home but craving some good crispy grilling campfire food? Using a panini press is one of the fastest and easiest methods for creating the perfect grilled cheese sandwich. The heat is evenly distributed from both sides, the weight from the top of the grill presses the sandwich perfectly. This pie iron works with all cooktops, ideal for sandwich pancakes, omelets, frittatas, and toast etc, generally, only need 2-5 mins to make it happen, perfect for busy mornings. Note, it\'s mini size design.\n• Ideal For Camping -- This easy-to-carry & sturdy campfire pie iron will transform your camping experience into a true family hit. Detachable design make it easier to carry than most cast iron pie irons for camping, it\'s the perfect hand pie maker for the woods, mountains, or your garden.\n• Easy To Use Ergonomic Design -- Two handles can be locked for cooking, the design of the pie iron stops the ingredients from falling out, unique corrugated edge ensure a firm crimp which making it handy to cook things that generally fall to pieces on a traditional skewer. Just Simply apply oil to the plate of this sandwich maker, place the bread, fill with your favorite ingredients, lock the handes and bake on the stove, the two-tone color design prevents wrong flipping when grilling.\n• Premium Material -- Our hot sandwich makers is made of durable high-grade aluminum alloy. It is high heat resistant, & rust-proof finished with non-stick coating which is convenient for effortless food release. Unique corrugated edge ensure that the edges of the bread do not stick out when the hot sandwich maker is closed and ensure a firm crimp.\n• Easy to clean and carry -- Double-end removable, every corner can be thoroughly washed after each use by detaching the upper and lower plates. Handles are also detachable for better portability. This compact size sandwich baking pan is ideal for small kitchen spaces, dorm rooms, and offices. It takes up little counter or shelf space.', 0, 0, 1),
