lass rinser, can easy substitute soap dispensers and sink sprayers.\nSimple DIY Project: Simple DIY replacement for a soap dispenser, kitchen sprayer or sink hole cover - the perfect complement to your kitchen Faucet. It only takes your several minutes to install our glass rinser all by yourself.', 1, 0, 0),
