e.\nAdvanced Kitchen Tool: With its easy-to-use sharp quality, this advanced kitchen peeler ensures efficient peeling. The ultra-sharp wide blade has minimal resistance when peeling, saving both time and effort. It\'s particularly suitable for peeling fruits and making citrus beverage side dishes.', 0, 1, 0),
