('00614e03-d53c-4729-b80c-7cf07bd48467', 'VNT-HME-0078', 'Stainless Steel Oil Filter Pot with Tray', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 20, 16, 58, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-744.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-741.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-248.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-176.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-576.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-oil-filter-pot-with-tray-196-051.jpg"]', 'Stainless Steel Oil Filter Pot with Tray', 'Introducing Our Stainless Steel Oil Filter Pot\nDiscover the ultimate kitchen essential with these amazing features:\n1. **Durability & Shine**: Crafted with stainless steel using a polishing process, ensuring durability, resistance to corrosion, and a sleek look. Effortlessly clean with water or dishwasher.\n2. **Heat-Insulated Handle** : Enjoy a safe, comfortable grip with high-temperature resistance. Pour squeezed oil directly into the pot without hassle.\n3. **Smart Design**: The container includes a lid to shield against dust. A removable fine-mesh filter ensures only pure oil remains, and the bottom coaster prevents countertop or stove splatters.\n4. **Versatile Helper**: Ideal for storing used edible oils, coconut oil, bacon grease, and more.\nProduct Details:\n- **Name**: Oil Filter Pot\n- **Size**: 1.4L\n- **Package Includes**: 1 x Oil Filter Pot\nUpgrade your cooking experience today with the Stainless Steel Oil Filter Pot!', 0, 0, 0),
('c8873d27-1c26-4163-bcc7-c2078a4a3b02', 'VNT-HME-0079', 'Mini Popcorn Machine', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 52, 40, 59, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-popcorn-machine-192-544.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-popcorn-machine-192-863.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-popcorn-machine-192-504.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-popcorn-machine-192-413.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-popcorn-machine-192-032.jpg"]', 'Mini Popcorn Machine', 'Introducing our Mini Popcorn Machine!\nNeed a speedy corn fix? Look no further! Our QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker cooks perfect corn in just 3 minutes, so you can enjoy a delicious snack in a snap.\nOperating this corn maker is a breeze with its easy one-press On/Off switch. No fuss, just pure convenience.\nDon\'t be fooled by its portable size – this little wonder packs a punch! And the best part? It won\'t take up much space in your kitchen, making storage a breeze.\nWorried about your butter getting cold? Our package includes a handy Butter Warming/Measuring Cup with a 1/4 cup capacity (approx. 60g), so your corn will be perfectly buttered every time.\nSafety is our priority. Remember, when the corn maker is in action, the interior surface gets hot. So keep those hands safe and avoid touching them.\nCustomize your corn with flavors! This mini hot-aircorn maker can handle about 50-70 grams of corn in one go. But if you\'re hankering for more, wait just 10-12 minutes before your next corn session.\n? Keep in mind, this is a hot air corn machine. Don\'t go overboard with butter and sugar directly in the chamber. Wait until your corn is "safe and sound" in the bowl, and then let your creativity run wild with condensed milk, butter, caramel, or anything your taste buds desire.\nSometimes a few kernels might hang back, but that\'s perfectly normal. No need to stress!\nSafety first! Our QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker is equipped with built-in overheating protection. It\'ll automatically power off if things get too toasty.\nWhat\'s in the package:\n- 1 QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker with EU Plug\nPlease note:\n- This package includes only the items mentioned above. Other products are not included.\nBring the carnival to your kitchen with the QuickCorn Mini Hot Air Corn Maker! Your snack time will never be the same. Grab yours now! ?', 1, 0, 0),
