er.\n• Ideal Gift Idea – Delight your coffee-loving friends and family with this stylish and practical gadget.', 0, 1, 0),
('e4bd180c-0354-4467-bfeb-7671d08a629a', 'VNT-HME-0091', 'Portable Electric Water Dispenser', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 29, 23, 71, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-733.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-880.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-619.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-083.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-407.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-917.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-electric-water-dispenser-178-545.jpg"]', 'Portable Electric Water Dispenser', 'Smart 7 Levels Quantitative Pumping: Features two buttons for easy operation. Press the switch button to start pumping water, and press again to stop. The quantitative selection button offers 7 capacity options with indicator lights: 100ML/200ML/300ML/500ML/700ML/1000ML/continuous pumping. Simply press the capacity button to choose the desired amount, and the dispenser will automatically pump water. Press the switch button at any time to halt pumping.\n• Safety Material: Constructed with durable ABS plastic for the housing, 304 stainless steel for the water outlet, and a 3.9 feet food-grade silicone soft water hose. Enjoy low noise pumping and a sleek, fashionable design that enhances any room\'s decor.\n• Portable & Detachable Design: Equipped with a built-in 1800mAh USB rechargeable battery for fast and long-lasting use. The dispenser is easy to install and detachable, with a bottom tray that allows for hands-free operation. Its compact size makes it perfect for home, office, or outdoor use. Ensure the water bottle is placed lower than the dispenser, and insert the water pumping hose from top to bottom.\n• High Compatibility: Comes with a flexible silicone water hose for quick pumping. Compatible with all standard size bottles ranging from 1 gallon to 6 gallons. Works with bottles that have pry-open lids.\n• What You Get: 1x Electric Drinking Water Pump, 1x Water Hose (120cm/3.9 Feet), 1x USB Charger Cable, and 1x User Manual. Note: When charging using an adapter, ensure it has an output voltage of 5V compatible with the desktop water dispenser\'s interface.', 0, 0, 0),
