('bc1c44c2-5ed4-4476-9fd0-e92e88e6e00a', 'VNT-HME-0093', 'Stone Stain Remover', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 12, 9, 73, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-557.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-274.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-817.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-670.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-789.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stone-stain-remover-176-392.jpg"]', 'Stone Stain Remover', 'Stone Stain Remover Cleaner: Formulated with a special gel for increased extractive action on stains, ensuring effective removal. Easy and effective to use, even on vertical surfaces.\nAll Purpose Cleaner: The 2023 New Stone Stain Remover Cleaner is water-based and effectively removes oxidation yellowing, blackening, rust, oil, and other stubborn stains from various stones. Perfect for patio, backyard, and kitchen countertop stone slabs.\nKitchen Marble Oil Stain Cleaner: Gentle formula removes a variety of stains, including grease, with strong decontamination ability and fast results without damaging the surface.\nEasy to Use: Simply pour the product on the affected area, brush gently, rinse away extracted stains with water, and restore the surface to its original state.\nStone Crystal Plating Agent: The best choice for cleaning natural stone floors, ensuring they remain in pristine condition and reducing the need for frequent maintenance in the long run!', 1, 0, 1),
('e8ac073c-2873-4212-82fe-a54749c48efc', 'VNT-HME-0094', 'Portable Mite Cleaner', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 39, 30, 74, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-445.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-073.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-437.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-728.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-739.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-160.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-135.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-mite-cleaner-175-386.jpg"]', 'Portable Mite Cleaner', 'Lightness & Cordless: This handheld vacuum is incredibly convenient for reaching tight spots, thanks to its lightweight and maneuverable design. Perfect for use in cars or anywhere else due to its portability.\nLong Lasting Battery: Rechargeable and quick to charge, this cordless car vacuum holds a charge for an extended period, making it ideal for tackling light cleaning tasks.\nStrong Enough Suction: With powerful suction, this Dustbuster hand vacuum effortlessly picks up debris, especially along carpet edges and walls. It makes cleaning faster and easier, ensuring a thorough job every time.\nWide Application: Suitable for use on mattresses, sofas, upholstery, bedding, carpets, and rugs, this vacuum cleaner tackles areas where traditional vacuum cleaners may struggle.\nVacuum Cleaner: A thoughtful gift for busy moms and wives, this smart device is a valuable addition to any family\'s cleaning arsenal.', 0, 0, 0),
('31000b31-38cc-443f-a0c3-95ccafd69445', 'VNT-HME-0095', 'Multi Max Air Couch', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 39, NULL, 75, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-max-air-couch-173-220.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-max-air-couch-173-074.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-max-air-couch-173-924.jpg"]', 'Multi Max Air Couch', 'Interlocking Quick Release Valve: Ensures fast and secure inflation and deflation.Multifunctional Design: Can be easily transformed into a couch or a bed, offering versatility for various uses.\n• Comfortable Flocked Surface: Provides a cozy and soft feel for enhanced comfort during use.\n• Sturdy Coil-Beam Construction: Offers reliable support and stability for long-lasting durability.\n• Contents: Includes one couch and a repair patch for easy maintenance and care.', 0, 1, 0);
