('231b64ce-ce3a-41f8-8a37-6c1e7ffd2958', 'VNT-HME-0096', 'Humidified Mosquito Repellent Lamp', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 31, 27, 76, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/humidified-mosquito-repellent-lamp-172-483.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/humidified-mosquito-repellent-lamp-172-547.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/humidified-mosquito-repellent-lamp-172-409.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/humidified-mosquito-repellent-lamp-172-055.jpg"]', 'Humidified Mosquito Repellent Lamp', 'Gentle Flying Repeller: This electric light not only repels flying flies with a safe and gentle spray but also humidifies the air and provides a soft night light for your comfort. It features a 3-in-1 design to meet your various needs.\n• Safe Living Environment: Made of high-quality materials, the electric anti-aircraft light is durable and environmentally friendly. It contains no harmful substances and emits no unpleasant odors, ensuring a safe living environment.\n• Wide Range of Applications: Whether it\'s in the bedroom, children\'s room, study, or living room, this electric anti-aircraft light effectively prevents annoying flies and creates a pleasant environment for you.\n• Wonderful Gift: This electric anti-aircraft light makes a great gift idea for any occasion, including housewarming parties, family gatherings, Christmas, friends\' celebrations, or birthdays. It\'s sure to be appreciated.\n• Easy to Use: Designed for effortless use in any humid air environment, simply plug in the electric anti-aircraft light and press the button to activate its effective repellent function.', 0, 0, 0),
('57b9c05a-d60a-44d0-8af8-185e640a79df', 'VNT-HME-0097', 'Mini Air Conditioner Fan', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 30, 26, 77, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-air-conditioner-fan-171-638.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-air-conditioner-fan-171-517.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-air-conditioner-fan-171-757.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-air-conditioner-fan-171-306.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mini-air-conditioner-fan-171-127.jpg"]', 'Mini Air Conditioner Fan', 'Fast and Efficient Cooling: Our mini air conditioner achieves rapid cooling with just a small amount. Utilizing ice water atomization, it blows out cold air within seconds, providing instant relief from the heat.\n• Air Conditioner Fan with 3 Wind Speeds: Designed with 3 wind speeds (natural/cold/strong wind), our small air conditioner allows you to customize your cooling experience. Switch between different modes to find the perfect balance of comfort and refreshment.\n• Portable & Ultra Quiet: Featuring a portable design with a convenient handle, this mini air conditioner can be easily transported anywhere. With a USB charging port, it can be powered by various devices, making it suitable for use at home, in the office, or during outdoor activities. Operating at a low noise level of 24 decibels, it ensures a peaceful and undisturbed environment.\n• Multifunctional Air Cooler: More than just a fan, our personal air conditioner also functions as a humidifier and USB night light. Equipped with a remote control, you can conveniently adjust settings without having to leave your seat, allowing you to enjoy cool and refreshing air anytime, anywhere.', 0, 0, 1),
('a593a198-37f7-49a3-bfc1-7fd210eed75e', 'VNT-HME-0098', 'Stainless Steel Vegetable Cutter', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 23, NULL, 78, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-079.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-988.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-131.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-952.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-076.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-730.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/stainless-steel-vegetable-cutter-166-196.jpg"]', 'Stainless Steel Vegetable Cutter', 'Multi-Functional Kitchen Gadget: This mandoline slicer comes with 3 interchangeable stainless steel blades for versatile food preparation. The slicing blade is perfect for cucumber, tomato, and potato. The flat shredding blade is ideal for grating cheese, nuts, and crackers. The coarse shredding blade can shred vegetables for veggie noodles. It\'s suitable for a wide range of foods like cheese, vegetables, cookies, nuts, salad, pizza toppings, potato chips, and more, making food preparation tasks more efficient.\n40% Larger Feeder Chute Design: Our latest handheld cheese grater features a 40% larger feed opening, accommodating most vegetables and fruits. With a larger suction cup area, stronger suction force, and more stable work, it offers superior performance compared to traditional rotary cheese graters. The spiral handle structure ensures cutting 20 times faster than other cheese shredders, with no snap breakage issues.\nSafe to Use: Our rotary cheese grater with a handle keeps you safe from sharp blades, eliminating the risk of cutting your fingers. Blade replacement is effortless—simply place the knife bucket flat on the workbench, press down gently, and the blade will automatically fall off. The suction cup at the bottom locks firmly to the counter, ensuring convenient and stable operation without sliding.\nEasy to Use & Clean Up: Just rotate the handle of the vegetable cutter and push down the food steadily to get food done in seconds. Each part of the vegetable shredder is detachable and washable, making it super easy to clean. It\'s also dishwasher safe for added convenience.\nWorry-Free Purchase: Every product undergoes careful inspection before shipment and is well-packaged to avoid damage in transit. If you encounter any issues upon receiving the product, please contact us, and we will ensure your satisfaction.', 0, 0, 0),
('573de9f3-23f6-4523-805c-e568f5bca182', 'VNT-HME-0099', '12 Pcs Cooking Utensils Set', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 30, 25, 79, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-168.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-480.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-525.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-417.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-486.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-115.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-609.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/12-pcs-cooking-utensils-set-158-545.jpg"]', '12 Pcs Cooking Utensils Set', 'Introducing Silicone Kitchenware:\n• Soft and Comfortable: The silicone material provides a soft and comfortable grip, ensuring ease of use during cooking and food preparation.\n• Easy to Clean: The non-stick surface of silicone makes it easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher, saving you time and effort in the kitchen.\n• High Temperature Resistance: These kitchenware items are designed to withstand high temperatures, ranging from 40°C to 230°C, making them suitable for various cooking methods and oven use.\n• Heat-Resisting: With heat-resistance properties, these silicone kitchenware items can safely handle hot pots, pans, and cooking surfaces without warping or melting, ensuring durability and longevity in the kitchen.\n• 12 Silicone Kitchen Utensils Set: This professional set includes an egg whisk, solid spatula, slotted spatula, solid spoon, slotted spoon, pasta server, kitchen tongs, mixing scraper, mixing spoon, soup ladle, oil brush, and utensils holder, meeting all your daily cooking needs.\n• Safe and Eco-friendly: Made of food-grade silicone materials with FDA certification, these utensils are BPA-free, lead-free, non-toxic, non-stick, healthy, and safe. The natural wooden handles are durable and won\'t break, melt, or rust.\n• Natural Wood Handle: The beech wood handles are comfortable to hold and have a hanging hole design for convenient storage.\n• Durable & Heat Resistant: These kitchen gadgets are heat resistant up to 446°F (240°C), microwave-safe, and won\'t melt. The soft silicone won\'t scratch your non-stick cookware, prolonging the life of your utensils.\n• Easy to Clean: Thanks to the non-adhesive nature of silicone, these utensils are easy to clean. Simply rinse under water or place them in the dishwasher. After cleaning, let them dry before storing them in the holder.', 0, 0, 0),
('6d45a433-d2bb-40ea-9c2d-aee5c9b3c382', 'VNT-HME-0100', 'Multi-function Garlic Presser', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 8, 7, 15, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-291.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-398.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-756.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-560.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-529.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-389.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-function-garlic-presser-157-763.jpg"]', 'Multi-function Garlic Presser', 'Size: 10x5x7cm\n• Material: Handle - ABS, Blade - 304 Stainless Steel\n• Weight: Approximately 108g\n• Features fine holes for delicate garlic mincing.\n• Non-slip and comfortable grip.\n• Arched design for easy use, effortlessly minces garlic with a gentle press. Packing List:\n• 1 x Stainless Garlic Press', 1, 1, 0),
('a6bf4d08-730c-48bb-9c50-916fb498d571', 'VNT-HME-0101', 'Multi-functional Vegetable Cutter', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 17, NULL, 16, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-functional-vegetable-cutter-145-456.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-functional-vegetable-cutter-145-343.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-functional-vegetable-cutter-145-706.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-functional-vegetable-cutter-145-171.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/multi-functional-vegetable-cutter-145-651.jpg"]', 'Multi-functional Vegetable Cutter', 'Versatile Cutting: Easily slice, dice, julienne, and chop various vegetables with multiple blade attachments.\n• Efficient Prep: Save time in the kitchen with quick and uniform cuts.\n• Durable Construction: Made from high-quality materials for long-lasting performance.\n• Easy to Clean: Removable parts and dishwasher-safe components for hassle-free maintenance.\n• Ergonomic Design: Comfortable grip and non-slip base for safe and easy operation.\n• Space-Saving Storage: Compact design with onboard storage for blades and accessories', 0, 0, 1),
('6635a53d-de1c-4c51-90e9-a2915cf690f8', 'VNT-HME-0102', 'Electric Garlic Chopper', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 20, 16, 17, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-816.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-743.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-155.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-026.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-788.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/electric-garlic-chopper-144-175.jpg"]', 'Electric Garlic Chopper', 'Quickly minces or chops garlic cloves with minimal effort.\n•  Features a motorized bowl with sharp blades, one-touch operation, and easy-to-clean components.\n• Ideal for consistent garlic prep and reducing manual chopping time', 0, 0, 0),
('489a9c3a-9c10-4224-8941-bea608fd83fc', 'VNT-HME-0103', '360° Ultra Head Massager', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 50, 41, 18, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-851.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-361.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-449.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-130.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-726.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-775.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/360%C2%B0-ultra-head-massager-135-330.jpg"]', '360° Ultra Head Massager', 'Scalp Massager---Fit the human head, relax the scalp, massage your head, just like doing SPA for your head at any time, reduce stress and anxiety, and promote relaxation\n• Three Massage Modes--- Press and hold the button to open the head massager, which can switch between the three modes, provide different massage techniques to relieve pressure and tension, select the massage technique you like to meet your massage needs\n• Full Coverage--- This scalp massager has 8-frequency vibrating contacts, and provides 360-degree massage coverage, enjoy a hands-free massage while reading, working, or enjoying coffee, and presses the head muscles to help relax and reduce stress and tension.\n• Ergonomic Design---The ergonomic design conforms to the curve of the human head, fits the scalp of the head, and is comfortable to wear without putting pressure on your head. Each massage portion is provided with an independent vibration source for driving, and the operation states of the massage portions do not affect one another.\n• Great Gift---Use at Home or Take It with You when You Travel, Easy to Live a Healthy and Relaxing Life, the Soothing Massager Helps Her/him Relax After a Stressful Work Day, a Great Gift Option for Friends and Family.', 0, 0, 0),
('fcb1003b-2c04-475f-9ee2-19756102c905', 'VNT-HME-0104', 'Mosquito Repellent', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 11, NULL, 19, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mosquito-repellent-134-729.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mosquito-repellent-134-511.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mosquito-repellent-134-317.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mosquito-repellent-134-957.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/mosquito-repellent-134-020.jpg"]', 'Mosquito Repellent', 'Multifunctional 2-in-1 mosquito killer lamp, combining mosquito killer and LED lighting, can be used as night light or mosquito killer lamp.\n• Physical mosquito control, non-toxic, chemical-free, smoke-free, odor-free, harmless to people and pets, safe and healthy.\n• High efficiency, low energy consumption, two lighting modes, soft light and no eye damage\n• Super quiet, will not disturb your sleep, small size, easy to carry, rechargeable or connected to USB to use.\n• Very suitable for indoor, outdoor, home, bedroom, living room, kitchen, office, garden, camping, tent, outdoor use.', 0, 0, 0),
('c1c35ddc-52cd-447f-a92c-f5d2fe373053', 'VNT-HME-0105', 'Cooling Fan With Ice', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 25, 20, 20, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-216.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-753.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-703.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-203.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-852.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-139.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-657.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/cooling-fan-with-ice-131-525.jpg"]', 'Cooling Fan With Ice', 'Input: 2A\n• Power: 10W\n• Room Type: Office, Bedroom\n• Special Feature: Portable, Oscillating\n• Recommended Uses For Product: Cooling\n• Indoor/Outdoor Usage: Outdoor\n• Introducing the Mini Frost Fan, your go-to solution for staying cool during scorching summer months! This Head Rotatable Frost Breeze Ice Water Fan offers a portable alternative to bulky AC units, perfect for travel, camping, car rides, and bedrooms.\n• Enjoy refreshing cool air all day with the Mini Frost Fan\'s water misting technology. Just fill the water tank and let the misting function lower the room temperature through evaporative cooling.\n• Stay cool and focused with this Mini Frost Fan\'s low noise operation and hands-free design. With three speed settings, you can tailor the cooling to your liking without disturbance. It\'s a versatile companion for work or relaxation.\n• Circulate cool air effortlessly with the Mini Frost Fan\'s oscillating mode, making it ideal for larger spaces or as a desk/floor fan. Control the settings conveniently with the remote, allowing you to adjust speed and oscillation without leaving your seat.\n• In summary, the Mini Frost Fan is your reliable and convenient companion for staying cool anytime, anywhere. With misting function, low noise operation, multiple speed settings, oscillating mode, rechargeable batteries, remote control, and portable design, it\'s perfect for travel, camping, bedrooms, workplaces, and more. Don\'t miss out on this must-have desk fan of 2023!', 0, 1, 1),
('6c120542-c339-471a-b4b2-2eaf799f5f87', 'VNT-HME-0106', '3d head and shoulder Kneeding Massage', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 57, 45, 21, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-117.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-588.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-260.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-445.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-662.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-219.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/3d-kneeding-massage-126-261.jpg"]', '3d head and shoulder Kneeding Massage', 'Muscle Magic Massage Pillow\nRevitalize your body and mind with our Muscle Magic Massage Pillow!\nMuscle Tension and Knots:\n• Banish muscle tension, knots, and stiffness in the back and neck muscles.\n• Experience ultimate relaxation and enjoy improved flexibility.\nStress and Anxiety:\n• Trigger the release of endorphins, your body\'s natural mood enhancers.\n• Watch stress and anxiety levels melt away, leaving you feeling serene and centered.\nPain Relief:\n• Say goodbye to pain from muscle strains, minor injuries, or chronic conditions like fibromyalgia.\n• Our massage pillow is your go-to for soothing relief and enhanced well-being.\nPoor Circulation:\n• Unleash the power of kneading and rolling actions to boost blood circulation.\n• Enjoy the benefits of improved oxygen and nutrient delivery to your body\'s tissues.\nHeadaches:\n• Target and ease tension headaches stemming from neck and shoulder tightness.\n• Let our Muscle Magic Massage Pillow be your solution for soothing comfort and headache relief!', 0, 0, 0),
