('2219075b-55eb-4c04-83ac-7b7cf1bc1586', 'VNT-HME-0110', 'Washing Machine Cleaner (Pack of 12)', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 8, NULL, 25, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/washing-machine-cleaner-pack-of-12-115-755.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/washing-machine-cleaner-pack-of-12-115-375.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/washing-machine-cleaner-pack-of-12-115-504.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/washing-machine-cleaner-pack-of-12-115-139.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/washing-machine-cleaner-pack-of-12-115-678.jpg"]', 'Washing Machine Cleaner (Pack of 12)', 'Features:\nUniversal Compatibility: Works with all washer types including high efficiency, standard toploaders, front loaders. Compatible with brands like GE, LG, Samsung, Whirlpool, Maytag, Electrolux.\nEco-Friendly Tabs: Natural effervescent foaming tablets, septic safe, and minimal packaging. Reduces waste compared to liquid descalers and wipes.\nInstant Cleaning Power: Self-wash tablets clean without the need for brushing or wiping. Activated by water, they turn into deep scrubbing powder that removes grime and hard water buildup.\nOdor Eliminator: Freshens washer basket, rubber gasket, and internal parts to prevent odors. Ensures clothes come out clean and fresh smelling.\nExtended Cleaning: Time-release formula cleans deep inside pump, valve, tub, drum, agitator, filter, and hoses.', 0, 1, 0),
('bef07bd5-712e-430e-a7e7-e16ef23b3867', 'VNT-HME-0111', 'Swifty Tool Sharpener', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 13, 11, 26, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/swifty-tool-sharpener-113-535.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/swifty-tool-sharpener-113-415.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/swifty-tool-sharpener-113-343.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/swifty-tool-sharpener-113-364.jpg"]', 'Swifty Tool Sharpener', 'Product Description:\nThe incredible cordless motorized knife sharpener, as seen on TV, offers precision power sharpening for knives, scissors, and household tools. It features a built-in guide that holds the blade at the perfect angle, ensuring professional-grade sharpening. The high-speed rotating sharpening stone both sharpens and hones the blade\'s edge. A catch tray is included for metal shavings. The sharpener requires 4 AA batteries, which are not included', 0, 0, 0),
('001c4eda-e28e-4029-8614-715ac6a872f5', 'VNT-HME-0112', 'Portable Juicer Bottle', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 20, 17, 27, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-juicer-bottle-107-370.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-juicer-bottle-107-903.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-juicer-bottle-107-824.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-juicer-bottle-107-177.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/portable-juicer-bottle-107-712.jpg"]', 'Portable Juicer Bottle', 'The personal blender, with a capacity of 350ml/12 oz, offers compactness and portability. Its ease of use is unparalleled: simply place your ingredients into the cup, align it with the base of the blender, press the "on" button, and await the magic. After a brief moment, it\'s time to savor your juice, milkshake, or fruit and vegetable drink. This swift and hassle-free process makes it a perfect fit for home, office, travel, and more.\nFood-Grade Materials\nYour safety takes precedence. Crafted from food-grade PP and ABS materials, the portable juicer cup is both BPA-free and non-toxic. With an eco-friendly design, you can relish your fresh and nutritious creations without any concerns.\nSafe and Effortless Cleaning\nEquipped with built-in safety features, the blender guards against overheating and won\'t function if components are improperly assembled. Thanks to its one-button automatic cleaning, along with a smart safety protection device and magnetic sense switch, this blender offers an ultra-safe user experience. Additionally, the cup is removable and easily cleaned, ensuring optimal hygiene after a simple flush.\nWireless USB Rechargeability\nFitted with a high-quality built-in wireless rechargeable lithium battery, a single full charge empowers the squeezing of approximately 14 cups of juice consecutively. The included USB cable allows for effortless charging via power banks, laptops, computers, and other USB devices.\nExceptional Mixing\nThe blender boasts stainless steel blades, precisely 4 in number, engineered for impeccable mixing. With their prowess, they effortlessly transform any assortment of fruits and vegetables into delectable smoothies. Relish the joy of crafting your own culinary delights', 0, 0, 0),
