('d1d63d78-bbe6-4a84-8577-675e2220ef64', 'VNT-HME-0120', 'Doublefaced Glass Cleaner Magnetic', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 14, 11, 35, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/doublefaced-glass-cleaner-magnetic-56-905.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/doublefaced-glass-cleaner-magnetic-56-569.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/doublefaced-glass-cleaner-magnetic-56-002.jpg"]', 'Doublefaced Glass Cleaner Magnetic', 'Magnetic Window Cleaner for Double Glazed Windows 5-12mm Thickness\nNote: Glass in different thickness should be used on different magnetic glass wipers, otherwise it cannot move or fall off the glass. Be sure to apply detergent to the cleaning cotton. Slowly move the magnetic window cleaner during use, as the slower the moving speed, the better the cleaning effect.\nUnique Modern Design - Triangular Shape Say goodbye to risky window cleaning with our powerful double-sided magnetic window cleaner! The triangular shape allows easy access to narrow areas and eliminates dead corners, making high-rise windows cleaning a breeze!\nHigh-Quality Materials for Safer Use Our magnetic window cleaner is crafted with high-quality ABS material, natural latex, and strong magnets, ensuring good strength, high toughness, and a more solid texture. You can clean with confidence and safety.\nBuilt-in Water Storage Sponge No more frequent water replenishment! The magnetic window cleaner features a built-in water storage sponge, ensuring long-lasting use and making cleaning a breeze!\nWide Application - Perfect for Home & Car This magnetic window cleaner is perfect for 5-12mm double glazed surfaces, whether it\'s home windows, car windows, sliding doors, or shower screens. Keep your windows sparkling and clear effortlessly!\nMore Secure with Anti-Falling Rope Safety first! Our magnetic window cleaner comes with 2 long anti-falling ropes, ensuring a secure grip while cleaning. Tie the rope to your hand for added peace of mind and wipe your glass more securely!\nMake your window cleaning a breeze with our double-sided magnetic window cleaner! Add to your cart now and enjoy a crystal-clear view!', 0, 1, 0),
('38adfe1a-ed8b-499a-837a-a579c316267a', 'VNT-HME-0121', 'Rechargeable Lint Remover', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 19, 15, 36, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-327.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-814.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-903.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-423.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-595.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-990.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rechargeable-lint-remover-54-790.jpg"]', 'Rechargeable Lint Remover', 'USB Electric Lint Remover Rechargeable: Say goodbye to disposable batteries! Our fabric shaver is designed to be environmentally friendly and cost-effective. It\'s rechargeable, and no battery is required, which is both environmentally friendly and saves your money. It takes about 3 hours for the sweater shaver to be fully charged and can work continuously for 30 minutes. Also, you can recharge or shave the fabric while charging, and you just need to plug the cable into a charging device, power bank, or even a laptop and switch the fabric shaver fuzz remover on.\nDouble Protection:  Experience upgraded protection with our detachable bionic honeycomb knife net, ensuring your fabrics stay safe. The stainless steel knife net, with a slight arc, fits the clothes smoothly, trims and presses without deformation, keeps a safe distance from the knife head, and does not damage the clothes. If the net cover of the lint shaver is loose or removed, the clothes shaver will stop working immediately to avoid danger or damage to the fabric.\nEfficient and Durable: Our electric lint remover is equipped with a high-speed motor system and a rust-proof 6-blade blade, which is much faster than similar sweater pill removers on the market. At the same time, it is equipped with a light ring, which can easily find the hairball and remove it in the case of weak ambient light. It will refresh your sweaters, coats, cushions, and blankets and keep them tidy.\nLonger Battery Life: Built-in 500mAh lithium battery, more powerful power, lasting battery life, you can trim the whole family\'s clothes, which is convenient for home or travel.\nWidely Used: The perfect pill remover for clothes, compact structure, easy to carry, suitable for travel and family use. Suitable for all kinds of fabrics: clothes, sweaters, cushions, blankets, socks, wool coats, and can also be used in household furniture and decoration, including sofas. The electric lint remover rechargeable is a good gift for women and mom.', 1, 0, 1),
