('29001264-0ca7-4d17-8f6c-5adce262fad1', 'VNT-HME-0131', '9-in-1 Vegetable Cutter', 'VANTA HME', 'home-decor', 25, NULL, 46, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/9-in-1-vegetable-cutter-22-728.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/9-in-1-vegetable-cutter-22-679.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/9-in-1-vegetable-cutter-22-773.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/9-in-1-vegetable-cutter-22-431.jpg"]', '9-in-1 Vegetable Cutter', 'Product Name: 9-in-1 Vegetable Cutter\nDescription: A 9-in-1 Vegetable Cutter is an essential kitchen tool designed to quickly and efficiently chop, dice, or slice vegetables. This handy device typically consists of a container with a sharp grid of blades or disks that allow you to insert vegetables and press down, resulting in uniformly chopped pieces. Some vegetable choppers come with interchangeable blades for different cutting styles, such as slicing or julienning.\nKey Features:\n• Efficient Chopping: Quickly and uniformly chops, dices, or slices vegetables, saving time and effort in meal preparation.\n• Interchangeable Blades: Includes multiple blades for various cutting styles, such as slicing, dicing, and julienning.\n• Easy to Use: Simple pressing mechanism for efficient and quick chopping.\n• Uniform Results: Ensures consistent size and shape for chopped vegetables, enhancing the presentation and cooking process.\n• Versatile Use: Ideal for preparing a variety of dishes requiring finely chopped vegetables like salads, stir-fries, soups, and more.\n• Convenient Container: The container collects chopped vegetables, keeping your kitchen clean and organized.', 0, 0, 0),
