('6bd1d574-513c-48af-a916-d59b562efefa', 'VNT-GAM-0004', 'DIY Screw Puzzle Suitcase', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 45, 36, 51, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/diy-screw-puzzle-suitcase-286-340.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/diy-screw-puzzle-suitcase-286-008.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/diy-screw-puzzle-suitcase-286-489.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/diy-screw-puzzle-suitcase-286-598.jpg"]', 'DIY Screw Puzzle Suitcase', 'Building Toy Set:This kids\' drill set is packed with colorful pieces, including large nuts and bolts. It features a 3D electric drill with two interchangeable bits, a wrench, a screwdriver, an instruction book with various patterns, and a handy portable storage case. The case doubles as a drilling board, making jigsaw puzzles a breeze. Easy to carry everywhere!\nInspire Children\'s Minds: By offering children a fun STEM toy, we aim to boost their engagement in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics. This set helps develop fine motor skills, color recognition, teamwork, and artistic cognition. It also enhances sensory perception, cognitive ability, hands-on skills, and sparks imagination and creativity!\nA Portable Drilling Adventure: Whether at home or on the go, kids can enjoy hours of independent play with this versatile toy. It\'s a 2-in-1 wonder – a peg board for play when unfolded and a convenient storage box when folded. Easy to clean and transport, children can carry their favorite building pieces to play with friends, encouraging sharing and socializing. Countless ways to play, keeping children engaged and interested!\nDesign and Drill: Let your children\'s creativity run wild with endless combinations of 1D, 2D, and 3D structures. Encourage them to build robots, vehicles, creatures, and anything else their imaginations dream up. To ensure everyone can join the fun together, we provide extra tools like a wrench, manual screwdriver, and an electric screwdriver.\nFun and Safe: Your child\'s safety is our priority. This hardware set is made from non-toxic, BPA-free, and odorless ABS plastic material, rigorously tested in third-party labs for safety. It\'s a great alternative to screen time and makes a thoughtful gift for birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving, or any special occasion.', 0, 0, 0),
('4c672ae8-c54b-473c-ab03-4aaf67c9fe98', 'VNT-GAM-0005', 'Quick Push Pop Game', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 10, NULL, 52, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/quick-push-pop-game-198-655.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/quick-push-pop-game-198-451.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/quick-push-pop-game-198-908.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/quick-push-pop-game-198-976.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/quick-push-pop-game-198-674.jpg"]', 'Quick Push Pop Game', 'Diverse Game Modes: The pop game machine offers four different modes. The first mode is Mission Mode, which consists of 30 large tasks. The second mode is memory mode, with 9 large tasks. The third mode is the scoring mode, where the player\'s objective is to turn off as many lights as possible within one minute to earn a high score. The final mode is multiplayer mode, where each player takes turns completing a level before passing the machine on to the next player.\n• Stress Relief Toys: This rapid push puzzle game machine is perfect for releasingkids\'s stress and enhancing sensory stimulation. Kids will engage in positive thinking, hand-eye coordination, and brain training during play challenges filled with lights and sounds, promoting your child\'s sensory development.\n• Educational Puzzle Game: The rapid push puzzle pop game machine attracts kid’s eyes and also provides endless fun, it can create more parent-child time and reduce the time spent on electronic games while protecting our eyes.\n• Premium Silicone Material: The rapid push puzzle game machine is Made of high-quality silicone material, safe to use without unpleasant odor, The buttons are flexible durable, and not easy to damage.Lightweight and portable for enjoying the game anytime and anywhere.\n• Perfect Best Gift: This Light Up Toys makes the best gift for kids, teens, and even adults. Fidget sensory toy reduces stress, anxiety,y or fatigue, The fun games make it a perfect gift for kids of all ages for Christmas, Holidaysbirthdayay parties, or any occasion.', 0, 0, 1),
