('a0a4957e-819b-4666-9461-97203fc9ce87', 'VNT-GAM-0007', '48 Holes Rocket Bubble', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 28, 22, 54, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/48-holes-rocket-bubble-89-428.jpg"]', '48 Holes Rocket Bubble', 'What\'s Included:\n• 48 Holes Bubble Gun: Capable of blowing over colorful bubbles per minute.\n• Rechargeable: Includes a rechargeable battery, ensuring continuous fun without power worries.\nSafe and Durable:\n• Made from high-quality, skin-safe plastic material.\n• Safe for toddlers, children, pets, and adults.\n• Lightweight and durable, perfect for outdoor activities.\nPerfect Gifts:\n• Ideal gift for kids and adults for various occasions like birthdays, weddings, graduations, summer parties, camping trips, carnivals, and beach outings.\n• Suitable for new couples, toddlers, teenagers, and adults.\nSummer Party Favors:\n• Easy to use by quickly dipping the bubble maker head into bubble liquid.\n• Produces countless colorful bubbles with a light effect, perfect for enhancing any party atmosphere.\n???? Notice:\n• Ensure the battery is fully charged before use to prevent bubbles from sticking together.\n• Can be used as a handheld fan after drying, providing cool and comfortable wind.\n• Customer support available for any product inquiries or concerns to ensure a satisfactory shopping experience.', 0, 0, 0),
('d339be79-c6a0-4f4a-8081-2769b8de1a85', 'VNT-GAM-0008', 'RC Stunt Car', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 52, NULL, 55, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rc-stunt-car-73-010.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rc-stunt-car-73-007.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rc-stunt-car-73-259.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rc-stunt-car-73-567.jpg"]', 'RC Stunt Car', 'Here\'s a revised version of the description:\nAmazing Stunt Design: Experience the thrill of incredible stunts with the VAZILLIO stunt car! It can perform forward, backward, left, and right turns, as well as impressive 180 flips and 360 rotations. Pushing the 2 joysticks toward opposite directions results in a fast rotating motion resembling an inverted cone of light. With a maximum speed of 9mph, the excitement never ends.\nStrong Material & Scratch-Resistant Tires: Crafted from non-toxic ABS material and equipped with flexible wheels, this stunt car is built to withstand collisions with furniture or walls. Special tread patterns provide excellent grip, allowing kids to play on various surfaces like concrete floors, carpets, beaches, park grass, and slopes up to 40 degrees.\nLong Distance & Anti-Interference Transmitter: Equipped with a 2.4GHz wireless remote control, this racing car allows kids to compete with friends without signal interference. The remote control has a maximum distance of about 65ft, providing ample space for thrilling races and maneuvers.\nLong Endurance Rechargeable Battery: Enjoy extended playtime with the built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery. With up to 30 minutes of intensive playtime or up to 60 minutes of normal race time, this stunt car ensures uninterrupted fun. Plus, it eliminates the need for disposable batteries, reducing pollution and saving costs.\nProduct Specifications:\n• Dimensions: 6.5 x 7.5 x 3 inches\n• Item Weight: 1.3 pounds\nGet ready for non-stop action and excitement with the VAZILLIO stunt car! ????', 0, 1, 0),
('e0024ae9-0da9-49ac-9a50-f2db9cf7702b', 'VNT-GAM-0009', 'Robot Deform Car', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 21, 18, 56, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/robot-deform-car-71-690.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/robot-deform-car-71-373.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/robot-deform-car-71-193.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/robot-deform-car-71-852.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/robot-deform-car-71-197.jpg"]', 'Robot Deform Car', 'Durable and Safe Material: Our robot toy car is crafted from high-quality, non-toxic ABS material, ensuring safety for your children during playtime.\n2 in 1 Button Car Robot Vehicle Deformation: With its innovative 2-in-1 design, simply press the deformation button, and watch as the car magically transforms into a robot. It\'s a thrilling experience that brings endless fun to your children.\nCompact Size: Measuring 23 x 9.5 x 7.5 cm, this deformed robot car is perfectly sized for little hands to hold and play with comfortably. It\'s an exciting toy for boys aged 1-5 years old.\nGreat Gift Idea: Delight your child with this robot toy car, which comes packaged and ready to share with friends. It\'s an ideal gift for Christmas, birthdays, New Year\'s, and other special occasions.\nExperience the joy of transformation and endless fun with our 2-in-1 Button Car Robot Vehicle Deformation toy!', 0, 0, 1),
