('9b280342-3532-46c8-a06b-a365d2ba91e3', 'VNT-BTY-0163', '150ml Smart Car Perfume Diffuser', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 25, NULL, 58, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_81_693057617545_main_68d540691d133.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758806134_6998dc1341eb364249b4.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758806137_97d2b1c0be392134bb3a.jpg"]', '150ml Smart Car Perfume Diffuser', 'Car Diffuser & Humidifier, Car Fragrance This compact, USB-powered device is designed to fit perfectly in cup holders, making it ideal for on-the-go aromatherapy. Whether you\'re using it as a car freshener or a scent diffuser in your office or home, it offers a versatile and convenient solution. The package includes a USB cable, though an adapter is not provided.\n• Portable Car Diffuser & Humidifier, Car Fragrance With a 160ml capacity and dual spray modes, this diffuser ensures prolonged and efficient usage. Enjoy mini essential oil aromatherapy wherever you are—whether in your car, home, or office. It works perfectly as a car air freshener, perfume diffuser, or home scent diffuser, helping to create a refreshing and relaxing atmosphere.\n• Car Air Freshener, Car Fragrance Enjoy quiet operation and enhanced safety with this car diffuser. Its automatic shut-off feature prevents overheating, allowing you to experience mini essential oil aromatherapy worry-free. Perfect for use as a car air freshener, home diffuser, or office scent solution, it promotes relaxation and peace of mind.\n• Enhance the Air Quality in Your Car, Car Fragrance Transform your vehicle into a refreshing escape with this advanced car diffuser. Utilizing ultrasonic technology, it creates a fine mist that eliminates odors, keeps the air fresh, and adds moisture to prevent dryness. Perfect for frequent drivers, it helps alleviate issues like dry throat and skin while improving the overall atmosphere. Enjoy a healthier and more enjoyable driving experience wherever the road takes you.\n• Stylish and Practical Mini USB Humidifier, Car Fragrance This versatile mini humidifier is perfect for cars, offices, and bedrooms, effortlessly enhancing any setting. Its modern design makes it both functional and visually appealing, adding a thoughtful touch to daily life. Whether you\'re looking for a birthday gift, holiday present, or a "just because" surprise, this portable diffuser is a wonderful choice. It not only improves the ambiance with soothing aromas but also adds much-needed humidity, making it a gift that\'s sure to delight anyone who receives it.', 0, 0, 0),
