('c47af69c-5a72-4def-91ed-b50ffc112912', 'VNT-BTY-0165', 'Essential Oil Aroma Diffuser', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 78, 65, 60, '["#312E81","#6366F1","#C7D2FE"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/essential-oil-aroma-diffuser-48-147.jpg"]', 'Essential Oil Aroma Diffuser', 'Compact & Portable Design\n• Small and lightweight, perfect for home, office, or bedside use\n• Easily fits on tables, desks, or countertops\nWhisper-Quiet Operation\n• Ultra function, ideal for bedrooms and workspaces\n• Enjoy the benefits of humidification without noise disruption\nFine Mist for Optimal Humidity\n• Releases a soothing mist to add moisture to the air\n• Helps alleviate dry skin, sinus issues, and improves air quality\nEasy One-Button Control\n• Simple one-button operation for hassle-free use\n• Switch on and off or adjust mist modes with ease\nEnergy Efficient\n• Consumes low power, making it budget-friendly and environmentally conscious\n• Great for continuous use without high energy costs', 0, 1, 1);
