('2c2bff11-b29d-4700-b849-5293af6f3828', 'VNT-BTY-0166', 'Smart car air freshener with RGB light and fog effect', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 60, NULL, 61, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758806574_552ebb02d0356fbf1490.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/imageye___-_imgi_2_c6da347c-c058-4342-8_68d542005c167.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758806556_1e39d13fc9bf2f8c752d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1758806562_251a409a8a33073e80fe.jpg"]', 'Smart car air freshener with RGB light and fog effect', 'Three One-Click Operation Modes: Switch between three fragrance diffusion modes with just the push of a button: continuous, intermittent, and smart. Perfect for adjusting the fragrance intensity in different situations.\n•  360-degree fragrance diffusion : The full-coverage mist design delivers fragrance to all corners of the car, eliminating unpleasant odors in minutes.\n•  Safe for children with no harmful chemicals, no heat or flame, completely safe to use in the presence of children and pets.\n•  Smart sensor technology automatically activates or deactivates the device by detecting vehicle movement or vibration. Energy-efficient and intelligent performance.\n•  RGB lighting and cloud fog effect Adjustable colored lights combined with cloud-like fog effect create a dreamy and relaxing atmosphere at night. Perfect for night driving or creating a luxurious feel in the car', 0, 0, 0),
('2a987589-a2de-44f4-964e-139d988436dc', 'VNT-BTY-0167', 'Bukhoor Perfume Dispenser Smart', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 40, 33, 62, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bukhoor-perfume-dispenser-smart-64-750.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bukhoor-perfume-dispenser-smart-64-232.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bukhoor-perfume-dispenser-smart-64-968.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bukhoor-perfume-dispenser-smart-64-946.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/bukhoor-perfume-dispenser-smart-64-047.jpg"]', 'Bukhoor Perfume Dispenser Smart', 'Custom Control:\n• Adjust the charcoal incense burner based on room size, desired fragrance intensity, and personal preferences.\n• Suitable for small, medium, or large rooms up to 1,000 square feet, depending on airflow and placement.\nSmart Device:\n• Sleek design fits seamlessly into any decor.\n• Provides surround-scent technology for a pleasant fragrance experience throughout the room.\n• Portable and lightweight with an electroplated shell and ceramic heating element.\n• Conveniently sized (9 x 7 x 7cm) with a long-lasting 2000mAh built-in battery.\nSuitable for Various Spaces:\n• Ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, offices, spas, cafes, and more.\n• Helps purify the air, promote relaxation, relieve stress, and improve sleep quality.\nImportant Purchase Notes:\n• Aromatherapy products do not sustain combustion.\n• Each operating cycle lasts 30 seconds and automatically shuts down.\n• Operating temperature can reach 350 degrees Celsius, and residual heat may persist even when closed.\nCreate a soothing ambiance in your space with our versatile and convenient charcoal incense burner!', 0, 0, 0),
('b09900fb-1fd9-45fe-8fbc-1162c6fb3426', 'VNT-BTY-0168', 'Essential Men\'s Perfume', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 9, 7, 63, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/pheromone-men-s-perfume-34-912.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/pheromone-men-s-perfume-34-816.jpg"]', 'Essential Men\'s Perfume', 'Irresistible Scent: A blend of fresh, woody, and musky notes designed to appeal to the senses and boost confidence.\n• Enhanced Attraction: Formulated with pheromones to increase attraction and social appeal naturally. Feel more confident and magnetic.\n• Long-Lasting Fragrance: Enjoy the captivating scent throughout the day, from morning to night, without frequent reapplications.\n• Balanced Notes: Top notes of citrus and spice, with heart notes of floral and wood, and a musky base, leaving a signature scent wherever you go.\n• Versatile Use: Perfect for all occasions — be it casual, formal, or special events. Stand out effortlessly.\n• Travel-Friendly: Compact and easy to carry, ideal for on-the-go use in your bag, gym, or travel kit.', 0, 0, 0),
('30d7b41e-0bac-43d4-9420-e604a5d414de', 'VNT-WLN-0001', 'Cordless Vibration Knee Massage Device', 'VANTA WLN', 'wellness', 70, NULL, 64, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61BGjhLbuWL._AC_SL1500__6ab3b359bb3f6.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71cU-WHcHWL._AC_SX679__6ab3b359c040d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71mt2R+PluL._AC_SL1500__6ab3b359c101d.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/81BvUgqLzML._AC_SL1500__6ab3b359c6a48.jpg"]', 'Cordless Vibration Knee Massage Device', 'Portable Knee Massager: This Knee Massager comes with latest technology perform knee vibration massage and hot compresses according to your needs in anytime, anywhere, to relieve knee pressure and fatigue. Providing maximum comfort and knee recovery.\n• Knee Pain Relief Device: Our ergonomic knee brace massager is fully wrapped the knee joint for pain relief deep tissue. lightweight and portable cordless design is convenient to carry and store. Whether at home, in the office or in travel, you can easily enjoy a comfortable knee therapy. Helping to ease muscle tension and improve circulation for excellent relaxation.\n• Impressive Capabilities: This knee bliss massager features airbags positioned on both sides and the front, enabling knee massage through airbag compression. The massager\'s intensity can be easily adjusted based on applied pressure, enhancing relaxation during the massager for a comprehensive soothing experience on the knee\n• User-Friendly : To operate this knee therapy devices, simply long press the button to start or stop its function. For mode selection, short press the mode button to cycle through the modes (Auto - Low - High - Off); the indicator light will turn white when activated. Similarly, short press the heating button to cycle through heating temperatures (Low-Medium-High-Off); the indicator light will turn whi