('5dee8b54-5c10-499c-a732-d81e4b27a32f', 'VNT-WTC-0017', 'T500 Smart Watch Series 7', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 12, 9, 34, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t500-smart-watch-series-7-486-931.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t500-smart-watch-series-7-486-900.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t500-smart-watch-series-7-486-320.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t500-smart-watch-series-7-486-641.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/t500-smart-watch-series-7-486-122.jpg"]', 'T500 Smart Watch Series 7', 'Multifunctional: The T500 Series 7 smartwatch features a range of features, including blood pressure monitoring, Bluetooth calling, music playback, and heart rate tracking. With its diverse capabilities, it serves as a comprehensive solution for your health monitoring and communication needs.\n• Universal Compatibility: Designed to seamlessly integrate with both iOS and Android platforms, this 44mm smartwatch ensures broad compatibility. Users can enjoy its advanced functionality regardless of their preferred mobile operating system, making it a versatile choice for a wide range of users.\n• Stylish Aesthetics: The smartwatch features a sleek and stylish design in classic black, making it a fashionable accessory suitable for a variety of occasions. The 44mm size strikes a balance between a bold display and a comfortable fit on the wrist, appealing to users who value both beauty and functionality.\n• Accurate Health Tracking: With built-in sensors, the T500 smartwatch provides accurate health monitoring. From real-time heart rate monitoring to blood pressure measurements, users can stay on top of their health metrics. This accurate tracking enables individuals to proactively manage their well-being.\n• Enhanced Connectivity: In addition to the health features, the smartwatch offers enhanced connectivity options. Bluetooth calling allows users to answer calls directly from their wrist, and the music player function provides easy control over their playlist. This level of connectivity enhances the overall user experience, making it a convenient and practical device for everyday use.', 1, 0, 0),
