('1b3a84ad-2def-46b0-8017-ab11ba40c29a', 'VNT-WTC-0020', 'AK 96 WATCH', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 27, 23, 37, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-271.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-630.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-297.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-333.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-790.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-666.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ak-443-360.jpg"]', 'AK 96 WATCH', 'Make & Answer Calls & Smart Notifications?: The newly designed smart watch for phone calls in 2022, after connecting to Bluetooth, you can make/answer calls, high-quality Bluetooth will bring you clear call experience (can set ringtones or vibrations, add 8 contacts and view call logs); The smart watch can set notification reminders, receive calls, messages, Facebook, WhatsApp, etc. Real-time notification, you will not miss any important information when your phone is not around.\n• ??1.7 inch Full Touch Screen & DIY Watch Face?Borderless design concept, 2.5D curved glass, 1.7 inch full touch screen, 240 x 280 high-definition resolution, smart watches for women and men bring a greater sense of design and a wider field of view; More than 150 different UI styles to choose from, you can also set your own image, personalized clothing should be your best daily look.\n• ?AI Voice Control & Large Capacity Battery?AI voice control fitness watch and mobile phone, long press to say your order, you can make calls, control camera, music, mobile photo album, TikTok and other applications to facilitate your life; 235mAh large capacity battery, low power consumption, 10 days standby, 2-3 days of daily use, long-lasting battery life.\n• ??Activity Tracker Watch & 28 Sports Modes?The smart watch for Android phones and iOS phones has professional sports data such as accurate recording of mileage, steps, calories, etc. to analyze, improve and improve exercise efficiency; 28 sports modes, professional sports data analysis allows you to better understand your exercise.\n• ?????Heart Rate Monitor & Sleep Monitor?Smart watch compatible with Android built-in optical heart rate sensor, combined with intelligent heart rate algorithm, pay attention to your heart rate changes 24 hours a day, whether it is resting heart rate or exercise heart rate can be accurately monitored; Track sleep quality: deep sleep, light sleep, wake up. Generate professional sleep monitoring reports to help you develop a healthy biological cloc', 0, 0, 0),
('533d6068-4301-4b1f-8354-a27d9108cc1f', 'VNT-WTC-0021', 'CASIO WATCH', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 14, NULL, 38, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-825.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-399.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-029.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-705.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-507.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-031.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-watch-440-531.jpg"]', 'CASIO WATCH', 'Specifications:\n• Brand: Casio\n• Gender: Men\n• A simple, easy-to-use design\n• Date display at 3 o’clock\n• Mineral Glass\n• Case / bezel: Ion plated\n• PU Leather Band\n• Tang Buckle\n• Regular timekeeping\n• Analog: 3 hands (hour, minute, second)\n• Accuracy: ±20 seconds per month\n• Approx. battery life: 3 years on SR626SW\n• Module 5058\n• Case size (L× W× H): 49 × 45 × 10.3 mm\n• Weight: 70 g\n• 50-meter water resistance\n• Japan Movement', 0, 0, 0),
('2be93a64-76fb-4da1-9832-dd9c2484283c', 'VNT-WTC-0022', 'heino teko watch 4 pro', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 104, 87, 39, '["#78350F","#F59E0B","#FDE68A"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rw-4-pro-smart-watch-431-192.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/rw-4-pro-smart-watch-431-066.jpg"]', 'heino teko watch 4 pro', 'Product Name:\nRW4 Pro Smart Watch\nFeatures:\n• Elegant Design: Sleek, lightweight, and durable with a customizable watch face and strap options.\n• High-Resolution Display: Crisp, vibrant touchscreen with excellent readability in various lighting conditions.\n• Health Monitoring: Advanced sensors for tracking heart rate, blood pressure, SpO2 levels, and sleep patterns.\n• Fitness Tracking: Multi-sport modes, step counter, calorie tracker, and GPS for accurate activity monitoring.\n• Connectivity: Seamless integration with smartphones via Bluetooth, allowing call and message notifications, music control, and app alerts.\n• Long Battery Life: Up to 10 days of use on a single charge, with fast charging capabilities.\n• Water-Resistant: IP68 rating ensures protection against water and dust, suitable for swimming and outdoor activities.\n• Smart Features: Voice assistant support, weather updates, remote camera control, and find my phone functionality.\n• Compatibility: Works with both Android and iOS devices.\n• User-Friendly Interface: Intuitive navigation and easy-to-use companion app for personalizing settings and tracking progress', 0, 0, 1),
