('6a723d63-7b9f-40d7-b32a-cff8288a7bea', 'VNT-WTC-0024', 'Casio Men\'s Watch AMW-880D-9AVDF', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 39, NULL, 41, '["#18181B","#71717A","#E4E4E7"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-146.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-501.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-138.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-825.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-862.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-159.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/casio-men-s-watch-amw-880d-9avdf-420-390.jpg"]', 'Casio Men\'s Watch AMW-880D-9AVDF', 'Metal-clad with a pop of color — a sporty design with a distinctive dial. With water resistance up to 50 meters, ten-year battery life, stopwatch, calendar, and world time, these beautiful watches totally deliver on function, too. The Telememo 30 function, which stores up to 30 telephone numbers right on the watch, keeps the numbers you need handy. LED light ensures high visibility and an easy read.', 1, 0, 0),
