('919d7c24-9b42-407d-8d7c-db73b61aeb3e', 'VNT-WTC-0029', 'Heart Shaped Bracelet Watch Band', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 37, 29, 46, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heart-shaped-bracelet-watch-band-328-089.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heart-shaped-bracelet-watch-band-328-490.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/heart-shaped-bracelet-watch-band-328-702.jpg"]', 'Heart Shaped Bracelet Watch Band', 'Charming Heart Design: Adorn your wrist with a bracelet band featuring delicate heart-shaped links.\n•  Sophisticated Elegance: A stunning accessory that combines functionality with a romantic flair.\n•  Secure Clasp: Sturdy closure ensures your watch stays in place all day long.\n•  Adjustable Fit: Easily customize the length for a comfortable, snug fit.\n•  Universal Compatibility: Designed to fit most traditional and smartwatch models.\n•  Perfect Gift Idea: A thoughtful present for anniversaries, birthdays, or any special occasion.\n•  Versatile Style: Suitable for both casual wear and formal events.', 0, 0, 0),
('0ba18c8f-887c-4f2a-a5c7-a3768fa02e54', 'VNT-WTC-0030', 'Zikr Ring', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 32, NULL, 47, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-475.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-689.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-522.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-726.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-934.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/zikr-ring-205-326.jpg"]', 'Zikr Ring', 'Introducing the Zikr Ring – the world\'s smallest smart ring with a display function.\nBluetooth Connectivity: Seamlessly connects to Qibla Watch and smartphones, bringing convenience to your fingertips.\nPrayer Times Reminders: Receive up to 5 prayer time reminders through Zikr Ring, Qibla Watch, or your smartphone.\nOLED Display: Experience exceptional image quality and energy efficiency with the OLED screen, enhancing your visual experience.\nTasbeeh Counter: Effortlessly track and log your daily tasbeeh counts with the built-in tasbeeh counter – wherever and whenever.\nLarge Capacity Battery: Empowered by a high-capacity battery, the Zikr Ring delivers 3 days of normal use. Charge it effortlessly through USB cable from an adaptor, power bank, or computer.\nElevate your connection with modern technology and timeless traditions with the Zikr1 Lite Ring.\nStyle: Modern\nColor: Black\nScreen Size: 2 Centimeters', 0, 0, 1),
