('90c93e16-e47d-4048-983c-7080cfd34b11', 'VNT-GAM-0011', 'Dancing Cactus Toy', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 12, 10, 54, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/dancing-cactus-toy-634-570.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/dancing-cactus-toy-634-274.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/dancing-cactus-toy-634-845.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/dancing-cactus-toy-634-666.jpg"]', 'Dancing Cactus Toy', 'Mimicking Cactus Toy:\n• This battery-operated dancing cactus toy is a delight for children, singing multiple cheerful songs and mimicking speech, creating a joyful experience.\nRepeat Cactus Toy/Talking Cactus Toy:\n• Functions include Recording, Repeating, Glowing, Talking, Wiggle, Mimicking, Singing, and Dancing. The dancing cactus can repeat what you say, light up, and sing songs. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.\nTalking Cactus Toy Operation Process:\n• At the bottom, remove the screw with a screwdriver, install 3 AA batteries, and tighten the screw. The black button at the bottom turns it ON.\n• Press the label button on the cactus to make it sing.\n• Press repeatedly to switch between 100 songs.\n• Left label: Long press to record (up to 15 seconds) and press to play the recorded sound. Right label: Press to play music; you can record after the song is paused.\nRepeat Dancing Cactus Plush in Pot:\n• Electronic shake dancing cactus plush that repeats, talks, and dances, making it a perfect accessory for home decoration, parties, and early childhood education.', 0, 0, 0),
