('430380d8-7633-4275-92f9-14d9a59eebae', 'VNT-GAM-0028', 'Remote Control Airplane', 'VANTA GAM', 'gaming', 40, NULL, 71, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-842.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-102.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-194.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-546.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-076.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/remote-control-airplane-155-716.jpg"]', 'Remote Control Airplane', 'LIGHTWEIGHT & EASY TO FLY Our RC plane is constructed from light and flexible EPP foam material, making it easy for beginners to handle. With two simple take-off methods - ground glide and manual - even novices can enjoy flying. The silicone protection on the nose cushions shocks, while the EPP body ensures resilience to impacts and drops.\nSMART BALANCE & EASY TO CONTROL Featuring a built-in gyroscope automatic stabilization system, our RC Airplane offers stable flight performance. If the airplane is on the verge of losing control, simply release the throttle, and it will automatically return to a stable flight state. This user-friendly design allows children and beginners to operate it with ease.\nLONG DISTANCE REMOTE CONTROL Equipped with a 2.4GHz radio control system, our remote control plane ensures stable signal transmission and unaffected flight performance.\nMORE LONGER FLYING, MORE FUN Our remote control plane comes with a 300mAh large-capacity battery, providing up to 15 minutes of flight time on a single charge. Recharging takes only 30 minutes, and the rechargeable battery can be replaced for extended fun. The plane is powered by high-speed hollow cup motors, enabling faster spins, lower energy consumption, and longer flights.\n• Lighterweight Body.\n• Long Endurance.\n• Crash Resistance.\n• 2.4 GHS Signal Stability.\n• Multi-Directional Control.\n• The Remote Control Needs 3 1.5 AAA Batteries.', 0, 0, 1),
