tour to your shape without restricting movement or requiring you to sleep in a certain position\n• 【Premium Memory Foam】: Reduce Back, Hip, Leg, Knee & Sciatica Nerve Discomfort Alleviate hip, leg, and knee pain with the Comfort Memory Foam Knee Pillow and get the best sleep of your life. The knee pillow is made with 100% premium quality memory foam. Superior to other pillows it won\'t go flat over time', 1, 0, 0),
