r those who live an active lifestyle.\n• SAFETY & SMART? - Safety is paramount with our cupping set. It features an automatic countdown timer and flameless operation for risk-free use. The innovative Bianstone conductive heating stone provides gentle warmth without the risk of burns, ensuring a safe and soothing experience.\n• EASY TO USE & MAINTAIN? - Our vacuum therapy machine is designed for simplicity and easy maintenance, featuring an LED display and four intuitive buttons. Especially suitable for beginners and the elderly. Note: Initial use may cause slight soreness and bruising; start with lower intensity if new to cupping therapy.', 0, 0, 0),
