oss. Weighing just 2.2 kg (4.85 lbs), it is particularly lightweight.\n• ?Versatile Use?This high-pressure water sprayer is suitable for various applications, including car washing, watering garden plants, cleaning floors, and washing carpets or windows. Different uses can select different spray nozzle modes', 0, 1, 0),
