/ iPhone 14 / 14 Plus / 14 Pro / 14 Pro Max / iPhone 13 / 13 Mini / 13 Pro / 13 Pro Max / iPhone 12 / 12 Mini / 12 Pro / 12 Pro Max / iPhone 11 / 11 Pro / 11 Pro Max, 12.9 / 11 inch / Air / Pro / Mini, Max, MacBook Pro 14 inch / MacBook Pro 16 inch / MacBook Air / MacBook Pro 13 inch ThinkPad, Dell XPS, Latitude, Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra S23 S22/ S22+ / S22 Ultra / S21 / S 21 Plus / S21 Ultra Note 20 / Note 20 Ultra / Note 10 / Note 10 Plus / Note 8, Huawei Mate / Huawei Nova Series LG, Google, OnePlus, BLU, Xiaomi\n• ?WHAT YOU GET WITH WARRANTY?: ??You will get a 4 in 1 gold plated USB Type C to Lightning charging cable, backed by a 1-year warranty and exceptional after-sales service, you can trust both the quality of our products and our commitment to your satisfaction.', 0, 0, 0),
