('f8c899e3-d91f-4d3f-a4d3-83cbee08d3bc', 'VNT-WTC-0040', 'Ayatal Kursi Car Holder', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 10, 8, 20, '["#172554","#1E40AF","#60A5FA"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-268.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-847.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-968.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-474.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-631.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-986.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-849.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/ayatal-kursi-car-holder-617-359.jpg"]', 'Ayatal Kursi Car Holder', 'Ayat Ul Kursi Car hanger\nThis lovely version serves as both a fantastic reminder to read AYAT UL KURSI before beginning any journey and a decoration for your car.\nThis popular AYAT UL KURSI car hanger makes a wonderful addition to anyone\'s collection and makes a terrific gift for any special event.\nHandmade item\nMaterials: Stainless steel\nChain style: Rope\nStyle: Minimalist', 0, 1, 0),
('f5b867bd-0b59-4d6d-bba3-f1ddac1460a5', 'VNT-WTC-0041', 'Gold Heart Necklace for Women', 'VANTA WTC', 'watches', 19, 15, 21, '["#451A03","#B45309","#FBBF24"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/gold-heart-necklace-for-women-594-533.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/gold-heart-necklace-for-women-594-880.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/gold-heart-necklace-for-women-594-289.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/gold-heart-necklace-for-women-594-586.jpg"]', 'Gold Heart Necklace for Women', 'Exquisite and stylish jewelry necklace made of high quality, precious 18K gold.\n• The chain design is simple and elegant, using a traditional chain structure, which well sets off the curve of the neck and enhances the beauty of the overall shape.\n• The length of the necklace is generally 45 cm, which is very suitable for adult women. It can be worn alone or stacked with other necklaces to enhance the overall style.necklaces are often a luxurious gift choice to celebrate special occasions such as birthdays, wedding anniversaries, and Mother\'s Day. It can also be used as a self-reward to show personal preference or social status.', 0, 0, 1),
('d7208489-662c-46ea-aba1-0c322258c496', 'VNT-BTY-0169', '24k GOLDZAN AMPOULE 99.9% Pure Gold Serum', 'VANTA BTY', 'beauty', 11, NULL, 22, '["#0F172A","#334155","#94A3B8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/24k-goldzan-ampoule-99-9--pure-gold-serum-635-695.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/24k-goldzan-ampoule-99-9--pure-gold-serum-635-065.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/24k-goldzan-ampoule-99-9--pure-gold-serum-635-081.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/24k-goldzan-ampoule-99-9--pure-gold-serum-635-497.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/24k-goldzan-ampoule-99-9--pure-gold-serum-635-691.jpg"]', '24k GOLDZAN AMPOULE 99.9% Pure Gold Serum', 'Helps with darkspots dark marks\n• imidiate brightness and glow\n• 20 ml and 100 ml', 0, 0, 0),
('01db258c-03af-4d8e-b2d7-f17c051ac5a8', 'VNT-FSH-0001', 'AI Smart Glasses with 8MP Camera', 'VANTA FSH', 'fashion', 115, 90, 23, '["#1E293B","#3B82F6","#93C5FD"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/g5_6aa21fb20c248.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/g4_6aa21fb20ebc6.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/g3_6aa21fb2128bb.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/g2_6aa21fb216a35.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/g1_6aa21fb218330.jpg"]', 'AI Smart Glasses with 8MP Camera', '8MP HD CAMERA: Capture stunning photos and record Full HD 1080P videos at 30FPS hands-free for creators and vloggers on the go\n• AI VOICE ASSISTANT & TRANSLATION: Control functions effortlessly with voice commands and translate multiple languages in real-time for travel and meetings\n• FAST WIFI CONNECTIVITY & STEREO SOUND: Stay connected with fast WiFi for easy file transfer and enjoy premium open-ear stereo audio for music and calls\n• 3 INTERCHANGEABLE LENS SETS: Comes with clear, sunglass, and blue light lens sets, making these glasses versatile for indoor, outdoor, and screen use\n• STYLISH & LIGHTWEIGHT DESIGN: Modern, comfortable frame designed for all-day wear, suitable for students, professionals, commuters, and remote workers alike\n• HANDS-FREE CONTENT CREATION: Record videos and take photos without using your hands, allowing you to document experiences while staying fully engaged in activities\n• OPEN-EAR AUDIO TECHNOLOGY: Experience high-quality stereo sound through open-ear speakers that allow ambient awareness while enjoying music or taking calls', 1, 0, 0),
('91147004-20e4-4619-a472-f3dbd74aa843', 'VNT-FSH-0002', 'Adjustable Tint Sunglasses', 'VANTA FSH', 'fashion', 39, 30, 24, '["#065F46","#10B981","#A7F3D0"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/51vrHPEKFuL._AC_SX679__6a8353e0d3a0e.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/61LPpvgZEtL._AC_SX569__6a8353e0d4792.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/71haa80hHVL._AC_SX569__6a8353e0d50e7.jpg"]', 'Adjustable Tint Sunglasses', '1. Steampunk Adaptive Shade System Gear-operated tint control (1-9 settings) with brass knurled dials adjusts from light amber to near-black. Industrial-grade polarized lenses block 100% UVA/B/C + HEV, featuring exposed "pressure gauge" style intensity indicators.\n• 2. Retro-Futuristic Optical Armor Hand-riveted zinc alloy frame with distressed copper plating and functional gear detailing. Lenses integrate ND8-ND128 variable filtration, achieving MIL-STD-810G optical clarity even in desert/snow glare.\n• 3. Biomechanical Comfort Fit Spring-loaded temple arms with leather-wrapped memory alloy cores adapt to head shapes (fits 54-61cm). Interchangeable nose bridge kits (steel mesh/brass studs) prevent slippage during active use.\n• 4. Victorian-Tech Aesthetics Artisan-crafted with watch movement-inspired side shields and monocle-inspired single-lens flip mechanism. Available in Copper Cog/Smoke Gear/Obsidian Steam color schemes.\n• 5. Explorer-Ready Kit Includes aged leather folio case with telescopic lens cleaner and anti-tarnish polishing cloth. Includes distressed leather case with brass buckles', 0, 0, 0),
('0583481f-177e-4b39-b9f0-c765cd6573da', 'VNT-FSH-0003', 'Sweat Sauna Suits Weight Loss Men and Women', 'VANTA FSH', 'fashion', 22, NULL, 25, '["#831843","#EC4899","#FBCFE8"]', '["https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1759431831_8dbdcd918b8d6ba29f05.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/q1_68decc5345d52.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1759431824_c77b63c3050fac78f652.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1759431827_3d068b4d2e14ae5f8650.jpg","https://new.arabiadropship.com/public/assets/images/products/1759431835_40615fea939f09e5c349.jpg"]', 'Sweat Sauna Suits Weight Loss Men and Women', '[Material]： Made from high quality PVC, wear-resistant, water-proof, wind-proof. Very soft material, very comfortable, skin-friendly.\n• [Design]: Elastic waist, cuffs and ankles, neck design makes more persons fit the suits in different figures and enhance sauna effect, Increases sweat output by up to 80%.\n• [Weight loss]: All the openings in the suit set elastically designed can keep gathering the thermal temperature, beneficial to sweating rapidly, finally achieving the effect of weight loss.\n• [Light weight]: As the material is ultrathin, the sauna suits are super weight light. The loose version frees more room for you to exercise, no matter you are running, cycling, jogging, yoga, playing dumbbells, boxing, etc, you will not feel restrained and tight. In the whole exercise process, your body is in the condition of comfort.\n• [Functional]: The sauna suits are designed for men and women both. Just choose the right size for you. We offer XXL and 3XL size in silver and black for the functional sweat suits. The sealed PVC material helps you increase the metabolism in your body, burn more fat, remove toxins from the body, and promote faster weight loss.', 0, 1, 1);
